<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">- POGORO Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Lyanjiru</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Lyanjiru</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lyanjiru</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lya</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Lyamjiru</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOLERI</para>
  <para style="ip">Shisoweru Lyanjiru mana yakuyi “Lyanjiru” na ndo shitabu sha kwanja mulipanuta ligona lya Biblia. Shanjiru shakuyi Shiebrania, ndo shanju sha shisoweru “Shisoweru sha lyanjiru” Shilanguziya kila shintu kwashilawiti na asa Mlungu katenda ashi kuusu kumnyawa muntu. Wafunda wa mashaka ganu wana malembu gavuwa kuusu muntu yakalembiti Lyanjiru na viraa shaka shakalembiti. Wantu wamu wajimiriti handa wavipatiti kulawa mumashaka magona ulagilagi kulawa shinja sha 5-6 pamberi pa B.C mu Babeli. Wamonga wajimiliti handa Musa kalembiti Lyanjiru, viraa na Kulawa na Walanga na Maholu ga shaka, kulawa 1300 ama 1400 vinja B.C Lyanjiru lijega visoweru vya mana viwatanga wakristu kuyimana Biblia yoseri Lipatanu Ligona na Lipanu lya Syayi. Itulanguziya kwa ntambu gaa vidoda vitangala pasipanu na wantu wafira kuwalopola na itulanguziya mipangu ya Mlungu ya kuwalopola wantu. Ayi tuweza kuyiwona kulawa muwiwuku wa kwanja kuusu Yesu Lyanjiru 3:15 na Mlungu kamgambiriti Abrahamu kutekelera pasi panu poseri Lyanjiru 12:3</para>
  <para style="iot">YAGAWERAAMU</para>
  <para style="io">Mlungu kanyawiti pasipanu, Adamu na Eva ilonga mushipandi sha 1 na 2 2</para>
  <para style="io">Kulawa shipandi 5 shimtakulira Adamu na Eva na vidoda vyawu na mwiwuku gwawu.</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha sita kulawa msitali gwa 9 shitakulira kuusu Nuhu na lilawa likulu.</para>
  <para style="io">Shakapanu shitabu sha lyanjiru shitakulira shashilawiriti pakati pa shipindi sha Nuhu na shipindi sha Abrahamu, shitakulira shindwalingu sha Babeli mushipandi sha 10 na 11</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha 12 kulawa 50 shiyowelera kuusu Abrahamu na kaya yakuyi na kwanja isi yakuyi ya Israeli kalikaliti na mdala gwakuyi Sara iyowelera</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha 12 mpaka 25 B Walikaliti Isaka na mdala gwakuyi Rebeka shiyowelera mushipandi sha 21 mpaka 28 shiyowelera, mlandu gwa kuhowa mushipandi sha 35 C Kulikala kwa Yakobu na mwana mpalu na wawukiti kulawa Kanani mpaka Misri yamushipandi 25 mpaka 50 D</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha 37 mpaka 50 shiyowelera kulikala kwa Yakobu na mwana gwakuyi yakamfira Yosefu na ntambu gaa kaweriti mlonguziya gwa Misri.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s">Kunyawiwa pasipanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Palupaga palii Mlungu kanyawiti kumpindi na pasipanu. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Pasipanu paweriti pavuluvulu na paweriti pahera shintu shoseri. Ntiti igubikiti matiwa ga mashi na Rohu ya Mlungu kaweriti katamira pamashi.<verse eid="GEN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Mlungu katakula, “Ulangala uweri,” na ulangala uwera, <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Mlungu kauwona ulangala kuwera uherepa, shakapanu Mlungu katula gweka ulangala na ntiti. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />Ulangala kaushema “Paliwala” na ntiti kaishema “Pashiru.” Iwera pamihi iwera mandawira, lishaka lya kwanja.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Mlungu katakula, “kuweri na lupenyu pamashi kutula gweka mashi ga kulyera na mashi ga pasi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Su Mlungu katenda lupenyu kutula gweka mashi yagawera kulyera na mashi yagawera pasi. Iweriti hangu. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Mlungu kalushema lupenyu alu “Lyera.” Iwera pamihi iwera mandawira, lishaka lya pili.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Mlungu kutakula, “Mashi yagaweriti pasi pa lyera galijojonili pahala pamuhera” paweri na pahala payuma. Su iweriti hangu. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Mlungu kapashema pahala papayumiti “Isi” na pahala papajojonikiti mashi kapashema “Bahari.” Mlungu kawona kuwera iherepa. <verse eid="GEN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Shakapanu Mlungu katakula, “Isi imeriziyi vimeru: vimeru vyavilera mbeyu na mitera yailera mabwajubwaju yagawera na mbeyu ya ntambu yakuwi.” Su iweriti hangu. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Su isi imeriziya vimeru, mitera yailera mbeyu ya ntambu yakuwi na mitera yailera mabwajubwaju yagawera na mbeyu ya ntambu yakuwi. Mlungu kawona kuwera iherepa. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Iwera pamihi, iwera mandawira, lishaka lya ntatu.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Mlungu katakula, “Iweri vimiliku kulyera su vitulwi gweka paliwala na pashiru, yeni iweri shilangaliru sha kumaniziya vyaka vya ntambu yingiyingi, mashaka na mivinja, <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />na viweri vimiliku kulyera na vilangaliri pasipanu.” Su iweriti hangu. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Su Mlungu kanyawa mimiliku mikulu miwili, yaiwera na ulangala mkulu yagushemwa mshenji ikolimlima paliwala, na yauwera na ulangala mdidini yaushemitwi lyezi ukolimlima pashiru. Kayi Mlungu kanyawiti ntondu. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Mlungu kavitula kulyera vilangaliri pasipanu, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />vikolimlima pashiru na paliwala na vitulwi gweka ulangala na ntiti. Mlungu kawona kuwera iherepa. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Iweriti pamihi, iwera mandawira lishaka lya msheshi.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Mlungu kutakula, “Mumashi kuweri na viwumbi vikomu vivuwa na wampongu waguluki kulyera.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Su Mlungu kaviwumba viwumbi wakulu wa mubahari na kila shiwumbi shikomu shashigendagenda mumashi, kulawirana na ntambu zyakuwi na kila ntambu ya mpongu. Su Mlungu kawona iherepa. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />“Mlungu kavitekelera kalonga, mleri mwongereki muimemisiyi bahari, na wampongu wongereki mupasipanu.” <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Iweriti pamihi, iwera mandawira, lishaka lyaka muhanu.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Mlungu katakula, “Isi lilaviyi viwumbi vikomu kulawirana na ntambu zyakuwi, wankanyama wa kulolerwa na viumbi vyawakwawakwawa na wankanyama wa kuntundu wa kila ntambu.” Su iweriti hangu. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Mlungu kaumbiti ntambu zoseri za wankanyama wa kuntundu na wankanyama wa kulolerwa na viumbi vyoseri vyavikwawakwawa. Su kaloliti vyoseri vyakatenditi na kuwona iherepa.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Mlungu kutakula, “Tuwaumbi wantu kwa mfanu gwetu na kwa sheni shetu, wakakolimlima wasomba mubahari na wampongu wa kulyera na wankanyama wa kulolerwa, pasipanu poseri na viumbi vyoseri vyavikwawakwawa mulitapaka.” <verse eid="GEN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Su Mlungu kamuwumba muntu kwa mfanu gwakuyi mweni, kwa mfanu gwa Mlungu kamuwumbiti mpalu na mdala. <verse eid="GEN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Mlungu kawatekelera na kawagambira, “Mleri na mwongereki, mwakaimemiziyi isi na kuikolamlima; muwakolimlima wasomba wa mubahari na wampongu wa kulyera na kila shiwumbi shikomu shashigendagenda pasipanu. <verse eid="GEN 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Shakapanu Mlungu katakula, niwapanani mwenga kila shimeru shashilera mbeyu pasipanu poseri na kila mtera yaguwera na mabwajubwaju yagawera na mbeyu. Haviweri shiboga kwa mwenga <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />na kwa wankanyama woseri wa pasipanu na wampongu woseri wa kulyera na viumbi vyoseri vyavigendagenda paisi. Kila shiumbi shashiwera na upumula wa ukomu, shiboga shau hashiweri mahamba goseri ga vimeru.” Su iweriti hangu. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Mlungu kawona kila shintu shakawumbiti shiwera shiherepa nentu. Su iwera pamihi, iwera mandawira, lishaka lya sita.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Su kunyawuwa kwa kumpindi na pasipanu pamuhera na vyoseri vyaviweramu vimalirikiti. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Lishaka lya saba Mlungu kamaliriti kala lihengu lyakuyi lyoseri lyakatenditi, su mulishaka lya saba ali Mlungu koyera pakamaliliti lihengu lyakuyi lyoseri lyakatenditi. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Mlungu kalitekelera lishaka lya saba na kulitenda liweri linanagala, toziya Mlungu koyeriti pakamaliti lihengu lyoseri lya kuumba lyakalitenditi.<verse eid="GEN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu na Hawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Hangu ndo ntambu kumpindi na pasipanu papaumbituwi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Mtuwa Mlungu pakaumbiti kumpindi na pasipanu, <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />paweriti ndiri na vimeru paisi na mitera itomoriti ndiri toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kayitoweriti ndiri nvula, na paweriti ndiri muntu gwa kulima. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Kumbiti mashi galawiti muisi galowiziya litapaka lyoseri.<verse eid="GEN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kamuwumba mpalu kwa litapaka, kampulilira mumpula upumula wa ukomu na mpalu ayu kawera shiwumbi shikomu.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu katenda shiwunga kwakulawira mshenji, pahala pa Edeni na aku kamtula mpalu yakamuumbiti. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />Mtuwa Mlungu kameriziya kulawa mulitapaka kila ntambu ya mitera iherepa yayilera mabwajubwaju ga kuliya. Pakati pa shiwunga ashi paweriti na mtera gwa ukomu na mtera gwa kuvimana maheri na madoda. <verse eid="GEN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Kuweriti na lushemba kulawa aku Edeni lwalunyinyirikiti na kulowiziya shiwunga ashi, lushemba alu lulekanika luwera nshemba za msheshi. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Lushemba lwa kwanja lushemuwa Pishoni, lushemba alu lutindira isi yoseri ya Hawila kwakuweriti na zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Zahabu ya isi ayi iherepa nentu. Aku vilaa kwana utuli yawaushema bedola na mabuwi ga beyi nkulu gawagashema shohamu. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Lushemba lwa pili lushemuwa Gihoni, alu lunyinyirika isi yoseri ya Kushi. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Litawu lya lushemba lwa ntatu lushemuwa Tigilisi, na lunyinyirikia kugenda uwega wa Ashuru kwagulawa mshenji. Na litawu lya lushemba lwa msheshi lushemuwa Eufrati.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kamtola mpalu ayu kamtula mushiwunga sha Edeni, kalimi na kaloleri weri. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti mpalu ayu, “Guweza kuliya mabwajubwaju ga mtera goseri mushiwunga, <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />kumbiti mabwajubwaju ga mtera gwa kumana maherepa na ukondora, naguliya toziya lishaka pagulia mabwajubwaju ga mtera, nakaka haguhowi.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga, “Iherepa ndiri mpalu ayu kuwera gweka yakuwi, hanimtenderi muyaguwi gwa kumfaa.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Su kulawa mulitapaka, Mtuwa Mlungu kaumba kila nkanyama gwa kuntundu na kila mpongu gwa kulyera. Shakapanu kawajega kwa mpalu ayu su kawapanani matawu na matawu gakavipananiti viwumbi avi gawera ndo matawu gawu. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Su mpalu ayu kawapanana matawu wankanyama woseri wa kulolerwa na wa kuntundu na wampongu woseri wa kulyera. Kumbiti kapatikaniti ndiri muyaguwi gwa kumfaa mpalu ayu.<verse eid="GEN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu katenditi mpalu ayu kagonji mpota nkulu na pakaweriti mumpota, Mlungu katola luwavu lumu lwa muntu ayu na pahala palii pawawusiyiti luwavu kapagubika kwa shinofu. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamuwumba mdala kulawa muluwavu lyalulaviyitwi kwa mpalu ulii, kamjega kwa mpalu ulii. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Su mpalu ulii kalikangasha na kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">“Yina, ayu ndo shifupa kulawa mumafupa ganeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">na shinofu kulawa muvinofu mwaneni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">Na ayu hakashemwi mdala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">Toziya kalaviyitwi kulawa kwa mpalu.” <verse eid="GEN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Toziya ayi mpalu hakawaleki tati gwakuyi na mawu gwakuyi na hakalimamatiri na mdala gwakuyi na womberi wawili hawaweri nshimba yimu. <verse eid="GEN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Mpalu na mdala gwakuyi woseri waweriti shivula hera kumbiti wawoniti ndiri soni.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s">Vidoda vya muntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Njoka kaweriti mshengeta kuliku wankanyama woseri wa kuntundu yawawumbitwi na Mlungu. Su njoka kamgambira mdala ayu, “Eti Mlungu katakuliti namuliya mabwajubwaju ga mtera goseri gwa mushiwunga?”<verse eid="GEN 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Mdala kamwankula njoka ulii, “Tuweza kuliya mabwajubwaju ga mtera goseri mushiwunga, <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />kumbiti Mlungu katugambiriti natuliya mabwajubwaju ga mtera gwa pakati pa shiwunga, ama natuushinkula, patutenda hangu hatuhowi.”<verse eid="GEN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Njoka kamgambira mdala, “Ndala, hapeni muhowi nakamu! <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Kumbiti Mlungu katakuliti hangu toziya kavimana kuwera pamliya mabwajubwaju ga mtera agu masu genu hagavugulwi na hamulifani na Mlungu, hamuvimani maheri na makondora.”<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Su mdala pakawoniti kuwera mtera agu gufaa kwa shiboga, guherepeziya mumasu na gufaa kwa kupata luhala, kapa mabwajubwaju gamu kaliya. Kampanana na mpalu gwakuyi, yomberi vulaa kaliya. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Palaa palii woseri masu gawu gavuguka, wayambuliti kuwera washivula, su walisonera mihamba ya mtera gwa tini, walinyawira na kuligubika mshunu.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Mushaka sha pamihi, Adamu pamuhera na mdala gwakuyi wampikaniriti Mlungu kankutyangira mushiwunga, su womberi walififiti pakati pamitera mushiwunga. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kamkosiyiti Adamu, “Gwakoshi?” <verse eid="GEN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Yomberi kamuwankula, “Nikupikanira gwankutyanga mushiwunga, ntira toziya nashivula hera, su nilififa.”<verse eid="GEN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Mlungu kamkosiya, “Gaa yakakugambiriti gwashivula? Hashi, guliya libwajubwaju lya mtera gwanikuleweriti naguliya?”<verse eid="GEN 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Mpalu ayu kawankula, “Mdala yagumpananiti kalikali pamuhera na neni ndo yakampananiti mabwajubwaju gamu ga mtera agu na neni ndiya.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamkosiya mdala ulii, “Ashi ndo shishi shagutenditi gwenga?” Mdala kamwankula, “Njoka kanzyanga na neni ndiya.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankutoza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira njoka, “Toziya gutenda hangu, nikupangila gwenga pakati pa wankanyama woseri wa kulolerwa na kuliku wankanyama woseri wa kuntundu. Hagugendigendi kwa kukwawa kwa mtima gwaku na haguliyi lidika mashaka goseri ga makaliru gaku. <verse eid="GEN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Hantuli ungondu pakati paku na mdala ayu, pakati pa ulera waku na ulera wa mdala ayu, yomberi hakakutiligili mtuwi gwaku na gwenga hagumlumi shisiginu shakuwi.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Kayi kamgambira mdala, “Hanikongeri utama wa kuyuwula, na kwa kutama hagwiwuli mwana, pamuhera na hangu haguweri na mata kwa mpalu gwaku, na yomberi hakakukolimlima.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Shakapanu kamgambira Adamu, “toziya gwenga gumpikanira mdala gwaku, guliya mabwajubwaju ga mtera gwanikuleweriti naguliya, su nilipangira litapaka toziya ya gwenga, hagutendi lihengu likamala mumakaliru gaku goseri kupata shiboga shakuliya.<verse eid="GEN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Litapaka halimerisiyi misontu na magugu na haguliyi vya mumalambu. <verse eid="GEN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Kwa livuki na kutenda lihengu likamala haguliyi shiboga shaku mpaka paguwuya mulitapaka, toziya gwenga gwalitapaka, mulitapaka gulawiti na mulitapaka haguwuyi.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Adamu kampanana mdala gwakuyi litawu hawa toziya mekaweri mawu gwa wantu woseri yawawuyikiti. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawanyawira Adamu na mdala gwakuyi nguwu za lukuli lwa wankanyama, kawavalasiya.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlungu kawawinga Adamu na Hawa mushiwunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga, “Vinu muntu kawera gambira yumu gwetu, kamana maheri na makondora. Tufiruwa ndiri kumleka kagugenderi mtera gwa ukomu na kwapa libwajubwaju kaliyi na kulikala mashaka goseri.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Su Mtuwa Mlugu kamuwinga Adamu kagendi kunja kwa shiwunga sha Edeni, su kalimi litapaka lyawamlaviyiti. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Pakamuwingiti kala Adamu, kamtuliti ntumintumi gwa kumpindi uwega wa kwagulawira mshenji mushiwunga sha Edeni na ligumba lya motu lyaligalambuka galambuka aku na aku, kulolera njira yaigendera mumtera gwa ukomu.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s">Kaini na Abeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Adamu kamumana Hawa mdala gwakuyi na yomberi kapata yinda kamlera Kaini. Hawa kalonga, “Mpata mwana mpalu kwa utanga wa Mtuwa Mlungu!” <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Shakapanu kamlera mwana yumonga litawu lyakuyi Abeli. Abeli kaweriti mlolera wa wakondolu na Kaini kaweriti mlimi. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Mushaka shamu, Kaini kamlaviliriti Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku kulawa muviboga vya malambu. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Na Abeli kamlavilira Mlungu tambiku musemu ya walera wa kwanja wa wakondolu wakuyi na vinofu viherepa. Mtuwa Mlungu kaherepeziwa na Abeli pamuhera na tambiku yakuwi <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />kumbiti kaherepeziwitwi ndiri na Kaini pamuhera na tambiku yakuwi. Su Kaini kakalala nentu na sheni shakuwi shiwera na ntita. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Kaini, “Iwera hashi gukalala, iwera hashi sheni shaku shiwera na ntita? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Hashi, pagutenda gaherepa hagujimirwi ndiri? Kumbiti pagutenda ndiri gaherepa, su vidoda vyankukunyatira pamlyangu, vyamata kwa gwenga, kumbiti gufiruwa guvikanki.” <verse eid="GEN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Shakapanu, Kaini kamgambiriti Abeli mlongu gwakuyi, “Tugendi kunja kulirambu.” Su pawaweriti kulirambu, Kaini kamkopokera Abeli mlongu gwakuyi, kamlaga.<verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamkosiya Kaini, “Mlongu gwaku Abeli kakoshi?” Kaini kamwankula, “Neni nivimana ndiri! Hashi, neni mlolera gwa mlongu gwangu?”<verse eid="GEN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />Mtuwa Mlungu kakosiya, “Gutenda shishi? Gupikanili! Mwazi gwa mlongu gwaku gwankundilira kulawa mulitapaka. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Vinu nikupangila gwenga! Hapeni gulimi kayi mulitapaka, lyeni liwera gambira mlomu yaguvuguliti kuwanka mwazi gwa mlongu gwaku kulawa muliwoku lyaku. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Pagulima mulitapaka hapeni likupanani mabenu gakuyi. Haguweri muntu gwa kuyerayera, yakahera pahala pa kulikala pasipanu.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Kaini kamgambiriti Mtuwa Mlungu, “Utoza awu mkulu ng'anji, neni weza ndiri kuhepelera. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Guloli, leru guwinga neni kulawa mulitapaka ali, na haweri kutali kwagwenga. Haweri muntu gwa kuyerayera, yakahera pakulikala pasipanu na yoseri yakamona hakanagi.”<verse eid="GEN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Kumbiti Mtuwa kamgambira, “Ndala! Yakafira kukulaga gwenga Kaini, hakawuzilirwi mala saba kuliku ayi.” Su Mtuwa Mlungu kamtula Kaini shimaniziwu sha kulishera, su yoseri yakamona nakamlaga. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Shakapanu Kaini kawuka kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, su kagenditi kulikala muisi ya Nodi, uwega wa Edeni kwagulawa mshenji.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walerwa wa Kaini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Kaini kamumana mdala gwakuyi na mdala gwakuyi kapata yinda, kamlera Enoki. Kaini kanjiti kunyawa lushi kalushema litawu lya Enoki mwana gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Enoki kamleriti Iradi, na Iradi kamleriti Mehuyaeli kamleriti Metushaeli na Metushaeli kamleriti Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lameki kayugiti wadala wawili, yumu kamshemiti Ada na yumonga Zila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Ada kamleriti Yabali ulii yakaweriti mbuyi gwa walolera yawalikala muvilingu. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Mlongu gwakuyi kaweriti Yubali ulii yakaweriti mbuyi gwawu wavinamsambu yawagombiti mbalapi na pelembi.<verse eid="GEN 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Zila vilaa kamwiwuliriti Tubali kaini ulii yakaweriti mnyawa vyombu vya shaba na shuma, dada gwakuyi Tubali kaini kaweriti Naama. <verse eid="GEN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Lameki kawagambiriti wadala wakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">“Ada na Zila mpikaniri liziwu lyangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Mpikaniri gantakula mwenga wadala wa Lameki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Neni nagiti muntu kwa kumtenduwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">yina, nagiti muntemba kwa kuntenda. <verse eid="GEN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Paiwera Kaini hakawuzilirwi mala saba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">na yoseri yakandaga neni Lameki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">yomberi hakawuzilirwi mala malongu saba na saba.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seti na Enoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Adamu kamumana kayi Hawa mdala gwakuyi, na Hawa kamwiwula mwana mpalu, kamshema Seti pakalonga, “Mlungu kampanana mwana pahala pa Abeli yakalagitwi na Kaini.” <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Seti kaweriti na mwana yakamshemiti Enoshi. Mumashaka aga wantu ndo wanjiti kulikwisa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s">Shiyuwuku sha Adamu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:1-4">1 Mirandu 1:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Yawafata ndo shiyiwuku sha Adamu. Shaka Mlungu pakawaumbiti wantu, kawawumbiti walifani na mweni.<verse eid="GEN 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Kawawumbiti mpalu na mdala, shakapanu kawatekelera na kawapanana litawu “Wantu.” <verse eid="GEN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Adamu pakaweriti na mivinja miya yimu na malongu matatu, kampatiti mwana yakalifaniti nayu, sheni gambira shakuwi, kamshemiti Seti. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Pakamleriti kala Seti, Adamu kalikaliti mivinja miya nani na kapatiti wana wamonga wapalu na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Adamu kahowiti pakaweriti na mivinja miya tisa na malongu matatu.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Shaka Seti pakaweriti na vinja miya na muhanu, kamleriti Enoshi. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Pakamleriti kala Enoshi, Seti kalikaliti mivinja miya nane na saba na kapatiti wana wamonga wapalu na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Seti kahowiti pakaweriti na mivinja miya tisa lilongu na mbili.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Shaka Enoshi pakaweriti na mivinja malongu tisa, kamleriti Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Pakamleriti kala Enoshi, yomberi kalikaliti mivinja miya nani na muhanu na kapatiti wana wamonga wapalu na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Enoshi kahowiti pakawera na mivinja miya tisa na muhanu.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Shaka Kanani pakaweriti na mivinja malongu saba, yomberi kamleriti Mahalaleli. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Pakamleriti kala Mahalaleli, Kanani kalikaliti mivinja miya na malongu msheshi na kapatiti wana wamonga wapalu na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Kanani kahowiti pakaweriti na mivinja miya tisa na lilongu.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Shaka Mahalaleli pakaweliti na mivinja malongu na muhanu, yomberi kamleriti Yaredi. <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Pakamleriti kala Yaredi, Mahalaleli kalikaliti mivinja miya nani na malongu matatu na kapatiti wana wapalu na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Mahalaleli kahowiti pakawera na mivinja miya nani na malongu tisa na muhanu. <verse eid="GEN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Shaka Yaredi pakaweriti na mivinja miya yimu na malongu sita na mbili, yomberi kamleriti Henoki. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Pakamleliti kala Henoki, Yeredi kalikaliti mivinja nani na kapatiti wana wamonga wapalu na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Yaredi kahowiti pakawera na mivinja miya tisa na malongu sita na mbili.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Shaka Henoki pakaweriti na mivinja malongu na muhanu, yomberi kamleriti Masusela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Henoki kalikaliti weri kulongolu kwa Mlungu pakamleriti kala Metusela, yomberi kalikaliti mivinja miya ntatu na kapatiti wana wamonga wapalu na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Henoki kalikaliti mivinja miya ntatu na malongu tisa na muhanu. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Yomberi kaweriti kankumguwira Mlungu, su shakapanu kawukiti vumu toziya Mlungu kamnyasuliti.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Shaka Matusela pakaweriti na mivinja miya yimu na malongu manani na saba, yomberi kamwiwuliriti Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Metusela pakamwiyuriti kala Lameki, Matusela kalikaliti mivinja miya saba na malongu nani na mbili na kapatiti wana wamonga wapalu na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Matusela kahowiti pakaweriti na mivinja miya tisa na malongu sita na tisa.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Shaka Lameki pakaweriti na mivinja miya yimu na malongu nani na mbili, yomberi kamleriti mwana mpalu. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Yomberi kamshemiti Nuhu pakalonga, “Mwana ayu ndo yakatufaliji kulawirana na lihengu lyetu likamala lyatutenda kwa mawoku getu mulitapaka lyakalipangiliti Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Pakwiyuka kala Nuhu, Lameki kalikaliti mivinja miya muhanu na malongu tisa na muhanu, na kapatiti wana wamonga wapalu na wadala. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Lameki kahowiti pakawera na mivinja miya saba na malongu saba na saba.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Nuhu pakaweriti na mivinja miya muhanu, yomberi kamleriti Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s">Mashi gavuwa makulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Wantu pawendereiti kwongereka pasipanu na kwiyura wahinga, <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />wana wapalu wa Mlungu wawoniti wahinga wana wa wantu kuwera waherepa, wawayugiti womberi yawawafiriti su waweri wadala wawu. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Shakapanu Mtuwa katakuliti, “Rohu ya neni hapeni ilikali mngati mwa wantu mashaka goseri, toziya womberi muntu gwa kuhowa hera. Su wantu hapeni walikali nentu ya mivinja miya yimu na ishilini.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Mumashaka galii na ata shakapanu, mikambaku yawashemitwi Wanefili waweriti pasipanu, yawaweriti walerwa wa wana wapalu wa Mlungu yawayugiti wahinga wana wa wantu. Womberi waweriti mikambaku na wamanikiti nentu mumashaka galii.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu pakawoniti ukondola wa wantu uvuwa pasipanu na kuwera kila lakaliholiti muntu mumoyu mwakuyi, liweriti likondola kila shaka, <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />Mtuwa kahinginikiti nentu kwa kumuwumba muntu pasipanu. Moyu gwakuyi gumtamiti kwa hinginika, <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />su katakuliti, “Hanimwagamiziyi nakamu wantu woseri yaniwawumbiti pasipanu, haniwagamiziyi nakamu vulaa wankanyama wa kuntundu, viumbi vyavikwawakwawa mulitapaka na wampongu wa kulyera. Nankuhinginika toziya niwawumbiti pasipanu.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Kumbiti Nuhu kapatiti upendeleu kulawa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Avi ndo visoweru vyavimuusu Nuhu. Nuhu kaweriti muheri na kaweriti kahera vidoda pakati pa wantu mumashaka gakuyi, yomberi kamjimiriti Mlungu. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Nuhu kaweriti na wana watatu; Shemu na Hamu na Yafati. <verse eid="GEN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Mlungu kawoniti pasipanu pawera padoda na kumema wantu yawahera lusungu. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Mlungu kawoniti pasipanu pawera padoda nakamu, toziya wantu woseri walikaliti makaliru ga ukondola.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Mlungu kamgambira Nuhu, “Neni nankugenda kuwagamiziya nakamu wantu woseri, toziya pasipanu pamemiziwa matendu ga ukondora. Nakaka nankugenda kuwagamiziya wantu pamuhera na pasipanu. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Su gulinyawili uwatu mkulu nentu gwa mbawu za mtera gwa mpingu, gutuli viwogu mngati mwakuyi na gutyelemeki lami mngati na kunja. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Haguinyawi hangu; utali wakuyi uweri magulu miya na malongu matatu na tisa na kupanuka kwakuyi kuweri magulu malongu mawili na muhanu na utali kugenda kumpindi uweri mawoku lilongu na muhanu. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Uwatu mkulu awu uweri gwa matala mantatu na guweri na ligomi pambwega. Guwunyawi shitwiku, shakapanu guleki lupenyu nusu liwoku pakati pa shitwiku na litala. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Nankugenda kujega mashi gavuwa makulu pasipanu kwagamiziya viwumbi vyoseri vyaviwera vikomu pasipanu. Kila shiwumbi shashilikala pasipanu hashihowi, <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />kumbiti hantendi lipatanu na gwenga na gwenga hagwingili muuwatu mkulu pamuhera na mdala gwaku na wana waku wapalu pamuhera na wadala wawu. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Na gwenga hagwingiziyi muuwatu mkulu kila ntambu ya shiwumbi shakipalu na shakidala, su kuwatula walikali pamuhera na gwenga. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Hagwingiziyi kila ntambu ya wapongu wa kulyera, kila ntambu ya nkanyama na kila ntambu ya shiwumbi shashikwawakwawa mulitapaka, viwumbi viwili viwiili su kuwatura walikali. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Vilaa gutoli ntambu zoseri za viboga vyamuweza kuliya, guvituli weri viweri viboga vyenu pamuhera na viwumbi awa.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Nuhu katenditi kila shintu Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s">Mafuliku makulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Nuhu, “Gwingili mngati muuwatu, gwenga pamuhera na kaya yaku yoseri, toziya mushileri ashi gwenga guwera muheri kulongolu kwaneni. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Gutoli pamuhera na gwenga wankanyama woseri yawawera waherepa yaniwajimila kulaviwa tambiku, gutoli washipalu saba na washidala saba, kumbiti gutoli washipalu yumu na washidala yumu wankanyama yawawera wahumba yaniwajimira ndiri kulaviwa tambiku. <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Vilaa virii gutoli wampongu wa kulyera washipalu saba na washidala saba, su kuwatula walikali ntambu zawu pasipanu. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Pamashaka saba kwanjira vinu hantowi nvula pasipanu kwa mashaka malongu msheshi paliwala na pashiru na haniwagamiziyi nakamu mupasipanu kila shiwumbi shashilikala shanushiwumbiti.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Nuhu katenditi vyoseri vyakalagaliritwi na Mtuwa.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Nuhu kaweriti na mivinja miya sita shaka mashi gavuwa makulu pagalawiriti pasipanu. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Nuhu na mdala gwakuyi, wana wakuyi wapalu pamuhera na wadala wawu, woseri wingiriti mngati mwa muwatu su washapili mashi gavuwa makulu. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Shipalu na shidala gwa kila nkanyama na wampongu na viwumbi vyoseri vyavikwawakwawa mulitapaka vyavijimirwa kulaviwa tambiku na vyaviwera vihumba, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />washipalu wawili na washidala wawili wingiriti mngati mwa uwatu pamuhera na Nuhu, Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Pagapititi mashaka saba, mashi gavuwa makulu ganja kugubika pasipanu.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Nuhu pakaweriti na mivinja miya sita, mulishaka lya lilongu na saba mumwezi gwa pili, lishaka ali mbwiru zoseri za mashi gabwitula pahala poseri na mashi ga kumpindi gagubutuka. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Na nvula itowiti pasipanu kwa mashaka malongu msheshi, paliwala na pashiru. <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Mulishaka lilaa ali nvula payiyanjiti kutowa, Nuhu pamuhera na mdala gwakuyi, wana wakuyi wapalu, Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti pamuhera na wadala wawu, woseri wingiriti mngati mwa uwatu mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Womberi wingiriti pamuhera na ntambu zoseri za wankanyama wa kuntundu na ntambu zoseri za wankanyama wa kulolerwa na ntambu zoseri za wankanyama yawakwawakwawa mulitapaka na kila ntambu za wampongu. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Shipalu yumu na shidala yumu gwa kila ntambu ya viwumbi, wingiriti pamuhera na Nuhu muwatu mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />Kila ntambu yawu wingiriti mpalu na mdala gambira Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Nuhu. Shakapanu Mtuwa kamtatira Nuhu mlaa ligomi lwa uwatu mkulu.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Mashi gavuwa makulu galikaliti pasipanu mashaka malongu msheshi, mashi gongeleka na kuunyasula uwatu mkulu guyeruka pasipanu. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Mashi gendereya kwongoleka nentu pasipanu na uwatu mkulu uyeruka. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Mashi aga gaweriti gavuwa nentu pasipanu, gavigubika vigongu vyoseri vitali pasipanu. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Gongelekiti ata kugubikira vigongo shyasi sha mawoku saba na nusu. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Viwumbi vyoseri vyavilikwawa kwawa pasipanu vihowiti; wampongu na wankanyama wa kulolerwa na wankanyama wa kuntundu, vipinga vyoseri vya viwumbi vyoseri pasipanu na wantu woseri. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Kila shiwumbi shashilikala mulitapaka liyuma, shihowiti. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Kila shiwumbi shashilikaliti pasipanu shyagamiziwituwi, wantu na wankanyama na viwumbi vyavikwawa kwawa mulitapaka na wampongu wa kulyera, woseri wagamiziwitwi pasipanu. Nuhu gweka yakuwi ndo yakasigaliti pamuhera na woseri yawaweriti na yomberi muuwatu mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Mashi aga galikaliti pasipanu mashaka miya na malongu muhanu.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s">Upeleru wa mafuliku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Shakapanu Mungu kamuhola Nuhu pamuhera na wankanyama woseri wa kulolerwa na wa kuntundu, woseri yawaweriti pamuhera na yomberi muuwatu mkulu, Mlungu su kavumisiya lihega pasipanu mashi gayanja kusera. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Mushaka ashi, mbwiru za mashi na madilisha ga mashi ga kumpindi gatatitwi kala. Nvula ilekiti kutowa, <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />mashi gendereyiti kusera mpolimpoli pasipanu. Upeleru pamashaka miya na malongu muhanu, mashi gaweriti gasera nentu. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Mulishaka lya lilongu na saba mumwezi gwa saba, uwatu mkulu gugolokiti pavigongu vya Ararati. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Mashi gendereyiti kusera mpolimpoli na lishaka lya kwanja lya mwezi gwa lilongu, migongu iwoneka.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Pamashaka malongu muhanu Nuhu kavuguliti dilisha lyakalinyawiti muuwatu mkulu <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />na kamlaviya mpongu kungulu na yomberi kawuya ndiri kumbiti kaguluka aku na aku mpaka mashi pagayumiti pasipanu. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Shakapanu Nuhu kamlaviya ng'unda kapati kuwona handa mashi gaweriti gasera pasipanu. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Kumbiti ng'unda kapatiti ndiri pahala pa kutukira toziya kuweriti na mashi kila pahala pa pasipanu, su kawuyiti kwa Nuhu muuwatu mkulu. Nuhu kalitalapisiya liwoku lyakuyi, kamtola na kumuwuziya muuwatu. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Nuhu kaheperiti mashaka saba gamonga, shakapanu kamlaviya kayi ng'unda ayu. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Ng'unda ayu pakamwuyiriti Nuhu pamihi, kaweriti na shitomoru shiwisi sha mtera gwa mzeyituni! Su Nuhu kavimaniti kuwera mashi gaweriti gasera pasipanu. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Su yomberi kaheperiti mashaka saba gamonga, kamlaviya kayi ng'unda ulii, shaka ashi ng'unda kawuyiti ndiri kayi.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Nuhu pakaweriti na mivinja miya sita na yimu, mulishaka lya kwanja lya mwezi gwa kwanja, mashi gaweriti gayuma pasipanu. Nuhu kavuguliti shifuniku sha shitwiku sha uwatu mkulu na pakaloliti, kawona kuwera pasipanu paweriti payuma. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Mulishaka lya malongu mawili na saba mumwezi gwa pili, pasipanu paweriti payuma nakamu.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Su Mlungu kamgambiriti Nuhu, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“Gulawi muuwatu mkulu, gwenga pamuhera na mdala gwaku, wana waku wapalu pamuhera na wadala wawu. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Guwalaviyi kunja vilaa na viumbi vyoseri wakomu wakila ntambu yawaweriti pamuhera na gwenga, wampongu na wankanyama na kila shiwumbi shashikwawa kwawa mulitapaka, su wapati kulera kuwera wavuwa pasipanu na kweneya kila pahala.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Su Nuhu kalawa muuwatu mkulu pamuhera na wana wakuyi na mdala gwakuyi, pamuhera na wamikawana wakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Wankanyama woseri na viwumbi vyoseri vyavikwawa kwawa palitapaka na wampongu woseri na kila shashigendagenda pasipanu, walawiti muuwatu mkulu kulawirana na ntambu zawu.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu kankumlavilira tambiku Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Nuhu kamunyawira Mtuwa Mlungu, shitalawanda sha mabuwi sha kutambikira na kamtoliti yumu mukila ntambu ya wankanyama na mpongu waherepa, kamlavilira Mlungu tambiku ya kulunguziya pahala pa kutambikira. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Ununkira uherepa wa tambiku ayi, umuherepeziyiti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mtuwa kalitakuliti mweni, “Hapeni nilipangili kayi litapaka toziya ya wantu, nivimana kuwera maholu gakuyi gapotoka kwanjira uwana wakuyi, ama hapeni nagamiziyi viwumbi ntambu yantenditi. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Pasipanu papandereya, shaka sha kuyala na kubena, shaka sha mpepu na shaka sha hemuka, shaka sha mihamba kutomola na shaka sha mihamba kutuluka, shaka sha pashiru na shaka sha paliwala, vyoseri havi hapeni vyoyi.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankutula lipatanu na Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Mlungu kamtekeleriti Nuhu pamuhera na wana wakuyi, pakawagambira, “Mleri mwongelereki, mwakapamemiziyi pasipanu. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Wankanyama woseri na wampongu woseri wa kulyera, viwumbi vyoseri vyavilikwawa kwawa palitapaka na wasomba wa mubahari, woseri hawaweri na lyoga na kuwatila mwenga. Woseri watuluwa muukolamlima mwenu. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Wankanyama woseri yawalikala hawaweri shiboga kwa mwenga, su niwapanani vyoseri ntambu yaniwapananiti mihamba ya mumalambu kuwera shiboga sha mwenga. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Kumbiti namuliya nkanyama yakawera kankali na mwazi gwagulikala mngati mwakuyi toziya ukomu wa mumwazi. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Mwazi gwa ukomu wenu haniwashongi, hanshongi kulawa kwa kila nkanyama. Vilaa virii kwa kila muntu, yoseri yakamlaga muyaguwi, hanimshongi ukomu wakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />Yakita mwazi gwa muntu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:6">mwazi gwakuyi hagwitwi na muntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:6">toziya kwa mfanu gwa Mlungu, muntu kawumbitwi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />Mwenga mwiwuri, mwakongereki muweri na wana wavuwa, mwongereki pasipanu.<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upindi wa nvula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Shakapanu Mlungu kamgambiriti Nuhu pamuhera na wana wakuyi, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />vinu nankutula lipatanu na gwenga pamuhera na shiyiwuku shaku <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />na kila shiwumbi shashiwera pamuhera na gwenga, wampongu na wankanyama wa kulolerwa na wankanyama wa kuntundu na woseri yawalawiti muuwatu pamuhera na gwenga. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Nankutula lipatanu pamuhera na mwenga, kuwera viwumbi vyavilikala hapeni vyagamiziwi kayi na mashi gavuwa makulu, hapeni galawili kayi malawa gakwagamiziya pasipanu. <verse eid="GEN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />“Mlungu kalonga kayi, Ashi ndo shilangaliru sha lipatanu lwanulutenda pakati pa neni na mwenga na kila shiwumbi shashilikala na gwenga kwa viyiwuku vyoseri vyaviza,” <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />nankutula katanga ya nvula mumahundi na hashiweri shilangaliru sha lipatanu lyaneni na pasipanu. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Kila pantenda mahundi pasipanu na katanga ayi ya nvula payiwoneka mumahundi, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />haniliholi lipatanu pakati pa neni na mwenga pamuhera na viwumbi vyoseri vyavilikala. Na mashi hapeni gagamiziyi kayi viwumbi vyoseri vyavilikala. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Katanga ya nvula payilawila mumahundi, haniwuwoni na kulihola lipatanu ali lya mashaka goseri pakati pa neni na viwumbi vyoseri vyavilikala pasipanu. <verse eid="GEN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />“Mlungu kamgambiriti Nuhu, katanga ayi ndo lilangaliru lya lipatanu lyanilitenditi na viwumbi vyoseri vyavilikala pasipanu.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu na wana wakuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Wana wa Nuhu yawalawiti muuwatu mkulu waweriti; Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti. Hamu kaweriti tati gwakuyi Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Awa ndo wana watatu wa Nuhu, su kulawirana na wana watatu awa, wantu weneya pasipanu poseri.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Nuhu kaweriti mlimi gwa kwanja, kalimiti lirambu lya mizabibu. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Pakalanditi nentu divayi kalowera, shakapanu kagonja shivula hera mulilingu lyakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Hamu tati gwa Kanani, kashiwoniti shivula sha tati gwakuyi, kalawiti kunja na kuwagambira walongu wakuyi wawili. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Kumbiti Shemu na Yafeti watoliti nguwu, wayiwagala mumakombi mwawu, wagenda shimberi mberi na kushigubika shivula sha tati gwawu. Womberi waloliti kumbwega, washiwoniti ndiri shivula sha tati gwawu. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Kulowera pakumperiti Nuhu, kamaniti ntambu yakatendiritwi na mwana gwakuyi mdidini, <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />su kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">“Kapangiluwi Kanani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">Hakaweri mumanda nentu kwa walongu wakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Kayi kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">Shemu katekelerwi na Mtuwa Mlungu gwangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanani kaweri mumanda gwa Shemu.<verse eid="GEN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Mlungu kongeri mipaka ya Yafeti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">kalikali mumalingu ga Shemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">Kanani su kaweri mumanda gwa Yafeti.” <verse eid="GEN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Pagapititi mashi gavuwa makulu, Nuhu kalikaliti mivinja miya tatu na malongu muhanu. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Su kahowiti pakawera na mivinja miya tisa na malongu muhanu.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s">Walera wa Nuhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:5-23">1 Mirandu 1:5-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Pagapititi kala mashi gavuwa makulu, Shemu na hamu na Yafeti wana wa Nuhu wapatiti wana, na avi ndo viyiwuku vyawu.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Wana wa Yafeti waweriti Gomeri na Magogu na Madai na Yavani na Tubali na Mesheki na Tirasi. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Wana wa Gomeri waweriti Ashekenazi na Rifati na Togama. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Wana wa Yavani waweriti Elisha na Talishishi na Kitimu na Dodanimu. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Shiyuwuku sha Yafeti, shiweriti na utakula wawu na likabila lyawu na isi yawu.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Wana wa Hamu waweriti Kushi na Misri na Puti na Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Wana wa Kushi waweriti Seba na Hawila na Sabita na Raama na Sabiteka. Wana wapalu wa Raama waweriti Sheba na Dedani. <verse eid="GEN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kushi kaweriti tati gwa Nimlodi, ulii yakiziti kuwera shikambaku sha kwanja sha pasipanu. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamtenditi yomberi kaweri mwindaji mkulu, ndo mana kwana visoweru vyavilonga, “Handa Nimrodi mwindaji mkulu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu!” <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Lushi za kwanja za ufalumi wakuyi uweriti Babeli na Ereki na Akadi mulushi lwa Shinari. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Kulawa muisi ayi, Nimrodi kagenditi Ashuru, kanyawiti lushi za Ninawi na Rohobeti Ilii na Kala na, <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />Reseni gwaguweriti pakati pa Ninawi na lushi lukulu lwa Kala.<verse eid="GEN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Misri kaweriti mbuyi gwa Waludi na Wanamu na Walehabu na Wanafitili, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />Wapatirusi na Wakasiluwi ndoweni washiyiwuku sha Wafilisti, Wakafitoli. <verse eid="GEN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Kanani kaweriti mbuyi gwa Sidoni, shipanta njira shakuwi na Seti, <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />na vilaa mbuyi gwawu Wayebusi na Waamuli na Wagerasi, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />Wahivi na Waariki na Wasini, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />Waalivadi na Wasemali na Wahamati. Shakapanu wantu wa vipinga vya ntambu yingi za Wakaani yawapalasiyitiki <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />ata pahala lwa lushi lwawu luweriti kulawa Sidoni kugenda kusika, mpaka Gerari na Gaza na kugenda mpaka kwakulawa mshenji mpaka Sodoma na Gomeri na Adima na Seboyimu mpaka Lasha. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Womberi ndo walera wa Hamu kulawirana na makabila gawu na utakula wawu na isi yawu.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Shemu mkulu gwa Yafeti kaweriti mbuyi gwa Waebraniya woseri. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Wana wa Shemu waweriti Eramu na Ashuru na Arifakisadi na Ludi na Aramu. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Wana wa Aramu waweriti Usi na Hulina na Geteli na Mashi. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Arifakisadi kamleriti Shela na Shela kamleriti Eberi. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Eberi kaweriti na wana wawili, mwana gwa kwanja kamshemiti Pelegi toziya shaka ashi wantu pasipanu wapalasikiti na mwana gwa pili kamshemiti Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Yokitani kaweriti tati gwa Alimodadi na Shelefi na Hasalimaweti na Yera, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />na hadoramu na Uzali na Dikila, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obeli na Abimaeli na Sheba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />na Ofili na Hawila na Yobabu. Woseri awa waweriti wana wa Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Isi yawalikaliti yeneya kulawa Mesha mpaka Sefari musemu za muvigongu vya isi kwakulawa mshenji. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Awa ndo walerwa wa Shemu kulawirana na makabila gawu na utakula wawu na isi zawu.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Awa ndo wantu wa shiyiwuku sha wana wa Nuhu, kulawirana na isi zawu. Kulawa muisi azi zyaziyeneya pasipanu pamashi gavuwa makulu.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s">Shinara sha Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Palupaga wantu woseri pasipanu waweriti na luga yimu na utakula umu. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Su wantu pawagenditi genditi mwanja uwega kwagulawa mshenji, wasokiti mulilaranda lya Shinari, womberi walikaliti aku. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Womberi waligambiriti, “Su aya tufyatuli matofali tugayoshii weri na motu.” Womberi waweriti na matofali badala ya mabuwi na lami badala ya shokaa. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Su watakuliti, “Tulinyawili lushi pamuhera na shinala, upeleru wa shinala ashi hausoki kumpindi nentu su litawu lyetu halimaniki, natwiza kupalanganika pasipanu poseri.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kasulukiti kululola lushi alu na shinala shashinyawitwi na wantu. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalongiti, “Guloli, wantu awa wawera waumu na woseri wawera na luga yimu na aga gawanjiti kutenda ndo ga kwanja hera, shakapanu kwa shilii shawalihola kushitenda hashitendeki kwa womberi. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Tusuluki pasi na tuwavuluvusiyii luga yawu, su nawelewana weni kwa weni.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Su Mtuwa kawapalasiya pahala poseri mupasipanu, womberi walekiti kunyawa lushi lulii. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Lushi alu lushemuwa Babeli, toziya aku Mtuwa kwakavuluvusiyiti luga ya pasipanu poseri na kulawa aku kawapalasiyiti wantu kila pahala pasipanu.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shiyuwuku sha Shemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Pamivinja miwili pamashi makulu gavuwa, Shemu pakaweriti na mivinja miya, yomberi kamwiwuliriti Arifakisadi. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Shemu pakamleriti kala Arifakisadi, kalikaliti mivinja miya muhanu, na kapatiti wana wamonga. Ashi ndo shiyiwuku sha Shemu.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Arifakisadi pakaweriti na mivinja malongu matatu na muhanu, kamleriti Shela. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Pakamleriti kala Shela, Arifakisadi kalikaliti mivinja miya musheshi na mitatu, na kapatiti wana wamonga.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Shela pakaweriti na mivinja malongu matatu, kamleriti Eberi. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Pakamleriti kala Eberi, Shela kalikaliti mivinja miya msheshi na ntatu na kapatiti wana wamonga.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Eberi pakaweriti na mivinja miya na malongu musheshi kamleriti Pelegi. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Pakamleriti kala Pelegi, Eberi kalikaliti mivinja miya msheshi na malongu matatu na kupatiti wana wamonga.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Pelegi pakaweriti na mivinja malongu matatu, kamleriti Rewu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Pakamleriti kala Rewu, Pelegi kalikaliti mivinja miya mbili na tisa na kupatiti wana wamonga. <verse eid="GEN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Rewu pakweriti na mivinja malongu matatu na mbili kamleriti Serugi. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Pakamleriti kala Serugi, Rewu kalikaliti mivinja miya mbili na saba na kapatiti wana wamonga. <verse eid="GEN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Serugi pakaweriti na mivinja malongu matatu, kamleriti Nahori. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Pamleriti kala Nahori, Serugi kalikaliti mivinja miya mbili, na kupatiti wana wamonga. <verse eid="GEN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Nahori pakaweriti na mivinja malongu mawili na tisa, kamleriti Tera. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Pakamleriti kala Tera, Nahori kalikaliti mivinja miya na lilongu na tisa na kapatiti wana wamonga.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Tera pakaweriti na mivinja malongu saba, kamleriti Abramu na Nahori na Harani.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Washiyiwuku sha Tera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Shiyuwuku ashi ndo sha Tera, tati gwawu Abramu na Nahori na Harani. Harani kaweriti tati gwa Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Harani kahowiti shaka Tera tati gwakuyi pakalikaliti aku Uri lushi lwa Wakalidayu pahala pakayiwukiti. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Abramu na Nahori wayugiti, mdala gwa Abramu kashemitwi Sarai na mdala gwa Nahori kashemitwi Milika, mhinga gwa Harani ulii yakaweriti tati gwakuyi Isika vilaa. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Sarai kaweriti ndiri na mwana toziya kaweriti mpendi.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Tera kamtoliti Abramu mwana gwakuyi na Lutu mzukulu gwakuyi yakaweriti mwana gwa Harani, vilaa kamtoliti Sarai mdala gwa Abramu, woseri wawukiti pamuhera kulawa Uri lushi lwa Wakalidayu, wagenditi muisi ya Kanaani. Kumbiti pawasokiti Harani, walikaliti. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Tera kahowiti aku Harani pakaweriti na mivinja miya mbili na muhanu.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankumshema Abramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Abramu, “Guwuki muisi yaku na guwaleki wantu waku na kaya ya tati gwaku, gugendi kuisi yang'enda kukulanguziya. <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Hanikutendi gwenga guweri na wantu wavuwa, hanikutekeleri, hanilitendi litawu lyaku likulu, na gwenga haguweri mtekelerwa.<verse eid="GEN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Yakakutekelera, hanimtekeleri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">na yakakupangila, hanimpangili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">na wantu woseri wa pasipanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">hawatekelerwi kupitira gwenga.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Su Abramu kawukiti ntambu yakalagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu na Lutu kagenditi pamuhera na yomberi. Abramu pakaweriti na mivinja malongu saba na muhanu pakiwukiti Harani. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Kamtoliti Sarai mdala gwakuyi na Lutu mwana gwa mlongu gwakuyi pamuhera na ulunda wawu woseri na wantu woseri yawawapatiti Harani, wawukiti kugenda lushi lwa Kanani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 12:5">Pawaingiriti mulushi lwa Kanaani, <verse eid="GEN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Abramu kagenditi mwanja kupitira pakati pa isi ya Shekemu, pahala pananagala pa mtera gwa More. Mushaka ashi, Wakanaani waweriti wenikaya wa lushi alu. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Mtuwa kamlawiriti Abramu na kamgambiriti, “Shiyuwuku shaku Hanishipanani isi ayi.” Su Abramu kanyawa shitalawanda sha mabuwi sha kutambikira toziya ya Mtuwa Mlungu yakamlawiriti. <verse eid="GEN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Shakapanu Abramu kawukiti, kagenditi Beteli kulugongu kwakulawa mshenji na kanyawiti liringu pakati pa lushi lwa Beteli, uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji na lushi lwa Ai uwega wa kwakulawa mshenji. Aku vilaa kamnyawiliti liringu Mtuwa. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Shakapanu Abramu kagenditi mwanja uwega wa Negebu.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abramu muisi ya Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Shaka ashi njala ilawiriti muisi, njala ayi iweriti nkulu, su Abramu kagenditi Misri kulikala aku kwa shaka. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Pakaweriti pakwegera na Misri, Abramu kamgambiriti Sarai mdala gwakuyi, “Nivimana uherepa yaguwera nagu. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Wamisri pawakuwona hawatakuli, ayu ndo mdala gwakuyi, shakapanu hawandagi kumbiti gwenga hawakuleki gulikali. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Shondi shondi guwagambiri kuwera gwenga gwadada gwangu, su vitwatira vyoseri viweri weri kwa neni na hawandeki nilikali toziya ya gwenga.” <verse eid="GEN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Abramu pakasokiti isi ya Misri, wenikaya wamwoniti Sara kuwera kaherepa nentu. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Watenda lihengu wakulu wa Farao pawamwoniti Sarai, womberi wamjumiti kwa Farao. Su Sarai wamjegiti ukaya kwa Farao. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Toziya ya Sarai, mfalumi katenditi gaherepa kwa Abramu, kampananiti wakondolu na wang'ombi na wankanyama punda wa shipalu na wantumintumi wapalu pamuhera na wadala, nkanyama punda wa shidala na nkayama ngamiya.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kamtabisiyiti Farao na wantu woseri wa kaya yakuwi kwa makomangu gakalipa toziya ya Sarai mdala gwa Abramu. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Farao kamshemiti Abramu kamkosiya, “Shintu gaa ashi shaguntenditi? Iwera ashi gung'ambiliti ndiri kuwera Sarai mdala gwaku? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Iwera ashi gutakuliti kuwera yomberi ndo dada gwaku na neni nimtoliti kuwera mdala gwangu? Su vinu gumtoli gugendi zaku!” <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Shakapanu Farao kawalagalariti wantu wakuyi na womberi wamsindikiza Abramu pakawera na mdala gwakuyi na ulunda wakuyi woseri.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s">Abrahamu na Lutu wankulekana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Abramu kawuya kulawa Misri, kakweniti kugenda uwega wa Negebu. Kaweriti pamuhera na mdala gwakuyi na ulunda wakuyi woseri pamuhera na Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Shaka ashi, Abramu kaweriti kalunda nentu, kaweriti na mifugu na mpiya pamuhera na zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Kendereyiti kugenda mwanja kulawa Negebu mpaka Beteli, pahala pakaweriti kagonjera mwanja, pakati pa Beteli na Ai, <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />pahala pakanyawiti shitalawanda sha kutambikira. Palii Abramu kaguwiriti pakalishema litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Vilaa avi, Lutu yakagenditi pamuhera na Abramu, kaweriti na wakondolu na mifugu na malingu. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Kuweriti kwahera isi itosha ya kuyiliziya mifugu kwa kutenda Abramu na Lutu walikali pamuhera. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Su kulawiriti ndewu pakati pa walolera wa mifugu wa Abramu na walolera wa mifugu wa Lutu. Shaka ashi Wakanaani na Waperizi waweriti wenikaya mlushi alu.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Su Abramu kamgambiriti Lutu, “Nakuwera na ndewu pakati petu ama pakati pa walolera wetu, toziya twenga twawalongu. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Hashi, isi yoseri ayi iwera ndiri kulongolu kwa gwenga? Su tulileki. Pagugenda kumshigi, neni hang'endi kumliwu, na pagugenda kumliwu, neni hang'endi kumshigi.” <verse eid="GEN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Lutu kanyasula sheni shakuwi na kaluwona lularanda lya lushemba Yoridani, kawona kwana mashi gavuwa kila pahala gambira shiwunga sha Mtuwa Mlungu na kugambira isi ya Misri uwega wa Soali. Ayi iweriti pamberi pa Mtuwa Mlungu hakenilunguziyi lushi lwa Sodoma na Gomeri. <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Su Lutu kalisyagulira mweni lularanda lyoseri lya lushemba Yoridani, kagenditi kwagulawa mshenji, womberi walilekiti. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Abramu kalikaliti muisi ya Kanaani na Lutu kalikala pakati pa lushi zyaziweriti pambwega mushemba, kanyawiti malingu gakuyi pakwegera na Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Wantu wa Sodoma waweriti wakondola na yawatenda vidoda vikulu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abramu kankulanguziwa isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Lutu pakawukiti kala, Mtuwa kamgambiriti Abramu, “Gunyasuli masu gaku kulawa panu paguwera, guloli wega zoseri, kushana na kusika, kwagulawa mshenji na kwaguzyeta mshenji. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Isi ayi yoseri yaguiwona hanikupanani gwenga pamuhera na shiyiwuku shaku, su iweri yamwenga mashaka goseri. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Hanishitendi shiyiwuku shaku shiweri shivuwa gambira lidika. Gambira lidika lyaliweza ndiri kuwalangalika, su shiyiwuku shaku hapeni shiwalangiki! <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Guwuki, gugendi mukila pembi ya isi, toziya hanikupanani gwenga.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Su Abramu katupuliti malingu yakuwi, kagenditi kulikala pakwegera na mitera mikulu ya Mialoni ya Mamre kulii Hebroni, na aku kamnyawiliti Mtuwa pahala pa kutambikira.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s">Abramu kankumlopola Lutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Wafalumi washeshi, Amrafeli gwa Shinali, mfalumi Arioku gwa Eramu na mfalumi Tidali gwa Goiimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />kwa pamuhera wagenditi kulikomanga ngondu na Bela mfalumi gwa Gomeri na Shinabi mfalumi gwa Adima na Shemeberi mfalumi gwa Seboyimu na muyaguwi mfalumi gwa Bela, vinu ishemuwa Soali. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Wafalumi wamuhanu awa, wanjishiti wanjagira wau kulawa mulilaranda lya Sidimu, vinu ishemuwa bahari ya munu. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Kwa shaka sha mivinja malongu na mbili yaipititi, waweriti pawamjimira mfalumi Kedorilaomeri, kumbiti mushinja sha malongu na ntatu, womberi wamgalambukiti. <verse eid="GEN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Mushinja sha lilongu na msheshi, mfalumi Kedorilaomeri pamuhera na wafalumi walii wayaguwi wiziti na kuwakanga wantu wa Refaimu aku Ashitaroti karinaimu na Wazuzi aku Hamu na Waemi aku Shawe kiriataimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />na Waholi aku kwa muisi ya lugongu lwa Seiri wawawingiti mpaka Eliparani, mumbaka za shiwala. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Shakapanu wawuyiti kumbeli mpaka Enimishipati, vinu washema Kadeshi, waikomiti isi yoseri ya Waamaleki na wawakanga Waamori yawalikaliti Hasasoni Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Su mfalumi gwa Sodoma na mfalumi gwa Adima na mfalumi gwa Seboimu na mfalumi gwa Bela wingiriti kulikoma ngondu mulilaranda lwa Sidimu <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />kulikoma na Kedorilaomeri mfalumi gwa Eramu na Tidali mfalumi gwa Goiimu na Amrafeli mfalumi gwa Sinari na Arioku mfalumi gwa Elasali, wafalumi wamsheshi walikomangiti na wafalumi wamuhanu. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Su luranda lwa Sidimu liweriti limema malindi ga lami, wafalumi wa Sodoma na Gomora pawaweriti wankutuga ngondu wapatukira mumalindi, kumbiti wamonga washapiliti kulugongu. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Su wafalumi wamsheshi walii watoliti ulunda woseri wa Sodoma na Gomora pamuhera na viboga vyawu vyoseri, su wagenditi zawu. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Vilaa wambatiti Lutu mwana gwa mlongu gwakuyi Abramu, ulii yakalikaliti Sodoma pamuhera na ulunda wakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Muntu yumu yakalopoliti, kiziti kumgambira visoweru Abramu Mweburaniya yakalikaliti pakwegera na mitera mikulu ya mialoni ya Mwamoli Mamle. Mamle kaweriti mlongu gwakuyi Eshikoli na Aneri, woseri waweriti wajimilirana pamuhera na Abramu. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Abramu pakapatiti visoweru avi kuwera mwipa gwakuyi wamtola lopola, yomberi kawashema wantu miya ntatu na malongu matatu na lilongu na nani, walii wa kaya yakuwi yawafunditwi weri kulikomanga ngondu na wawafatiti wangondu mpaka Dani. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Aku kawabagula wanjagira wakuyi vipinga vipinga. Pashiru wawakomanga wangondu wakuyi, yomberi kawakanka na kuwawinga mpaka Hoba, kushana mwa Damasko. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Su Abramu kaulopola ulunda woseri yawautoliti kwa wangondu na kumlopoziya Lutu mwipa gwakuyi na ulunda wakuyi pamuhera na wantu wamonga.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Melikizedeki kankumpetera mashi Abramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Abramu pakawuyiti kulawa mungondu pakamkankiki mfalumi Kedorilaomeri pamuhera na wayaguwi, mfalumi gwa Sodoma kawukiti kugenda kumwanka mlushi lwa Shawe, vinu lushemuwa lularanda lwa mfalumi. <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Shakapanu Melikizedeki mfalumi gwa lushi lwa Salemu, yakiweriti mtambika gwa Mlungu mkulu, kajegiti libunda pamuhera na divayi, <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />kampetera mashi Abramu pakatakula, “Abramu katekelerwi na Mlungu mkulu, yakaumbiti kumpindi na pasipanu! <verse eid="GEN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Na kakwisuwi Mlungu mkulu, yakakutangiti kuwakanka wangondu waku!” Su Abramu kampananiti Melikizedeki semu ya lilongu kwa vyoseri vyakaweriti navi.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Mfalumi gwa Sodoma kamgambiriti Abramu, “Gumpanani neni wantu awa, kumbiti ulunda woseri gutoli gamweni.” <verse eid="GEN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Kumbiti Abramu kamgambira mfalumi gwa Sodoma, “Nyasula liwoku lyaneni kwa Mtuwa, Mlungu yakawera Kumpindi nentu, yakaumbiti kumpindi na pasipanu, nilurapira <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />kuwera hapeni ntoli shintu shoseri shashiwera shaku, ata paguwera ugunda ama lugoyi lwa shilyatu, nakamu nagutakula, nimtenda Abramu kaweri mlunda. <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Su hapeni wanki shoseri, kumbiti virii wantemba wangu vyawaliyiti pamuhera na semu ya walii yawaweriti pamuhera na neni, walii ashina Aneri na Esikori na Mamire. Womberi vulaa wawapanani semu yawu.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s">Lipatanu lya Mlungu na Abramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Pashitwatira ashi, shisoweru sha Mlungu shimwiziriti Abramu mumawonu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 15:1">“Abramu nagutira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 15:1">Neni hanikuloleri gwenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 15:1">Na hanikupanani lifupu likulu kwa kunjimira.”<verse eid="GEN 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Kumbiti Abramu kalongiti, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, hagumpanani shishi, uganu paendereya kulikala pota mwana na muhala gwa ulunda wangu hakaweri Eliezeri gwa Damasko? <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Guloli! Gumpanana ndiri mwana, mumanda yakayiwukiti ukaya kwaneni hakaweri muhala gwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Shakapanu shisoweru sha Mtuwa shimwiziriti Abramu, “Ayu hapeni kaweri muhala gwaku! Mwana gwaku gwa kumlera mweni ndo hakaweri muhala gwaku.” <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamjegiti Abramu kunja na kumgambira, “Guloli Kumpindi na guwalangi ntondu handa nakaka guweza kuwalanga.” Kamgambiriti kayi, “Hangu ndo wiwuka waku ntambu hawaweri wavuwa.”<verse eid="GEN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Abramu kamjimiriti Mtuwa Mlungu na Mtuwa kamjimira Abramu kuwera muheri kulongolu kwakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Abramu vilaa, “Neni ndo Mtuwa yanikujegiti kulawa Uri, lushi lwa Wakalidayu, su nikupanani isi ayi iweri yaku.”<verse eid="GEN 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Kumbiti Abramu kamgambira, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, hanivimani hashi kuwera hayiweri yaneni isi ayi?”<verse eid="GEN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti, “Gunjegeri mwana gwa ng'ombi gwa mivinja mitatu na mwana gwa mbuzi gwa shidala gwa mivinja mitatu na kondolu gwa shipalu gwa mivinja mitatu na teteli na mwana gwa ng'unda.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Abramu kamjegera woseri awa, kahanja kila nkanyama vipandi viwili kavitula misitali miwili, pavituluwa uwega wa aku na aku kumbiti wampongu kawahanja ndiri vipandi viwili. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Shakapanu wampongu yawaliya vinofu vya nkanyama, watukiliti pavinofu, kumbiti Abramu kawawinga.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Mshenji paguweriti gwankuzyeta, Abramu kakolitwi na mpota, lyoga na luwindu totolu vimgubikira. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Shakapanu Mtuwa kamgambira Abramu, “Guvimani nakamu kuwera shiyiwuku shaku hashilikali gambira wahenga muisi yaiwera yawu ndiri, hawaweri wamanda na hawatabisiwi kwa shaka sha mivinja miya msheshi. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Kumbiti haniyitabisiyi isi yawaitendera umanda, na upeleru wakuyi shiyiwuku shaku hashilawi pashiwera na ulunda uvuwa. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Kumbiti gwenga hagulikali makaliru ga mivinja ivuwa na haguhowi kwa ponga. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Mushileri sha msheshi, shiyiwuku shaku hashiwuyi panu toziya ukondola wa Waamori hawenikamiliki kwazibiwa vinu.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Mshenji paguzyetiti na pakwinaliti, shiwiga shashitumiziya lyosi na limbamba lyaliyaka motu, vumu vipita pakati pa vipandi vya vinofu. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Lishaka ali, Mtuwa Mlungu katuliti lipatanu na Abramu pakatakula, “Shiyuwuku shaku Hanishipanani isi ayi, kulawa lushemba lukulu lwa Misri mpaka lushemba lulii lukulu lwa Eufrati, <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />isi ya Wakeni na Wakenizi na Wakadimoni. <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />Wahiti na Waperizi na Warefai, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />Waamori na Wakanaani na Wagiligashi na Wayebusi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s">Hagali na Ishimaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Sarai mdala gwa Abramu, kaweriti hakenimwiwuliri mpalu gwakuyi mwana. Kumbiti kaweriti na yaya mdala yakashemitwi Hagali, kulawa Misri. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Su Sarai kamgambiriti Abramu, “Guvimana kuwera Mlungu hakenintendi kupata wana. Gumtoli Hagali yaya gwangu mdala, pamonga hampati mwana kwakuyi.” Abramu kavijimiriti visoweru vya Sarai. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Pa Abramu kulikala muisi ya Kanaani kwa shaka sha mivinja lilongu, Sarai mdala gwakuyi kamtoliti Hagali mumanda gwakuyi na kampananiti Abramu mpalu gwakuyi, kaweri mdala gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Abramu kamumaniti Hagali, na Hagali kapatiti yinda. Yomberi pakavimaniti kuwera kana yinda, kanjiti kulitumba na kumzarawu Sarai.<verse eid="GEN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Sarai kamgambiriti Abramu, “Gwenga hagwajibiki udoda wantenderwa. Neni Nikupananiti yaya gwangu mdala, kumbiti pakapatiti yinda, kanjiti kulitumba na kunzarawu! Mtuwa katozi pakati pa gwenga na neni.”<verse eid="GEN 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Abramu kamgambira Sarai, “Yaya gwaku mdala kapasi pa uwezu waku, gumtendi ntambu yagufira.” Su Sarai kamtabisiyiti Hagali mpaka kawuka.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa, kamwoniti Hagali pambwiru ya mashi yagabwitula kushiwala, mbwiru ya mashi yaiwera munjira kugenda Shuri. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa kamkosiya, “Hagali, yaya gwa Sarai! Gulawa koshi na gwankugenda koshi?” Hagali kamwankula, “Nimtira Sarai.”<verse eid="GEN 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa kamgambiriti, “Guwuyi kwa Sarai na gwakamjimiri.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa kongeriti kutakula, “Hanishiyongeri shiyiwuku shaku, hapeni wawezi kushiwalanga kwa uvuwa wawu.”<verse eid="GEN 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa kamgambiriti vilaa, “Gwenga gwana yinda na hagwiwuli mwana mpalu, litawu lyakuyi hagumshemi Ishimaeli mana yakuwi Mtuwa kapikanira kulila kwaku. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Ishimaeli hakalikali gambira nkanyama punda gwa kuntundu, hakaweri mngondu kwa kila muntu, na kila muntu hakaweri mngondu gwakuyi na hakalikali kutali na walongu wakuyi.” <verse eid="GEN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Su Hagali kampananiti litawu Mtuwa Mlungu yakayoweritii nayu aku, “Gwenga gwa Mlungu yagumona neni,” toziya kaliholiti, “Nakaka panu nimwoniti yomberi yakamona!” <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Ndomana linegu lilii lishemuwa Beeri Lahai Roi, mana yakuwi linegu lya ulii yakawera na ukomu yakamoniti, linegu ali lya pakati pa Kadeshi na Beredi.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Hagali kamwiwulira Abramu mwana mpalu, Abramu kamshema litawu Ishimaeli. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Abramu kaweriti na mivinja malongu nani na sita shaka Hagali pakamwiyuwiriti Ishimaeli.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s">Kwingiziwa jandu lilangaliru lya lipatanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />“Shaka Abramu pakaweriti na mivinja malongu tisa na tisa, Mtuwa Mlungu kamlawiriti, kamgambira, neni ndo Mlungu yawera na makakala. Gunjimiri neni na mala zoseri gutendi shashiherepeziya.” <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Neni hantendi lipatanu pakati paneni na gwenga na hanishiyongeri nentu shiyiwuku shaku.<verse eid="GEN 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Palii Abramu kasuntama makukama, Mlungu kamgambira, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />ali ndo lipatanu lyangu na gwenga, haguweri tati gwa isi zivuwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />Kwanjira vinu, hapeni gushemwi kayi Abramu, kumbiti hagushemwi Abrahamu, toziya nikutenda guweri tati gwa isi zivuwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Hanikutendi guweri na shiyiwuku shivuwa nentu na kwaku hazilawi isi zivuwa pamuhera na wafalumi. <verse eid="GEN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />Hananguziyi nakaka lipatanu lyaneni kwa gwenga, shiyiwuku shaku na vileri vyawu vyoseri mashaka goseri, kayi haweri Mlungu gwaku na Mlungu gwa shiyiwuku shaku mashaka goseri. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Hanikupanani gwenga pamuhera na shiyiwuku shaku isi ayi mwamulikala ganbira muhenga. Isi yoseri ya Kanaani iweri lunda ya mwenga mashaka goseri, na neni haweri Mlungu gwawu.<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />“Shakapanu Mlungu kamgambiriti Abrahamu, kwa gwenga, gufiruwa kulikola lipatanu lyaneni, gwenga gamweni pamuhera na shiyiwuku shaku shoseri.” <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Ali ndo lipatanu nankulitenda pakati pa neni na gwenga pamuhera na shiyiwuku shaku, lipatanu lyagufiruwa kulikola, kila mpalu pakati pa mwenga kafiruwa kwingiziwa jandu. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Hamwingiziwi jandu, na ali haliweri lilangaliru lya lipatanu lya neni na mwenga. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Kwanjira vinu vileri vyaviza, kila mwana mpalu yakawera na umuli wa mivinja nani kafiruwa kwingiziwa jandu, pamuhera na woseri yawiyukiti mukaya yaku ama yakahemiritwi kwa mpiya zyenu kulawa kwa wahenga yakawera ndiri gwa shiyiwuku shaku. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Kila mwana mpalu mukaya yaku ama yoseri yakahemiritwi kwa mpiya, woseri wafiruwa kwingiziwa jandu. Shimaniziru ashi mushimba zyenu haliweri lilangaliru lya lipatanu lyaneni lya mashaka goseri. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Kila mpalu yoseri yakingiziwa ndiri jandu, hakatulwi gweka kulawa kwa wantu toziya hakaweri kajimira ndiri lipatanu lya neni.<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />“Vilaa Mlungu kamgambiriti Abrahamu, kwa mdala gwaku, hagumshemi ndiri kayi Sarai, kumbiti litawu lyakuyi haliweri Sara.” <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Hanimtekeleri na hanikupanani mwana mpalu kupitira yomberi. Hanimtekeleri Sara su hakaweri mawu gwa maisi na wafalumi wa wantu hawalawi kulawa kwa yomberi. <verse eid="GEN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />“Palii Abrahamu kasuntama makukama, kaseka mumoyu mwakuyi pakalihola, hashi hayitendeki nakaka mwana kwiwuka kwa mgogolu gwa mivinja miya? Hashi Sara yakawera na mivinja malongu tisa, hakawezi kupata mwana? <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Su Abrahamu kamgambiriti Mlungu, pamonga megujimiri kuwera matekeleru gaku gaweri kwa Ishimaeli.”<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />“Mlungu kamwankula, nakaka mdala gwaku Sara hakakwiwuliri mwana mpalu na gwenga hagumshemi Isaka. Hanilituli lipatanu lyaneni na yomberi kuwera lipatanu lya mashaka goseri kwajili yakuwi pamuhera na shiyiwuku shakuwi.” <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Kwa Ishimaeli, nikupikanira, nakaka hanimtekeleri, hanimtendi kaweri na shileri shivuwa na hanishiyongeri nentu. Hakaweri tati gwa wakolamlima lilongu na mbili, naneni hanimtendi kaweri mbuyi gwa wantu wavuwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Kumbiti lipatanu lyangu hanilitendi na Isaka ulii Sara yakagenda kukwiwulira mushinja shashiza shaka gambira ashi. <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Su Mlungu pakamaliliti kuyowera na Abrahamu, kawuka.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Mulishaka lilaa lilii, Abrahamu kamtola Ishimaeli mwana gwakuyi pamuhera na woseri yawayiwukiti mukaya yakuwi pamuhera na walii yawahemiritwi kwa mpiya zakuwi, kila mpalu gwa muukaya yakuwi, woseri kawayingiziyiti jandu gambira Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Abrahamu kaweriti na mivinja malongu tisa na tisa shaka pakingiziwitwi jandu. <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Na Ishimaeli mwana gwakuyi kaweriti na mivinja lilongu na ntatu pakingiziwitwi jandu, <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Abrahamu pamuhera na mwana gwakuyi wingiziwitwi jandu mulishaka limuhera. <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />Kila mpalu mukaya ya Abrahamu pamuhera na woseri yawayiwukiti mukaya yakuwi ama yakahemiritwi kulawa kwa muhenga, woseri wingiziwitwi jandu pamuhera na yomberi.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s">Wahenga watatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Mlungu kamlawiriti Abrahamu pamitera mikulu ya mialoni ya Mamire. Abrahamu kaweriti kalikala paligomi lwa liringu lyakuyi shaka sha shifuki paliwala, <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />na pakanyasuliti masu gakuyi, kawoniti wahenga watatu wagolokiti kutali padidini kulongolu kwakuyi. Yomberi pakawawoniti, katugiti kugenda kuwawanka. Pakasokiti kasuntamiti makukama <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />na kulonga, “Watuwa wangu, handa neni mpata upendelewu mumasu genu, Mwee watuwa, namumpita neni ntumintumi gwaku. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Hamjegeruwi mashi, shakapanu mnawi magulu na kwoyera pasi pa mtera. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Haniwajegeri shiboga mlii, su mpati likakala na kwenderea na mwanja gwenu, toziya mwiza kwa ntumintumi gwenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Na womberi wamwankula, “Gutendi ntambu yagulonga.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Su Abrahamu katenditi kalongola, kingiriti muliringu lyakaweriti Sara na kamgambiriti, “Gutendi kalongola, gutoli mawoku matatu ga ubumu na guteleki shiboga.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Shakapanu katugiti kugenda mushipinga sha wang'ombi, kasyaguliti ng'ombi kaherepa nentu, kampanana ntumintumi na yomberi kamlikituliti kalongola. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Shiboga pashiweriti kala, yomberi katoliti jibini ya maweli na vinofu vya ng'ombi ulii yakatandiritwi, kavituliti kulongolu kwa wahenga. Pawaweriti wankuliya, Abrahamu kaweriti kankuwahepa pakwegera pasi pa mtera.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Wahenga walii wamkosiyiti Abrahamu, “Kakoshi Sara mdala gwaku?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Abrahamu kawankula, “Kamuliringu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />“Yumu gwawu yakaweriti mkulu kalongiti, nakaka hambuyi shaka gambira ashi mushinja shashiza na mdala gwaku hakaweri na mwana mpalu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Sara kaweriti kakuzyetu paligomi lwa liringu pakapikanira.” <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Abrahamu na Sara waweriti wagogolu na Sara kwa vitwatira vya shidala kaweziti ndiri kupata mwana. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Su Sara kasekiti shimoyumoyu pakalihola, “Neni pamuhera na mpalu gwangu twawagogolu. Hashi, neni pawera mgogolu ntambu ayi, hanemeleri pang'onja na mpalu gwangu?”<verse eid="GEN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />“Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamkosiya Abrahamu, iwera ashi Sara kankuseka na katakula kuwera nakaka hampati mwana uganu neni mgogolu ntambu ayi? <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Hashi kwana shitwatira shoseri shashikamala kwa Mtuwa? Hambuyi kwa gwenga shaka shilii shanukulagiliti na Sara hakaweri na mwana.<verse eid="GEN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Kumbiti Sara kaweriti na lyoga, su kazyangiti kwa kulonga, nsekiti ndiri. Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti, gusekiti.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abrahamu kankuwaluwira yawalikala Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Shakapanu wahenga pawimukiti kuwuka, womberi waloliti kugenda Sodoma na Abrahamu kalikoliti nawu munjira. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />“Su Mtuwa kalonga, hashi, nimfifi Abrahamu shitwatira shang'enda kutenda? <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Nakaka yomberi hakaweri tati gwa isi zivuwa na kupitira yomberi wantu woseri pasipanu hawatekelerwi.” <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Nimsyaguliti yomberi, mweni hakawafundi wakuyi pamuhera na kaya yakuwi kufata njira yangu, su waweri waheri na yawatenda vitwatira viheri, naneni mpati kutenda shilii shanagaliti. <verse eid="GEN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />“Su Mtuwa Mlungu kalongiti, mashongeru makulu kuusu wantu wa Sodoma na Gomora pamuhera na vidoda vyawu, viwera vikulu.” <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Su hansuluki kugenda aku nikaloli namweni handa nakaka gawatenditi gawera madoda kulinganira na mashongeru ntambu yaganiziliti. Paiwera ndiri, hanivimani.<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Wahenga wawili walii waloliti kugenda Sodoma, kumbiti Abrahamu kasigaliti pakagoloka kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />“Su Abrahamu kamsegelera Mtuwa Mlungu, kamkosiya, hashi haguwagamiziyi wantu waheri pamuhera na wakondola?” <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />“Hashi, handa kwana wantu waheri malongu muhanu mlushi amu, haguwagamiziyi na hapeni gululeki kwajili ya wantu malongu muhanu waheri yawawera mlushi amu? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Ashi shiweri kutali nagwenga, kutenda shitwatira gambira ashi, kuwalaga waheri pamuhera na wakondola, kuwatendera waheri teratera na wakondola. Iweri kutali na gwenga! Gwenga guwera Mtoza gwa pasipanu poseri na hagutendi lyaliwera teratera.”<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Mtuwa kamgambira, “Handa pamona wantu malongu muhanu waheri mlushi lwa Sodoma, hanilulekiziyi lushi lwoseri kwajili ya womberi.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Abrahamu kalonga kayi, “Vinu neni wera na ugangamala wa kuyowera na Mtuwa, tembera neni shintu ndiri kumbiti wera lidika na livu hera, <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />hashi handa mawalanga ga yawawera waheri gapungula wamuhanu mumalongu muhanu, hagulwagamiziyi lushi lwoseri toziya ya wantu wamuhanu yawapungukiti? Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti, handa haniwawona aku wantu malongu msheshi na muhanu, hapeni nilwagamiziyi.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Abrahamu kayowera nayu kayi, hashi, “Handa kwana wantu malongu msheshi hera?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankula, “Hapeni nilwagamiziyi handa kwana wantu malongu msheshi.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Shakapanu yomberi kalongiti, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu shondo shondi nagukalala, kumbiti gundeki nkosiyi. Hashi, handa aku kwana wantu malongu matatu hera?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Mtuwa kawankula, “Hapeni nilwagamiziyi panuwawona aku wantu malongu matatu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Su Abrahamu kalongiti, “Vinu neni wera na ugangamala nentu kuyowera na Mtuwa, hashi handa kwana wantu malongu mawili hera?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Mtuwa kamwankula, “Toziya ya wantu malongu mawili, hapeni nilwagamiziyi.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Abrahamu kalonga, “Mtuwa shondi shondi nagukalala, kumbiti gundekeziyi nyoweri kayi mala yimu hera. Hayiweri hashi handa kwana wantu lilongu aku?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Mtuwa kamwankula, “Toziya ya wantu lilongu awa, hapeni nilwagamiziyi.”<verse eid="GEN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Mtuwa Mlungu pakamaliliti kuyowera na Abrahamu, kawukiti na Abrahamu kawuyiti ukaya kwakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s">Ukondola wa wantu wa Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Wantumintumi wakumpindi wawili walii wasokiti Sodoma pamihi na Lutu kaweriti kalikaliti paligomi likulu lya lushi. Shaka pakawawoniti, kagenditi kuwashemera na kuwasuntamalira makukama. <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />Yomberi kalongiti, “Watuwa wangu, mwingili ukaya kwa ntumintumi gwenu, mwakagululi magulu genu na kugonja panu. Shakapanu mandawira shilawu mwendereyi na mwanja gwenu. Womberi wamwankuliti, ndala, hatugonji kunja panu paluwaga.”<verse eid="GEN 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Lutu kawaluwiti nentu wingiri ukaya kwakuyi. Yomberi kawatandiriti msambu, kanyawiti mabumunda yagahera simika na womberi wagaliyiti. <verse eid="GEN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Kumbiti womberi pamberi pawagenda kugonja, wapalu woseri kulawa kila pahala pa lushi lwa Sodoma, wantemba na wazewi, woseri wayizyengikiti numba ya Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Wantu walii wamshemiti Lutu na kumkosiya, “Wakoshi wapalu walii yawawiziti kwa gwenga? Guwalaviyi kunja tufira kugonja nawa.”<verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Lutu kalawiti kunja kuyowera na wantu walii pakatata ligomi kumbeli kwakuyi <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />su kawagambira, “Walongu wangu, niwaluwani namutenda ukondora awu. <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Mloli, nanawu wahinga wawili yawawera luyenja. Mleki niwapanani na mwenga mweza kuwatenderuwa shoseri shamfira. Kumbiti namuwatendera shoseri wapalu awa, toziya wahenga waneni.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Kumbiti womberi walongiti, “Guwuki zaku! Wendereyiti kutakula gwenga gwiziti paguwera muhenga na vinu gulitenda kuwera mtoza! Su hatukutendi vidoda nentu pamuhera na wahenga waku awa.” Palii wamsukumiza Lutu kumbeli na kwanja kumega ligomi. <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Kumbiti wahenga walii wagatalapiyiti mawoku gawu wamnika Lutu mnumba na kutata ligomi. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Shakapanu wawatenda masu gawu gaweriti lwisi wantu walii wantemba pamuhera na wawezi yawaweriti paligomi pa numba ulii. Womberi wasinditi kuwona ligomi lilii.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lutu kankulawa Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Wahenga wawili walii wamgambiriti Lutu, “Hashi, gwana muntu yumonga panu, pamonga wana waku ama wahinga waku ama waganafu waku ama yoseri ulii mlongu gwaku mlushi amu? Guwawusiyi kalongola panu, <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />twankugenda kupagamiziya pahala panu, toziya mashongeru gwakupikaniriti kwa Mlungu kwajili ya wantu yawalikala panu kuwera kukulu nentu na Mtuwa katujega kuwagamiziya.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Su Lutu kawagendera waganafu wakuyi, walii yawawahetiti wahinga wakuyi. Yomberi kawagambiriti, “Kalongola muwuki mlushi amu, toziya Mtuwa kapakwegera kulwagamiziya lushi alu!” Kumbiti waganafu wakuyi waliholiti kuwera Lutu kaweriti kankuwatendera lijonga.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Pawushiyiti mandawira, wantumintumi wa kumpindi wamgambiriti Lutu, “Kalongola, gumtoli mdala gwaku pamuhera na wahinga waku wawili awa, namwagamiziwa shaka lushi alu paluwagamiziwa.”<verse eid="GEN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Lutu pakaweriti goyigoyi kuwuka, wantumintumi wa kumpindi walii wamkoliti liwoku na liwoku lya mdala gwakuyi na mawoku ga wahinga wakuyi, wamlaviyiti kunja kwa lushi, toziya Mtuwa kaweriti na lusungu nawomberi. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Pawalaviyitwi kala kunja mlushi lulii, ntumintumi yumu gwa kumpindi kamgambiriti, “Mtugi kwa kugalopola mmakaliru genu! Namlola kumbeli ama namgoloka koseri papawera lularanda! Mtugiri kulugongu, pamtenda ndiri hangu hamwagamiziwi.”<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Lutu kawagambira, “Ndala watuwa wangu namtenda ntambu ayi! <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Nakaka ntumintumi gwenu neni mpata upendelewu pamasu genu na mwenga mumonera lusungu lukulu kugalopola makaliru gangu. Kumbiti weza ndiri kutugira kulugongu, shitwatira ashi hashimpati pamberi pa kusoka aku na neni hahowi. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Mpikaniri, panu kwana lushi ludidini pakwegera lwatuweza kutugira. Su mundekeziyi ntugiri aku. Makaliru gangu hagalopolwi.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Yomberi kamwankula, “Yina njimira shaguluwa, hapeni nilwagamiziyi lushi lwagulukanditi. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Gutendi kalongola! Gutugili aku na neni hapeni ntendi shoseri mpaka pagusoka aku.” Su lushi alu lushemuwa Soali, mana yakuwi ludidini.<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwagamiziwa kwa Sodoma na Gomora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Mshenji guweriti gulawa kala, Lutu kaweriti kasokiti kala mulushi lwa Soali. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu katowiziyiti motu gukalipa gwa mabuwi ga madini ga baruti lushi lwa Sodoma na Gomora, <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />kaziyagamiziya lushi azi na pahala poseri palilaranda pamuhera na woseri yawalikaliti amu, vilaa pamuhera na vyoseri vyavimeriti mulitapaka. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Kumbiti mdala gwa Lutu yakaweriti kumbeli kwa Lutu, kaloliti kumbeli, kagalambuka kuwera lusiki lwa munu.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Mandawira putiputi lishaka lyalifatiti, Abrahamu kagenda pahala pakagolokiti kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Pakaweriti aku, kalola pasi wega zoseri za Sodoma na Gomora na pahala poseri pa lularanda, kalikangashiti kuwona lyosi palikwena kumpindi, lyosi gambira lya litanulu likulu.<verse eid="GEN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Mlungu pakaziyagamiziyiti lushi zaziwera mulilaranda kwakalikaliti Lutu, kamuholiti Abrahamu kwa kumlaviya Lutu mlushi azi nakagamira.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shyanjiru sha Wamoabu na Waamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Lutu pamuhera na wahinga wakuyi wawili, wawukiti Soari na kugenda kulikala kulugongu, toziya katiriti kulikala Soari. Mweni pamuhera na wahinga wakuyi, walikaliiti mumpanga. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Lishaka limu muhinga mkulu kamgambiriti mpusu gwakuyi, “Tati gwetu mzewi na kwahera mpalu pahala gwakutuyuga tuleri wana. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Su tumlandasyii tati gwetu divayi ikalipa kaloweri, su tupati kugonja nayomberi na hatwiwuri wana kutula shiyiwuku shetu.”<verse eid="GEN 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Pashiru palii wamlandaziyiti tati gwawu divayi ikalipa na muhinga ulii mkulu kagenditi kugonja nayu, kumbiti tati gwakuyi kavimaniti ndiri shaka muhinga pakangonjiti ama pakawukiti.<verse eid="GEN 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Shirawu yakuwi, muhinga mkulu ulii kamgambiriti mpusu gwakuyi, “Lishu pashiru neni ng'onjiti na tati, leru vilaa tumlandisiyi divayi ikalipa kaloweri, shakapanu gwenga hagugonji nayu, su twawoseri twenga hatuweri na viyiwuku vya kumpanana wana tati gwetu.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Su pashiru palii wamlandasiya divayi tati gwawu, shakapanu muhinga musu kagenditi kugonja nayu. Kumbiti tati gwakuyi kavimaniti ndiri shaka muhinga gwakuyi pakagonjiti ama pakawukiti. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Su wahinga woseri wawili wa Lutu waweriti na yinda kulawa kwa tati gwawu. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Muhinga mkulu ulii kaleriti mwana mpalu, kamshema Moabu, yomberi ndo tati gwa Wamoabu mpaka leru. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Muhinga mpusu ulii kaleriti mwana mpalu, kamshema Beni Ami. Ayu ndo tati gwa Waamoni mpaka leru.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s">Abrahamu na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Kulawa Mamure, Abrahamu kagenditi mwanja kushana pahala pa Negebu, kalikaliti pakati pa Kadeshi na Shuri, shakapanu kagenda kulikala kwa shaka aku Gerari. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Pakawera aku, Abrahamu katakuliti kuwera Sara mdala gwakuyi, “Ayu dada gwangu.” Su mfalumi wa Gerari kalagaliriti wamjegi Sara na yomberi kamtola. <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Kumbiti Mlungu kamwiziriti Abimeleki mukulota pashiru, kamgambira, “Gwenga gwankugenda kuhowa, toziya mdala yagumtoliti kayugwa kala.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Shaka ashi Abimeleki kaweriti hakenigonji na Sara, su kawankula, “Hashi Mtuwa, haguwalagi wantu yawahera likosa? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Abrahamu mweni ndo yakatakuliti kuwera, ayu dada gwangu, kayi na Sara mweni katakuliti kuwera, ayu kaka gwangu! Neni ntenda vyantenditi kwa moyu guherepa, nahera likosa.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Su Mlungu kamgambira mumpota, “Yina, nivimana kuwera gutenda hangu kwa moyu guherepa, neni ndo yanikuleweleriti kutenda vidoda kwaneni. Toziya ayi nikuleka ndiri gumshinkuli mdala ayu. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Vinu gumuwuziyi mdala ayu kwa mpalu gwakuyi, toziya Abrahamu ndo mbuyi gwa Mlungu. Yomberi hakakuluwili na gwenga hagulikali. Kumbiti pagumuwuziya ndiri, guvimani kuwera gwenga pamuhera na wantu waku woseri, hamuhowi.” <verse eid="GEN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Su Abimeleki kimuka mandawira putiputi, kawashema wakulu woseri yawawera pasi pakuwi woseri na kuwagambira vitwatira vyakaviwoniti mumpota na womberi watiriti nentu. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />“Shakapanu Abimeleki kamshemiti mnumba Abrahamu na kamkosiya, kututendera shishi? Nikutendera shishi shidoda ata gujega ukondora mkulu ntambu ayi kwaneni na ufalumi waneni? Guntendera vitwatira vyavifiruwa ndiri kutendwa. <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Kayi Abimeleki kamkosiya Abrahamu, shintu gaa shashikutenda gutendi hangu?”<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />“Abrahamu kamwankula, ntenditi hangu toziya niliholiti kuwera kwahera yakamtira Mlungu pahala panu na womberi hawandagi toziya ya mdala gwangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Pamuhera na aga, nakaka yomberi mwana gwa mlongu gwa tati gwangu, kumbiti mawu gwantambu yingi na neni nimuyuga kawera mdala gwangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Su Mlungu pakantenditi ng'endi kutali na kaya ya tati gwangu, nimgambiriti, hagulanguziyi mafiliru gaku kwaneni, kila pahala pagugenda, kuusu neni gulongi, neni ndo kaka gwaku.”<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Abimeleki katola wakondolu na wang'ombi pamuhera na wamanda, kampanana Abrahamu na kumuwuziya Sara mdala gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />“Abimeleki kamgambiriti Abrahamu, guloli, isi yoseri ayi yaneni, gulikali kwoseri kwagufira. <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Kayi Abimeleki kamgambiriti Sara. Guloli, neni nimpanana mlongu gwaku magwala elufu yimu ga mpiya su kuwalanguziya woseri yawawera na gwenga kuwera gwahera likosa, gulanguziwa nakaka kuwera gwahera likosa.”<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Shakapanu Abrahamu kamluwiti Mlungu na Mlungu kamponiziya Abimeleki na mdala gwakuyi pamuhera na wamanda wakuyi su wawezi kupata wana, <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />toziya Mtuwa kaweriti kawafindikiti wadala woseri wa kaya ya Abimeleki kupapa wana toziya ya Sara mdala gwa Abrahamu.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s">Kwiwuka kwa Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Mlungu kamtekeriti Sara ntambu yakalagiliti. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Su Abrahamu pakaweriti mgogolu, Sara kapatiti yinda na kaleriti mwana mpalu shaka shilaa shilii Mlungu shakamlagaliti Abrahamu. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Abrahamu kampanana litawu Isaka, mwana ayu yakaleritwi na Sara. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />Isaka pakaweriti na mashaka nani, Abrahamu kamwingiziyiti jandu tambu yailagaliritwi na Mlungu. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Abrahamu kaweriti na mivinja miya shaka Isaka mwana gwakuyi pakayiwukiti. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />“Sara kalonga, Mlungu kampanana nemeleru, yoseri yakapikanira visoweru avi, hakanemeleri pamuhera na neni. <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Shakapanu kongera, gaa mekamgambiri Abrahamu kuwera neni Sara hanoniziyi wana? Kayi nimuyiwulira mwana mpalu muugogolu wakuyi.”<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Isaka kandereyiti kukula na lishaka pakamlekeziyiti kunona, Abrahamu katenditi msambu mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Shakapanu Sara kamwoniti Ishimaeli, mwana gwa Abrahamu yakiyiwukiti na Hagali Mmisri, pakashiniga na kumtendera lijonga Isaka mwana gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />“Su Sara kamgambira Abrahamu, gumuwingi kutali mumanda ayu mdala na mwana gwakuyi. Hapeni mwana gwa mumanda mdala kuhala pamuhera na mwana gwangu Isaka.” <verse eid="GEN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Shitwatira ashi shimtenditi Abrahamu kahinginiki nentu toziya Ishimaeli kaweriti mwana gwakuyi vilaa.<verse eid="GEN 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Kumbiti Mlungu kamgambiriti Abrahamu, “Naguhinginika toziya ya mwana ayu ama mumanda gwaku. Shitwatira shoseri shakakugambiriti Sara gushitendi, toziya shiyiwuku shaku hashilawirani kupitira Isaka ntambu yanilagiliti. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Hanimtendi vilaa mwana gwa mumanda gwaku mdala kaweri tati gwa isi nkulu toziya yomberi vilaa mwana gwaku.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Shilawu yakuwi mandawira putiputi, Abrahamu katola shiboga na shibuyu sha mashi, kampanana Hagali na kamtwika mulikombi, kamlekeziyiti kawuki pamuhera na mwana. Hagali kawuka, kawera kankuyerayera kushiwala Beeri Sheba. <verse eid="GEN 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Mashi pagaperiti muvulu, Hagali kamgonjiziya mwana gwakuyi pasi pa tera. <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />Shakapanu yomberi kagenda pambwega, kalivaga utali wa ligulu limu, pakalitakulira mumoyu mwakuyi; “Mbaka namona mwana gwangu pakahowa.” Na pakaweriti kalivaga palii, kanjiti kulila.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Mlungu kampikaniriti mwana ayu kankulira na ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mlungu kamshemiti Hagali kulawa kumpindi, “Kamkosiya gwana shishi Hagali? Nagutira, Mlungu kapikanira liziwu lya mwana kwakawera aku. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Gugoloki gumnyasuli mwana na gumkoli mumawoku mwaku, tembera hanimtendi kaweri tati gwa wantu wavuwa.” <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Mlungu kamvugula masu Hagali na yomberi kawona linegu lya mashi. Kagenda na kashimemiziya shibuyu sha mashi na kumlandasiya mashi mwana gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Mlungu kawera pamuhera na mwana ayu, na yomberi kendereyiti kukula, kalikaliti kushiwala na kuwera yakaguma misali mgangamala nentu. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Kaweriti kankulikala kushiwala sha Parani na mawu gwakuyi kamhetera mdala kulawa isi ya Misri.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lipatanu lya Abrahamu na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Shaka shilii, Abimeleki pamuhera na Fikoli, mkulu gwa wanjagira wakuyi, kamgenderiti Abrahamu kamgambira, “Mlungu kapamuhera na gwenga mukila shintu shagutenda. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Su gundapili kwa litawu lya Mlungu kuwera hapeni guntendi gunzyangi neni pamuhera na wana wangu ama shiyiwuku shangu. Gunanguziyi uheri ulaa ulii ntambu yanikutendiriti gwenga.”<verse eid="GEN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Abrahamu kawankula, “Nilirapa.” <verse eid="GEN 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Shakapanu Abrahamu kamlalamikira Abimeleki kuusu linegu lya mashi, wantumintumi wa Abimeleki wampokiti. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Abimeleki kamgambira, “Neni nivimana ndiri gaa yakatenditi hangu. Gwenga gung'ambiliti ndiri, leru ndo pampikanira visoweru vyakuwi.”<verse eid="GEN 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Su Abrahamu katola kondolu na ng'ombi kampanana Abimeleki, womberi wawili watenditi lipatanu. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Abrahamu kawatula gweka wana wa kondolu saba washidala. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Abimeleki kamkosiyiti Abrahamu, “Iwera hashi guwatula gweka wana saba wa kondolu awa?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Abrahamu kamwankula, “Wana saba wa kondolu awa yanikupananiti kwa mawoku gangu namweni handa ukapitawu kuwera mbawiti linegu ali.” <verse eid="GEN 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Su pahala palii pashemitwi Beeri Sheba, toziya woseri wawili walirapiliraniti palii.<verse eid="GEN 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Pawatenditi kala mapatanu aku Beeri Sheba, Abimeleki pamuhera na mkulu wa wanjagira wakuyi, wawuyiti muisi ya wafilisti. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Abrahamu kayaliti mtera gwa ukwashu aku Beeri Sheba na kamguwiriti Mtuwa Mlungu gwa mashaka goseri. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Abrahamu kalikaliti isi ya Wafilisti shaka shivuwa.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s">Abrahamu kankumlaviya Isaka kaweri tambiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Pamashaka tunga, Mlungu kamjeriti Abrahamu. Mlungu kamshemiti, “Abrahamu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:1">Yomberi kawankula, “Naam, napanu!”<verse eid="GEN 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Mlungu kamgambira, “Gumtoli Isaka mwana gwaku gwa gweka yagumfira, gugendi mpaka isi ya Moriya, gwakamlaviyi tambiku ya kulunguziya, kulii palugongu lwang'enda kukulanguziya.” <verse eid="GEN 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Su shilawu yakuwi mandawira, Abrahamu kamtandiriti punda gwakuyi. Yomberi kawatoliti wantumintumi wakuyi wawili pamuhera na Isaka mwana gwakuyi. Kazitandira mbawu vilaa za kutendera tambiku ya kulunguziya, shakapanu kanjiti mwanja kugenda pakalagaliritwi na Mlungu. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Mulishaka lya ntatu, Abrahamu kanyasuliti masu gakuyi kapawona pahala palii kwa kutali. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Yomberi kawagambiriti wantumintumi wakuyi, “Muhepi panu na punda ayu, neni pamuhera na mwana gwangu hatugendi mpaka kulii, twakamlaviliri tambiku Mlungu, shakapanu hatuwawuyili.” <verse eid="GEN 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Abrahamu kazitola mbawu zilii, kamtwika Isaka mwana gwakuyi, yomberi katola makala ga motu na shimagi mumawoku. Su wawukiti wawili pamuhera. <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Isaka kamkosiya tati gwakuyi, “Tati makala ga motu na mbawu twanazi, kumbiti mwana gwa kondolu gwa tambiku ya kulunguziya kakoshi?”<verse eid="GEN 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Abrahamu kamwankula, “Mlungu hakalipanani mweni mwana gwa kondolu gwa tambiku ya kulunguziya.” Su wendereyiti na mwanja gwawu.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Pawasokiti pahala Mlungu pakamlagaliriti, Abrahamu kanyawiti shitalawanda sha mabuwi sha kutambikira na kwankanira mbawu pampindi pakuwi. Shakapanu kamtawa Isaka mwana gwakuyi na kumgonjeziya pambawu pakutambikira. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Abrahamu kalitapilisiyiti liwoku lyakuyi, katola shimagi su kamlikituli mwana gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Kumbiti ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa kamshemiti kulawa kumpindi, “Abrahamu! Abrahamu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Yomberi kawankula, “Naam, napanu mpikinira.”<verse eid="GEN 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kamgambiriti, “Nagutenda shoseri kwa muntemba ayu. Vinu nivimana kuwera gumtira na Mlungu, toziya gunima ndiri mwana gwaku, mwana gwa gweka.” <verse eid="GEN 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Abrahamu kanyasuliti masu gakuyi kawona kondolu gwa shipalu, magoli gakuyi gagomiziwa mushitogolu. Su kagenda kumtola kondolu ayu, kamtendera tambiku ya kulunguziwa badala ya mwana gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Su Abrahamu kapapanana pahala palii litawu, “Mtuwa Mlungu hakapanani.” Ntambu yawatakula mpaka leru, “Mulugongu lwa Mtuwa, wantu wapananwa.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa, kamshemiti Abrahamu kulawa kumpindi kwa mala ya pili, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />na kamgambiriti, “Mlungu kalonga hangu, nilirapira namweni kuwera toziya gutenda hangu na gunima ndiri mwana gwaku, <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />nakaka hanikutekeleri na hanishitendi shiyiwuku shaku shiweri gambira ntondu za kulyera, vilaa gambira muhanga gwa kumpeku kwa bahari. Shiyuwuku shaku hashihali lushi za wangondu wawu, <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />kulawirana na shiyiwuku shaku, isi zoseri za pasipanu hawatekelerwi, toziya gwenga gunjimira neni.”<verse eid="GEN 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Su Abrahamu kawawuyiriti wantumintumi wakuyi walii na womberi wawukiti pamuhera kuwuya Beeri Sheba. Abrahamu kalikaliti aku Beeri Sheba. <verse eid="GEN 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />“Pavitwatira avi, Abrahamu kapatiti visoweru kuwera Milika vilaa kapatiti wana, kamwiwulira wana wapalu Nahori mlongu gwaku. <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Usi shipanta njira na Buzi mlongu gwakuyi na Kemueli tati gwa Aramu, <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />na Kesedi na Hazu na Pilidashi na Yidilafu na Betueli.” <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Betueli kamwiwuliriti Rebeka. Milika kamwiwuliriti Nahori, mlongu gwa Abrahamu, wana wanani. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Gamonga ga aga, Leuma na mdala gwa kumbwega gwa Nahori, vilaa kamwiwuliriti Teba na Gahamu na Tahashi na Maaka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Sara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Sara kalikaliti mivinja miya na malongu mawili na saba. Ayi ndo iweriti mivinja ya makaliru ga Sara. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Yomberi kahowiti aku Kiriatiariba, vinu ishemuwa Hebroni muisi ya Kanaani, na Abrahamu kadaya na kutenda shiwembu kwa Sara mdala gwakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Abrahamu kagaleka mauti ga mdala gwakuyi, kalawa kagenda kuyowera na Wahiti, kawagambira, <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />“Neni nilikala gambira muhenga pakati pa mwenga, munshuwuziriri semu ya litapaka yamwenga, su mpati kugasira mauti ga mdala gwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Wahiti wamwankula, <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />“Gwee mtuwa gwetu, gutupikaniri, gwenga gwa mkulu nentu pakati pa twenga. Gufintiri mauti ga mdala gwaku mulipumba lyoseri lyagufira pakati pamapumba getu. Kwahera muntu pakati pa twenga hakakwimi lipumba lyakuyi ama kukulewelera kugasira mauti ga mdala gwaku.” <verse eid="GEN 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Shakapanu Abrahamu kagoloka na kung'ong'ola kwa ligoya kulongolu kwawu wenikaya Wahiti, <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />kawagambira, “Paiwera munjimira nigafindira mauti ga mdala gwangu, shondi mumluwi Efroni mwana gwa Sohari, toziya ya neni, <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />yomberi kanshuuziri mpanga yakuwi ya Makipera yayiwera mumbwega mwa lirambu lyakuyi. Mumluwi ntendi mapumba gangu, kampanani kwa beyi ya imanika palaa panu palongolu penu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Efroni mweni kalikaliti pakati pa wantu wakuyi, yomberi kamwankuliti Abrahamu kulongolu kwa Wahiti woseri yawaweriti paligomi lya lushi. <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />Kamgambiriti, “Ndala mtuwa gwangu, shondi shondi gumpikaniri neni, nankupanana lirambu lyoseri na mpanga yaiweramu, kayi nankumupanana kulongolu kwa wenikaya wayangu. Kufintira mauti ga mdala gwaku.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Abrahamu kang'ong'onala kayi kwa ligoya kulongolu kwa wenikaya, <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />na kamgambira Efroni, wenikaya woseri pawapikanira, “Shondi gumpikaniri. Hanikupanani mpiya za lirambu lyaku. Gunjimiri kuwanka mpiya azi su wezi kugasira mauti ga mdala gwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Efroni kamwankula Abrahamu, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />“Mtuwa gumpikaniri, lirambu lyana samani ya magwala ga mpiya miya msheshi, kumbiti iwera shishi pakati pa neni na gwenga? Gufintiri mauti ga mdala gwaku.” <verse eid="GEN 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Abrahamu kajimilirana na Efroni, kampanana yomberi ntambu yakakantiti kulongolu kwa Wahiti woseri, magwala ga mpiya miya msheshi yagatendelitwi na washuwuzi mumashaka galii.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Su lirambu lya Efroni lya aku Makipela, kwagulawa mshenji aku Mamire, <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />mpanga na mitera yoseri yayiweriti pamuhera na pahala poseri liweriti lya Abrahamu kulongolu kwa Wahiti woseri yawaliwoniti paligomi lya lushi.<verse eid="GEN 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Pa aga, Abrahamu kagasira mauti ga mdala gwakuyi mupanga lyaliweriti mulirambu lya Makipela, uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji aku Mamire, vinu ishemuwa Hebroni mlushi lwa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Lirambu na mpanga vyaviweriti amu vyavishuwuzitwi na Wahiti kwa Abrahamu, nakaka viwera vyakuwi kuwera pahala pa kufindira wantu wakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s">Isaka kankuyuga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Vinu Abrahamu kaweriti mgogolu gwa mivinja ivuwa na Mtuwa kamtekeleriti mukila ntambu. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Abrahamu kamgambiriti ntumintumi gwakuyi yakaweriti mzewi kuliku wamonga na mgolokera gwa ulunda wakuyi woseri, “Gutuli mawoku gaku mumawondu gangu, <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />na neni Hanikulapiri kwa litawu lya Mtuwa, Mlungu gwa kumpindi na pasipanu, kuwera hapeni gumuyugiri mwana gwangu mdala yoseri muwamu mwa wahinga wa Wakanaani yanilikala nawu, <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />kumbiti hagugendi mpaka muisi yangu na kwa walongu wangu, gwakamsakuliri mdala mwana gwangu Isaka.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Ntumintumi kamkosiya, “Pamonga madala ayu hakalemi kugenda pamuhera na neni kwiza aku, payiwera hangu, hashi nimwuziyi mwana gwaku kuisi kwagulawiriti?”<verse eid="GEN 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />“Abrahamu kamwankula, ndala! Guloli weri nagumwuziya mwana gwangu aku.” <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />Mtuwa Mlungu gwa kumpindi, “Yakandaviyiti ukaya kwa tati gwangu na kulawa mulushi mwakayiwukiti na yakatakuliti na neni na kanagiliti kwa kulirapa kuwera hakashipanani shiyiwuku shaneni isi ayi. Yomberi hakamlagaliri ntumintumi gwakuyi gwa kumpindi kulongolu kwaku su gumjegeri mwana gwangu mdala kulawa aku. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Payiweri mdala ayu hakalemi kugenda pamuhera na gwenga, su kulirapa lya neni hapeni likuleweleri. Kumbiti kwa ntambu yoseri nagumwuziya aku mwana gwangu.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Su ntumintumi ayu katula liwoku lyakuyi muliwondu mwa Abrahamu mtuwa gwakuyi, kalirapa kuusu shitwatira ashi.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Shakapanu ntumintumi ulii katoliti wankanyama ngamiya lilongu wa mtuwa gwakuyi, kawuka pakawera na mafupu gaherepa ga kila ntambu. Yomberi kagenditi Misopotamia, mlushi lwakakaliti Nahori. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Pakasokiti aku, yomberi kawasuntamaziya wankanyama ngamiya pakwegera na linegu lyaliweriti kunja kulushi, iweriti pamihi shaka wadala waweriti wankugenda kulinegu kuteka mashi. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Shakapanu yomberi kamluwa Mlungu, “Gwee Mtuwa, Mlungu gwa mtuwa gwangu Abrahamu, guntangi leru na gumtenderi uheri mtuwa gwangu Abrahamu. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Guloli napanu pampeku pa linegu lya mashi, wahinga wenikaya wa lushi alu wiza kuteka mashi. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Su muhinga yang'enda kumgambira, gutuli vulu yaku ya mashi, gumpanani mashi nandi na yomberi pakalonga, gulandi na haniwapanani wankanyama ngamiya waku, yomberi kaweri ndo yagumsyaguliliti ntumintumi gwaku Isaka. Shitwatira ashi hashinanguziyi kuwera gumpanana uheri mtuwa gwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Pamberi pakumalira kuluwa, kamkamu Rabeka kiziti pakalitwika vulu ya mashi mulikombi lyakuyi. Yomberi kaweriti muhinga gwa Betueli mwana gwa Milika, ulii yakaweriti mganafu gwa Nahori, mlongu gwa Abrahamu. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Muhinga ayu kaweriti kaherepa nentu, vilaa kaweriti luyenja, kaweriti hakeniliwoni na mpalu yoseri. Yomberi kiziti kulinegu lya mashi, kasulukiti kuteka mashi na kamemiziyiti vulu yakuwi na kakweniti kuwuya. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Su ntumintumi ulii kagenditi kalongola kuliwona na yomberi, kamgambira, “Shondi shondi, gumpanani mashi nandi kulawa muvulu yaku.”<verse eid="GEN 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Muhinga kamwankula, “Gulandi mtuwa gwangu,” na palaa palii katula vulu yakuwi, pakagukolera su kamlandisiyi. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Pakampananiti kala mashi, kamgambira, haniwatekeri mashi, “Mankanyama ngamiya wakuyi vilaa, walandi woseri mpaka watosheki.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Su yomberi katenditi kalongola, kawamiminira mashi ga vulu yakuwi pahala pa kulandira mashi, katugira kulinegu kateka mashi gavuwa na kuwalandasiya ngamiya wakuyi woseri. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Muntu ulii kaweriti kakumlola weri pota kutakula shoseri, su kavimani kuwera Mtuwa katenda uheri mumwanja gwakuyi ama ndala.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Ngamiya pawamaliriti kulanda mashi, ntumintumi ulii kampananiti muhinga ulii peti ya zahabu yaiwera nkulu na itopa, kampananiti vilaa bangili mbili zyaziwera nkulu na zitopa, kamvalasiya mumawoku gakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />Kamgambira, “Shondi shondi gung'ambili, gwenga mshina gaa? Hashi, kwana shiwogu kwa twenga kugonja ukaya kwa tati gwaku?” <verse eid="GEN 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Rebeka kamwankula, “Neni muhinga gwa Betueli, mwana gwa Milika, mdala gwa Nahori. <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Kwa twenga, kwana mahamba gavuwa ga kuwaliziya wankanyama pamuhera na pahala pakugonja wahenga.”<verse eid="GEN 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Muntu ulii kasuntama makukama na kamguwiriti Mtuwa, <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />katakuliti, “Kakwisuwi Mtuwa, Mlungu gwa mtuwa gwangu Abrahamu, ulii yakalyaluwiti lagiru lyakuyi na ujimirika wakuyi kwa mtuwa gwangu. Mtuwa Mlungu kanongoziya namweni mpaka kwa walongu wa mtuwa gwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Shakapanu muhinga ulii katugiti kuwagambira walongu wa mawu gwakuyi kuusu vitwatira avi. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Vinu Rebeka kaweriti na kaka gwakuyi yakashemwa Labani, yomberi kawukiti kalongola kuliwona na muntu ulii kulinegu. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Pamberi pa Labani kugenda kulinegu kulii, kaweriti kawona peti ilii na bangili mumawoku mwa dada gwakuyi na kupikanira vitwatira Rebeka vyakagambiritwi na muntu ulii. Labani kamwoniti muntu ulii kagolokiti pakwegera na wankanyama ngamiya wakuyi pampeku palinegu. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Labani kamgambira, “Gwizi kwa twenga gwenga gwagutekelerwa na Mtuwa Mlungu. Iwera hashi gugoloka panu? Neni ntandira kala na pahala pa kuwatula ngamiya waku.”<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Su ntumintumi ayu gwa Abrahamu kagenditi kwingira mnumba, Labani kawayopola ngamiya wakuyi na kawapananiti mahamba ngamiya wakuyi, kawapananiti yomberi pamuhera na wantu wakuyi, mashi ga kunaviya magulu gawu. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Su wamtandiriti shiboga, kumbiti yomberi kalongiti, “Hapeni ndiyi mpaka ntakuli shanfiriti kutakula.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Labani kamgambira, “Aya gutugambiri.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Muntu ulii katakula, “Neni ntumintumi gwa Abrahamu.” <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />Mtuwa kamtekeleri nentu mkulu gwangu, na yomberi kaweri muntu kamanikana kampa vipinga vya wakandolu na mifugu ivuwa, madini ga mpiya na zahabu, wantumintumi wapalu na wadala, ngamiya na punda! <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Sara mdala gwa mtuwa gwangu mwana na mtuwa gwangu kampa mwana ayu lunda yakuwi yoseri. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Mtuwa gwangu kantenda napiri pakatakula, “Namsyagulila mwana gwangu muhinga yoseri pakati pa wahinga wa Wakanaani yawalikala muisi yawu. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Su hagugendi mpaka isi yangu kwa walongu wangu, su gumsakulili mdala mwana gwangu Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Na neni nimgambiriti mtuwa gwangu, pamonga mdala ayu hakalemi kugenda pamuhera na neni kwiza aku, hantendi hashi? <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />Kumbiti yomberi kawankula, Mtuwa Mlungu yakanongoziya mumakaliru gangu, hakamtumi ntumintumi gwakuyi gwa kumpindi kagendi pamuhera na gwenga na kugutenda weri mwanja gwaku na gwenga hagumyugili mwana gwangu mdala kulawa kwa walongu wangu na numba ya tati gwangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Handa pagusoka kwa walongu wangu na wakupananiti ndiri muhinga, su hapeni gulewelerwi na kulapirwa kwaneni.<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />Leru pansokiti palinegu nduwa, Mlungu gwa mtuwa gwangu Abrahamu, paguherepeziwa, guntenderi uheri mumwanja gwaniziriti. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Guloli, ngoloka pakwegera pa linegu lya mashi, handa muhinga pakiza kuteka mashi, neni hanimluwi, Shondi shondi gumpanani mashi ga kulanda, <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />na yomberi pakampanana neni mashi, su yomberi kaweri mdala, Mtuwa Mlungu yakamsyagulira mwana gwa mtuwa gwangu.” <verse eid="GEN 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />Pamberi hanenemalili kuluwa mumoyu mwangu, palaa palii Rebeka kasokiti na vulu yakuwi ya mashi pakalitwika mulikombi. <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />“Yomberi kaseleriti kulinegu kuteka mashi na neni nimgambiriti, shondi shondi gumpanani mashi ga kulanda. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Nimkosiyiti, tati gwaku gaa? Kang'ambiriti, neni muhinga gwa Betueli, mwana gwa Milika, mdala gwakuyi Nahori. Su neni nimpananiti peti na kumvalasiya bangili mumawoku mwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Shakapanu nsutamaliti makukama na kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu, Nimkwisa Mtuwa, Mlungu gwa mtuwa gwangu Abrahamu, ulii yakanongoziyiti kwiza kwa muhinga gwa shiyiwuku sha wa mtuwa gwangu kwajili ya mwana gwakuyi.” <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Vinu handa pamunanguziya uheri na ujimirika kwa mtuwa gwangu, mung'ambiri. Na paiwera ndala, vilaa mung'ambiri, neni nivimani shakutenda.<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Labani na Betueli wamwankuliti, “Shitwatira ashi shilawa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, twenga tuweza ndiri kutakula shoseri. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Rebeka kapanu, gumtoli gugendi nayu kaweri mdala gwa mwana gwa mtuwa gwaku, Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakatakuliti.”<verse eid="GEN 24:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Ntumintumi gwa Abrahamu pakapikaniliti aga kamsuntamalira makukama na kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Shakapanu kalaviyiti vintu vya madini ga mpiya na zahabu na nguwu, su kampanana Rebeka. Vilaa kawapanana mafupu walongu wa Rebeka pamuhera na mawu gwakuyi Rebeka mafupu ga mpiya zivuwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Ntumintumi gwa Abrahamu na wantu yakiziti nawu, waliyiti na walanditi na wagonjiti aku. “Paushiyiti kala shilawu yakuwi, yomberi katakuliti, nduwa kuwuya kwa mtuwa gwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Kumbiti walongu wa Rebeka pamuhera na mawu gwakuyi walongiti, “Gumleki muhinga kalikali na twenga shaka shididini hera, mashaka lilongu hangu, shakapanu hamuwezi kuwuka nayu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Kumbiti yomberi kawagambiriti, “Shondi shondi namuntenda nkawi, toziya Mtuwa kantendera weri kala mwanja gwangu, nduwa mundekiziyi mbuyi kwa mtuwa gwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Na womberi wamankula, “Su guleki tumshemi muhinga mweni tumkosiyi. <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Womberi wamshemiti Rebeka na wamkosiya, hashi, hagugendi na muntu ayu?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Yomberi kawankula, hang'endi.”<verse eid="GEN 24:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Su wamleka Rebeka kagendi pamuhera na yaya gwakuyi, ntumintumi gwa Abrahamu pamuhera na wantu wakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Su wamtekeleriti Rebeka pawalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">“Gwee dada gwetu, guweri mawu gwa wana wavuwa yawawalangika ndiri!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">Na walerwa waku wazikolimlima lushi za wangondu waku!”<verse eid="GEN 24:60" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Shakapanu Rebeka na yaya wakuyi wakwena panani pa nkanyama ngamiya na kumfata ntumintumi ayu gwa Abrahamu na woseri wawukiti.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Shaka shilii Isaka kawukiti Beeri Lahai Roi, kaweriti kankulikala aku Negebu. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Lishaka limu pamihi, Isaka kagenditi kuhola kumalambu, su pakanyasuliti masu gakuyi kawona wankanyama ngamiya wankwiza. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Vilaa Rebeka pakanyasuliti masu gakuyi na pakamwoniti Isaka, yomberi kasulukiti pasi <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />na kumkosiya ntumintumi gwa Abrahamu, “Muntu ulii gaa yakatyanga kulilambu kulii, kiza kutuwanka?” Ntumintumi ulii kawankula.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">“Ulii mtuwa gwangu,” Su Rebeka katola nguwu yakuwi, kaligibikira sheni.<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Shakapanu ntumintumi ulii kamgambiriti Isaka goseri yagatendikiti. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Isaka kamtola Rebeka kugenda muliringu lyaliweriti lya Sara mawu gwakuyi. Rebeka kawera mdala gwakuyi na Isaka kamfiriti nentu. Su Isaka kazyangitwi zyangitwi na Rebeka pamawu gwakuyi kuhowa.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Abrahamu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:32-33">1 Mirandu 1:32-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Abrahamu kayugiti mdala yumonga, litawu lyakuyi Ketula. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Ketula kamwiwuliriti Zimrani na Yokishani na Medani na Midiani na Ishibaki na Shuwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yokishani kamwiwuliriti Sheba na Dedani, shiyiwuku sha Dedani waweriti Waashuru na Waletushi na Walewumi. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Wana wa Midiani waweriti Efa na Eferi na Hanoki na Abida na Elidaa, woseri awa waweriti washiyiwuku Abrahamu kupitira Ketula.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Abrahamu kamuhalaziyiti Isaka, ulunda wakuyi woseri. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Kumbiti wana wa wadala wapusu, yomberi kawapananiti mafupu shaka pakaweriti kankali mkomu, shakapanu kawajegiti mulushi lwa gwagulawa mshenji, kutali na Isaka mwana gwakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Abrahamu kalikaliti mivinja miya na malongu saba na muhanu. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Abrahamu kahowiti pakawera na mashaka gavuwa gaherepa, katulwi pamuhera na wantu wakuyi yawamlongoleriti. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Isaka pamuhera na Ishimaeli, wana wa Abrahamu, wamsiriti tati gwawu mumpanga lya Makipela pakwegera na Mamire, mulirambu lyalihemiritwi kwa Efroni mwana gwa Zohari Muhiti, <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />lirambu Abrahamu lyakalihemeriti kwa Wahiti. Mlaa Abrahamu kafindirwa, pahala pakafintilitwi Sara mdala gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Pakahowiti kala Abrahamu, Mlungu kamtekeleriti Isaka mwana gwakuyi, yakalikariti pakwegera na linegu lya Beeri Lahai Roi.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Ishimaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Ashi ndo shiyiwuku sha Ishimaeli, ulii yakayiwukiti kwa Hajili muntu gwa Misri, yakaweriti yaya gwa Sara. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Aga ndo matawu ga mwiwuku gwa Ishimaeli, yagakantitwi kulawirana na uwiyuka wawu, Nebayoti shipanta njira, shakapanu kiwukiti Kedali na Adibeeli na Mibisamu, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Mishima na Duma na Masa <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />na Hadadi na Tema na Yetuli na Nafishi na Kedema. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Awa ndo wana wapalu wa Ishimaeli na aga ndo matawu ga wakolamlima wa nkolu lilongu na mbili ga wantu, kulikala kwawu na vijiji vyawu wamanikana kulawirana na matawu gawu. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Ishimaeli kaweriti na mivinja miya na malongu matatu na saba, pakahowiti kafindiritwi pahala pawasirituwi walongu wazewi wakuyi yawamlongoleriti. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Shiyiwuku sha Ishimaeli walikaliti pahala pakati pa Hawila na Shuri. Womberi wakaliti gwekagweka na shiyiwuku shimonga sha Abrahamu.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiwuka kwa Esawu na Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Aga ndo matawu ga wana wa Isaka mwana gwa Abrahamu. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Isaka pakweriti na mivinja malongu msheshi kamuyugiti Rebeka muhinga gwa Betueli, Mwalamu gwa Padan Aramu. Rebeka kaweriti dada gwakuyi Labani. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Toziya Rebeka kaweriti mpendi, su Isaka kamluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu. Mtuwa Mlungu kajimira kuluwa kwakuyi na Rebeka kapatiti yinda. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Yinda ayi iweriti ya mawila. Wana wawili awa wasinganiti weni kwa weni mumtima mwa Rebeka, na Rebeka kalongiti, “Handa vitwatira avi vya ntambu ayi, kwa shishi kulikala?” Su yomberi kagenditi kumkosiya Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="GEN 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />Mtuwa kamwankula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">“Kwana nkolu mbili mumtima mwaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">na wantu wawili yawagenda kwiyuka kwa gwenga, hawalibaguli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Yumu hakaweri na makakala kuliku yumonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">mkulu hakamtenderi mpusu.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Mashaka gakuyi ga kwiyura pagasokiti, Rebeka kawiyura wana wapalu mawila. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Gwa kwanja kaweriti msheri, kana nvili nshimba yoseri, su kamshema Esawu. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Gwa pili kiwukiti pakawera kamkola Esawu shisukulumbi, su kampapananiti litawu Yakobu. Isaka kaweriti na mivinja miya na malongu na sita, shaka Esawu na Yakobu pakiwukiti.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esawu kankushuwuza uhala wakuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Wana awa wakula Esawu kaweriti mgomiziya mgangamala gwa wankanyama, muntu gwa kuntundu, kumbiti Yakobu kaweriti muntu gwa jii yakalikaliti ukaya. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Su Isaka kamfiriti Esawu toziya kafiliti kuliya vyakagomiziyiti, kumbiti Rebeka kamfiriti Yakobu.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Lishaka limu, Yakobu pakaweriti kankutereka Dengu, Esawu kawuyiti ukaya kulawa kugomiziya wankanyama, yomberi kaweriti na njala nentu. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Su kamgambiriti Yakobu, “Shondi shondi gumpanani shiboga shisheri ashi ndiyi, toziya nana njala nentu.” Ayi ndo mana wampananiti litawu Edomu, mana yakuwi nsheri. <verse eid="GEN 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Yakobu kamuwankula, “Kwanja gunshuwuzili vintu vyoseri vyagufiruwa kupata shipanta njira.”<verse eid="GEN 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Esawu kalonga, “Guloli neni sambira howa, vintu vyoseri vyanfiruwa kupata shipanta njira, havinfai shishi?” <verse eid="GEN 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Yakobu kamgambira, “Gunapili huti.” Su Esawu kamlapira na kashuuza kwa Yakobu, vintu vyoseri vyavifiruwa kupata shipanta njira.<verse eid="GEN 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Shakapnu Yakobu kampananiti Esawu libumunda na likolu lya dengu. Yomberi kaliyiti na kulanda shakapanu kagenditi zakuwi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 25:34">Su Esawu kazarawu vintu vyakuwi vyoseri vyakafiruwa kupata shipanta njira.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s">Isaka na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Shakapanu ilawiriti njala nkulu muisi amu, njala ayi iweriti ya ntambu yingi na njala yailawiriti shaka Abrahamu pakaweriti mkomu. Isaka kagenditi kwa Abimeleki mfalumi gwa Wafilisti aku Gerari. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamlawiriti Isaka na kamgambiriti, “Nagugenda Misri, gwikali muisi yanikugambira. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Gulikali muisi ayi, neni haweri pamuhera na gwenga na hanikutekeleri. Hanikupanani gwenga pamuhera na shiyiwuku shaku isi azi na hananguziyi nakaka shirapu shaneni shanumlapiriti tati gwaku Abrahamu. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Hanishiyongeri shiyiwuku shaku gambira ntondu za kumpindi na Hanishipanani shiyiwuku shaku isi azi za pasipanu, na kulawirana shiyiwuku shaku, wantu woseri wa isi hazitekelerwi, <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />toziya Abrahamu kampikaniriti neni na kugajimira malagalira gangu na amuli zyangu, matakula gangu na malagiru gangu.” <verse eid="GEN 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Su Isaka kalikaliti aku Gerari.<verse eid="GEN 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Wantu wa aku pawamkosiiti shisoweru sha mdala gwakuyi, yomberi kawankula, “Ayu dada gwangu.” Yomberi katiriti kulonga ayu mdala gwangu, kaliholiti kuwera wenikaya nawamlaga toziya ya Rebeka, yomberi kaweriti kaherepa nentu. <verse eid="GEN 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Isaka pakalikaliti aku kwa shaka shitali, Abimeleki mfalumi gwa Wafilisti kasunguliriti kulidilisha lyakuyi, kamwoniti Isaka pakamkisikira mdala gwakuyi Rebeka. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Abimeleki kamshema Isaka na kamgambira, “Nakaka ayu mdala gwaku! Iwera hashi gutugambira kuwera dada gwaku?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Isaka kamwankula, “Toziya niholiti kuwera mendaguwi kwajili yakuwi.”<verse eid="GEN 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Abimeleki kamkosiyiti, “Shitwatira gaa ashi shagututendiriti? Meiweri yumu gwa wantu wangu mekawezi kugonja na mdala gwaku na gwenga megututendi tuweri na ukondola.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Su Abimeleki kawalagaliriti wantu woseri pakalonga, “Yoseri yakamgaziya muntu ayu ama mdala gwakuyi, hakalagwi.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Isaka kayaliti mbeyu muisi ilii, mushinja shilii yomberi kabeniti mala miya na kwongeleka, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kamtekeleriti. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Na yomberi kaweriti mlunda na ulunda wakuyi wendereyiti kwongereka mpaka kaweriti mlunda nentu. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Kaweriti na wakondolu wavuwa na wango'mbi pamuhera na wantumintumi wavuwa, mpaka Wafilisti wamwoniliti weya. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Su manegu goseri yagabawitwi na wantumintumi wa Abrahamu tati gwakuyi, Wafilisti wagafintiriti kwa litapaka.<verse eid="GEN 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Abimeleki kamgambiriti Isaka, “Guwuki kwa twenga, toziya gwenga guwera na makakala makulu kuliku twenga.” <verse eid="GEN 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Su Isaka kawuka aku, kagonjera mwanja lularanda mlushi lwa Gerari, kalikaliti aku. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Isaka kagafukula manegu yagabawitwi mumashaka ga Abrahamu tati gwakuyi, manegu yagafintilitwi na Wafilisti pakuhowa Abrahamu. Isaka kagapananiti matawu galaa galii gakapananitwi na tati gwakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Wantumintumi wa Isaka wabawiti muliranda lulii na wapatiti linegu lyalibwitula mashi gaherepa. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Kumbiti walolera wa wankanyama wa Gerari, waweriti na ngondu na walolera wa wankanyama wa Isaka na walongiti, “Mashi aga ga twenga.” Su Isaka kalishema linegu ali “Eseki,” toziya walewaniti na yomberi.<verse eid="GEN 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Shakapanu wabawa linegu limonga na ali walewaniriti vilaa, su Isaka kalishema linegu ali Sitina. Mana yakuwi weya. <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Shakapanu Isaka kagenda pahala pamonga na kubawa linegu limonga, kumbiti linegu ali watenditi ndiri ngondu, su Isaka kalishema linegu ali Rehuboti pakatakula, “Vinu Mtuwa Mlungu katupanana tulikali kwa ponga na twenga hatwongereki muisi ayi.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Kulawa aku Isaka kagenditi Beeri Sheba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Pashiru panu Mtuwa Mlungu kamlawiriti na kugambira, “Neni ndo Mlungu gwa tati gwaku Abrahamu, nagutira toziya neni napamuhera na gwenga. Hanikutekeleri na kushyongera shiyiwuku shaku kwajili ya Abrahamu, ntumintumi gwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Su Isaka kanyawa shitalawanda sha mabuwi sha kutambikira palii na kamguwiriti Mtuwa Mlungu. Yomberi kanyawiti liringu lyakuyi aku na wantumintumi wakuyi wabawiti linegu lyamonga.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isaka na Abimeleki wankulikola mawoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Abimeleki kalawiti Gerari pakawera pamuhera na Ahuzati na mshawuli gwakuyi na Fikoli mkulu gwa wanjagira wakuyi, wamgenderiti Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Isaka kamkosiya, “Iwera hashi mwiza kwaneni, mwenga munkalariti na munwingiti?”<verse eid="GEN 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Womberi wamwankula, “Tuwona pota kufifa, Mtuwa Mlungu kapamuhera na gwenga, su tulihola ifaa tulilapiri pamuhera na gwenga na tujimilirani <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />kuwera nagututenda gambira twenga tuwatenditi vidoda kumbiti tuwatendiriti viheri shaka shoseri na kuwawusiya kwa ponga kulawa kwatwenga. Na vinu Gutekelerwa na Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="GEN 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Su Isaka kawatenderiti msambu, womberi waliyiti na kulanda. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Shirawu yakuwi pamandawira, womberi walirapiriti weni kwa weni. Shakapanu Isaka kawalekiziyiti wagendi zawu, su wamlekiti Isaka ponga.<verse eid="GEN 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Lishaka lilaa lilii wantumintumi wa Isaka wamgenderiti na kumgambira visoweru vya linegu lilii lyawabawiti. Womberi walonga, “Tupata mashi!” <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Su Isaka kalishema linegu ali “Shiba.” Na kwanjira lishaka ali litawu lya lushi alu lushemwa Beeri Sheba.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wadala wa Esawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Esawu pakaweriti na mivinja malongu msheshi, kayugiti wadala wawili, Yudisi muhinga gwa Beeri Muhiti na Basemati muhinga gwa Eloni Muhiti. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Kumbiti wadala awa wagatenditi makaliru ga Isaka na Rebeka gaweri ga hinginiku.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s">Isaka kankumpetera mashi Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Isaka kaweriti mgogolu na masu gakuyi ganjiti kuwona ndiri, su kamshemiti Esawu mwana gwakuyi mkulu na kamgambira, “Mwana gwangu!” Na yomberi kitikira, napanu tati!<verse eid="GEN 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Isaka kalonga, “Guloli, neni vinu namgogolu na nilimana ndiri lishaka lyaneni lya kuhowa. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Vinu gutoli upindi waku na misali yaku, gugendi kuntundu gwakagomiziyi nkanyama gunjegeri. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />Shakapanu guntandiri shiboga shilii shinoga shanfira, gunjegeri su ndiyi, su hanikupeteri mashi pamberi pa kuhowa kwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Kumbiti Isaka pakaweriti kunkuyowera na Esawu, Rebeka kaweriti kankupikinira. Su Esawu pakagenditi kuntundu kugomiziwa wankanyama, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Rebeka kamgambiriti Yakobu mwana gwakuyi, “Nimpikanira tati gwaku pakamgambira kaka gwaku Esawu, <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />kanjegeri nkanyama yakamgomiziyiti na kamtelekeri shiboga shinoga ndiyi, hanikupeteri mashi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, pamberi neni hanehowi. <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Vinu mwana gwangu, gupikanili weri shanukugambira. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Gugendi muliboma lya wankanyama, gunjegeri wana wawili wa mbuzi waherepa, su neni hantandiri shiboga shinoga ntambu yakafira tati gwaku. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Shakapanu gumjegeri tati gwaku kaliyi, kapati kukupetera mashi pamberi pa kuhowa kwakuyi.”<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Kumbiti Yakobu kamgambiriti Rebeka mawu gwakuyi, “Guliholi kaka gwangu Esawu kana nvili zivuwa mushimba, neni nahera. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Hayiweri hashi tati pakanshikula na kuyambuya kuwera nimzyanga? Hanilijegeri pangilu namweni badala ya matekeleru.”<verse eid="GEN 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Mawu gwakuyi kamgambira, mwana gwangu guleki pangilu yoseri impati neni, “Gwenga gutendi ntambu yanikulagalira, gugendi gwakanjegeri wana wa mbuzi.” <verse eid="GEN 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Su Yakobu kagenda, katola wana wawili wa mbuzi, kamjegera mawu gwakuyi na yomberi katandira shiboga shinoga shakafiriti Isaka tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Shakapanu Rabeka katola nguwu ziherepa za Esawu mwana gwakuyi mkulu yakaweriti nazi ukaya, kamvalasiya Yakobu mwana mpusu. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Vilaa kamvalasiya lukuli lwa wana wa mbuzi, mumawoku na semu zazihera nvili musingu yakuwi. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Shakapanu kampanana shiboga shinoga shilii na libumunda lyakalitandiriti.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />“Su Yakobu kingira mnumba mwa tati gwakuyi, kamshema tati gwangu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Na yomberi kitikira, napanu, gwagaa gwenga mwana gwangu?”<verse eid="GEN 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Yakobu kamwankula tati gwakuyi, neni Esawu, shipanta njira waku. “Ntenda ntambu yagung'ambiliti, vinu gulikali na guliyi shilii shangomiziyiti, su gupati kumpetera mashi.”<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Kumbiti Isaka kamkosiyiti mwana gwakuyi, “Iwera hashi gupata kalongola ntambu ayi shagugomiziyiti mwana gwangu? Yakobu kamwankula, Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku kampananiti.<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Shakapanu Isaka kamgambiriti Yakobu, gusegeleri pakwegera mpati kukushinkula su nivimani kuwera nakaka gwenga gwamwana gwangu Esawu ama ndala.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Yakobu kamgenderiti kulikala pakwegera na Isaka tati gwakuyi, “Yomberi kamshinkula shinkula na kulonga, liziwu lya Yakobu, kumbiti mawoku ga Esawu.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Yomberi kayambuliti ndiri, toziya mawoku gakuyi gaweriti gawera na nvili gambira mawoku ga Esawu kaka gwakuyi, su kanjiti kumpetera mashi. <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />Yomberi kamkosiyiti kayi, “Nakaka gwenga gwa mwana gwangu Esawu?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Yomberi kawankula, yina.<verse eid="GEN 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Shakapanu Isaka kalongiti, mwana gwangu gunjegeri vinofu avi ndiyi, su hanikupeteri mashi. Yakobu kamjeriti na yomberi kaliyiti, kamjegiriti vilaa divayi kalanda. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Isaka tati gwakuyi kamgambiriti, mwana gwangu, gusegeleri pakwegera na gunoni. <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Su yomberi kamsegelera pakwegera na kamnona, tati gwakuyi pakapatiti ununkira wa nguwu zakuwi, yomberi kampeteriti mashi na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:27">guloli, ununkira wa mwana gwangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:27">gulifana gambira ununkira wa lirambu Mtuwa Mlungu lyakalitekeleriti!<verse eid="GEN 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Mlungu kakumiminiri mangami ga kumpindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">kakupanani litapaka lyaliwera na mbotu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">kakupanani viboga na divayi ivuwa.<verse eid="GEN 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Wantu wakutenderi gwenga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">na wantu wa isi wakusuntamaliri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">Guweri mkolamlima kwa walongu waku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">kapangiluwi yoseri yakakupangila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">na katekelerwi yoseri yakakutekelera!”<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esawu kankuluwa matekeleru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Isaka pakamaliliti kumpetera mashi Yakobu na Yakobu pakaweriti kankuwuka kulongolu kwa tati gwakuyi, Esawu kaka gwakuyi kawuya kulawa mukugomiziya. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Esawu katandira shiboga shinoga vilaa, “Kamjegera tati gwakuyi na kamgambira, shondi shondi tati, gwimuki guliyi shangomiziyiti neni mwana gwaku, su gupati kumpetera mashi!”<verse eid="GEN 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />“Isaka kamkosiya, gwenga gwa gaa?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">Yomberi kamwankula, neni mwana gwaku, Esawu shipanta njira waku.<verse eid="GEN 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Isaka katetema nentu kwa lyoga, katakula, hashi, gaa yakagomiziyiti nkanyama na kunjegera, neni ndiyiti kala pamberi pa gwenga kwiza? Nimpetera kala mashi, yomberi Watekeleritwi kala.<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Esawu pakapikaniriti visoweru vya tati gwakuyi, kalira kwa liziwu na kwa utama mumoyu na kumgambira tati gwakuyi, shondi shondi tati gwangu, gumpeteri mashi naneni vilaa!<verse eid="GEN 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Kumbiti Isaka kalonga, Mlongu gwaku kiza kwa kunzyanga na katola matekeleru gaku.<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Esawu kalonga, ndo mana kashemwa Yakobu! Katola lupenyu lwangu mala mbili, kwanja katola vintu vyaneni vyoseri vya shipanta njira na vinu katola matekeleru gangu. Shakapanu kamkosiya tati gwakuyi, hashi, gundekera ndiri tekeleru lyoseri?<verse eid="GEN 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Isaka kamwankula, nimtenda kala Yakobu kaweri mkolamlima gwaku na kumpanana walongu wakuyi woseri waweri wantumintumi wakuyi, nimtenda kaweri na viboga pamuhera na divayi. Hashi, mwana gwangu, nikutenderi shishi vinu?<verse eid="GEN 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Esawu kamgambira tati gwakuyi, tati, gwana litekeleru limu hera? Tati gumpeteri mashi naneni! Su Esawu kanjiti kulila kwa liziwu. <verse eid="GEN 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Shakapanu Isaka tati gwakuyi kamgambiriti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">pakulikala paku hapaweri kutali na litapaka lyaliwera na mbotu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">kutali na mangami ga kumpindi.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Hagulikali kwa ligumba lyaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">na hagumtenderi mpusu gwaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">kumbiti pagulema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">haguweri mlekeru kulawa kwa mpusu gwaku.” <verse eid="GEN 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Su Esawu kamkalaliriti “Yakobu toziya tati gwakuyi kampeteriti mashi Yakobu. Esawu kaligambiriti mweni, mashaka ga kudaya shiwembu pagapera, hanimlagi mpusu gwangu Yakobu.”<verse eid="GEN 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Kumbiti Rebeka pakavimaniti liholu lya mwana gwakuyi shipanta njira, “Kamgambiriti Yakobu, gulikali weri, kaka gwaku Esawu kankulihola mumoyu kukulaga. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Vinu mwana gwangu gutendi shanukukugambira. Gutugili kugenda kwa kaka gwangu Labani aku Harani, <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />gulikali na yomberi mpaka maya ga kaka gwaku pagapera. <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />Mlongu gwaku pakahera maya na gwenga na kalyaluwa shagumtendiriti, hanikujegeri ujumbi guwuyi. Kwashishi niwapotuziyi woseri wawili kwa shaka shimu?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu kankutugira kwa Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Rebeke kamgambira Isaka, “Nahera nemeru nakamu mumakaliru gangu toziya ya wadala awa wa aku Hiti. Paiwera Yakobu hakayugi yumu gwawu gwa wadala awa kwa Wahiti, neni hapeni weri na mota ya kulikala.”<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Su Isaka kamshemiti Yakobu, kampetera mashi na kamlagalira pakalonga, “Naguyuga mdala yoseri muntu gwa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Gugendi Padan Aramu, ukaya kwa mbuyi gwaku Betueli tati gwa mawu gwaku, gwakayugi yumu gwa muhinga gwa Labani kaka gwa mawu gwaku. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Mlungu yakawera na likakala na kakutekeleri gupati walera wavuwa na kwongereka mpaka guweri mbuyi gwa wantu wa isi zivuwa. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Kakutekeleri gwenga pamuhera na shiyiwuku shaku matekeleru galii gakamtekeleriti Abrahamu, su guhali isi yagulikala gambira muhenga, isi Mlungu yakampananiti Abrahamu!” <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Su Isaka kamlekeziyiti Yakobu kagendi, yomberi kagenditi Padan Aramu kwa Labani mwana gwa Betueli muntu gwa Aramu, kaka gwa Rebeka, ulii mawu gwawu Yakobu na Esawu.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Vinu Esawu kavimaniti kuwera Isaka kampeteriti mashi Yakobu na kamlagaliriti yomberi kagendi kuyuga aku Padan Aramu na pakampetiriti mashi, kamleweleriti nakayuga mdala muntu gwa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />Yakobu kamjimiriti mawu gwakuyi na tati gwakuyi, su kagenditi Padan Aramu. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Shakapanu Esawu kavimaniti kuwera tati gwakuyi kafiriziwitwi ndiri na wadala wa Kanaani, <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />su kagenditi kwa Ishimaeli mwana gwa Abrahamu na kamuyugiti Mahalati muhinga gwa Ishimaeli, dada gwakuyi Nebayoti.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulota kwa Yakobu aku Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Yakobu kawukiti Beri Sheba na kugenda Harani. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Pakasokiti pahala pamu, kagonjiti mpota toziya mshenji guweriti gunala. Yomberi katoliti libuwi limu lya pahala palii, kalitenda msagamu, kagonja. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Mumpota yomberi kalota, kawoniti lukweneru lwalugolosiwitwi kugenda kumpindi, wantumintumi wa kumpindi waweriti wankukwena kugenda kumpindi na kusuluka mlukweneru alu. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Mtuwa Mlungu kagolokiti pampindi pa lukweneru alu, kamgambira, “Neni ndo Mtuwa, Mlungu gwa Abrahamu tati gwaku, na Mlungu gwa Isaka. Lushi lwagulugonjera hanikupanani gwenga na shiyiwuku shaku. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Shiyuwuku shaku hashiweri shivuwa gambira lidika lya litapaka, na hamuweri kila pahala, kwagulawa mshenji na kwaguzyeta mshenji, kushana na kusika. Wantu woseri wa pasipanu hawatekelerwi kupitira gwenga na shiyiwuku shaku. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Neni napamuhera na gwenga, hanikuloleri weri kwoseri kwagugenda na kukuwuziya mlushi alu. Hapeni nikuleki mpaka pantenda shilii shanukulagiliti.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Shakapanu Yakobu kimuka kulawa mumpota, kaliholiti, “Nakaka Mtuwa kapanu, neni nivimaniti ndiri!” <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Yakobu katiriti na kulonga, “Pahala panu patiliziya nentu! Pamonga pawera numba ya Mlungu na ligomi lya kumpindi.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Yakobu kimukiti mandawira putiputi, katola libuwi lilii lyakatenditi msagamu, kaligolosiya gambira lusiki na kalumiminiriti lipaki panani pakuwi na kulitenda liweri lya Mlungu. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Yomberi kapashema pahala palii Beteli, kumbiti litawu ligona lya pahala pali liweriti Luzi. <verse eid="GEN 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Shakapanu Yakobu kalapiriti pakalonga, “Handa haguweri pamuhera naneni na kundolera weri mumwanja gwangu na pagumpanana shiboga na nguwu ya kuvala, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />su mbuyi salama ukaya kwa tati gwangu, gwenga Mtuwa Mlungu haguweri Mlungu gwangu. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Na libuwi ali lyangolosiyiti panu gambira lusiki, hapaweri pahala pa kukuguwira, naneni hanikupanani semu ya lilongu lya vintu vyoseri vyagugenda kumpanana neni.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu kankusoka kwa Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Yakobu kendereyiti na mwanja gwakuyi, kasokiti isi ya wantu aku kwagulawa mshenji. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Lishaka kawoniti linegu lya mashi muntundu, vilaa kawoniti vipinga vitatu vya wakondolu wagonja pakwegera na linegu lilii toziya waweriti wankulanda mashina mulinegu ali. Libuwi lyaligubika linengu liweriti likulu <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />na wakondolu pawajojonika palii, walolera wa wankanyama waliwusiyaga libuwi ali palinegu na kuwalandasiya mashi. Shakapanu waliwuziya kugubika linegu.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Yakobu kawakosiya walolera wa wankanyama, “Walongu wangu mlawa koshi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Womberi wamwankula, “Tulawa Harani,”<verse eid="GEN 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Yomberi kakosiyiti kayi, “Mumumana Labani mzukulu gwa Nahori?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Womberi wamwankula, “Yina, Tummana.”<verse eid="GEN 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Yakobu kendereyiti kuwakosiya, “Hashi, yomberi kakashina?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">Womberi wamwankula, “Yina kakashina, ata Raheli muhinga gwakuyi Labani, kankwiza na wakondolu wakuyi!”<verse eid="GEN 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Yakobu kawagambira, “Mloli, kwankali paliwala na shaka ashi shakujojonira ndiri wakondolu, su muwalandasiyi mashi wakondolu, mgendi mwakawaloleri.”<verse eid="GEN 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Womberi wamgambira, “Tuweza ndiri kutenda ntambu ayi mpaka vipinga vyoseri vijojoniki pamuhera na libuwi libiringisiwi kumbeku kulinegu tuwalandasiyi mashi wakondolu.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Yakobu pakaweriti kankali kankuyowera na walolera wa wankanyama, Raheli kasoka pakawera na wakondolu wa tati gwakuyi, mweni kaweriti kankuwalolera. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Yakobu pakamwoniti Raheli muhinga gwa Labani, kaka gwa mawu gwakuyi na pakawoniti wakondolu wa Labani, yomberi kagenditi kulibilingisiya libuwi lilii palinegu na kavilandasiyiti mashi vipinga vya wakondolu wa Labani kaka gwa mawu gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Shakapanu Yakobu kamnonera Raheli na kanjiti kulira kwa liziwu. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Su Yakobu kamgambiriti Raheli kuwera mweni yumu gwa walongu wa tati gwakuyi, vilaa mwana gwa Rebeka. Raheli katugiriti ukaya kumgambira tati gwakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Labani pakapikaniriti visoweru kuusu Yakobu mwipa gwakuyi, katugiti kugenda kumwanka, yomberi kamkisikira na kumunonera, kamshemera ukaya kwakuyi. Yakobu kamgambiriti Labani vitwatira vyoseri vyavilawiriti. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Labani kalonga, “Nakaka, gwenga gwa mlongu gwangu gwa mwazi.” Yakobu kalikaliti nayomberi kwa mwezi gumu.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu kankuyuga wahinga wa Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Labani kamgambira Yakobu, “Gwenga gwa mlongu gwangu, kumbiti hapeni gutendi lihengu pota shibenamgongu. Gung'ambili, hashi hanikupanani malipu shyasi gaa?” <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Vinu Labani kaweriti na wahinga wawili, mkulu kashemwa Leya na mpusu kashemwa Raheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Leya kaweriti na masu ga kulembula, kumbiti Raheli kaweriti kaherepa nentu.<verse eid="GEN 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Yakobu kamfiriti Raheli, su kamgambiriti Labani, “Hanikutenderi lihengu kwa mivinja saba,su nimuyugi Raheli muhinga gwaku mpusu.” <verse eid="GEN 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Labani kamgambira, “Mbaka nikupanani muhinga ayu gwenga kuliku kumpanana muntu yumonga yoseri. Gwendereyi kulikala panu naneni.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Su Yakobu kamgendiriti lihengu Labani kwa mivinja saba toziya kamuyugi Raheli, kumbiti kwa yomberi shaka ashi shiweriti shaka shididini toziya kamfiriti nentu Raheli.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Shakapanu Yakobu kamgambiriti Labani, “Gumpanani mdala gwangu mfira kumuyuga toziya shaka shaneni kutenda lihengu shipela.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Su Labani kawashemeriti wantu woseri wa pahala palii na katenditi msambu gwa ndowa. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Kumbiti pashiru, Labani kamtola Leya muhinga gwakuyi mkulu na kumjega kwa Yakobu, Yakobu kagonja nayu. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Labani kamlaviya Zilipa ntumintumi gwakuyi mdala kaweri yaya gwa Leya muhinga gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Mandawira shilawu yakuwi, Yakobu kayambuliti kuwera yomberi kaweriti Leya. Yakobu kakalaliti na kamkosiyiti Labani, “Hashi, guntendera shitwatira gaa? Nikutenderiti lihengu toziya ya Raheli, iwera hashi gunzyanga?”<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Labani kamwankula, “Mlushi lwa twenga hatwenitendi shitiba sha ntambu ayi, kumlaviya muhinga mpusu pamberi pa muhinga shipanta njira. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Gumaliri mashaka saba ga msambu gwa ndoa kulikala na Leya, shakapanu hanikupanani Raheli muhinga ayu mpusu kwa kuntendera lihengu mivinja yamonga saba.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Yakobu katenditi ntambu yawamlagiliriti. Yomberi kamaliriti mashaka saba ga msambu gwa ndoa kulikala na Leya, shakapanu Labani kampanana Yakobu, Raheli muhinga gwakuyi mpusu kaweri mdala gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Labani kamlaviya Biliha, ntumintumi gwakuyi mdala kaweri yaya gwa Raheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Yakobu su kagonja na Raheli vilaa, yomberi kamfiriti nentu Raheli kuliku Leya. Su kamtenderiti lihengu Labani kwa mivinja saba yamonga.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Mtuwa Mlungu pakawoniti kuwera Leya kakalalirwa, kampanana wana, kumbiti Raheli kaweriti mpendi. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Leya kapata yinda, kawiyula mwana mpalu, kamshema Rubeni, yomberi kalonga, “Mtuwa Mlungu kawona hinginiku yangu, pamonga mpalu gwangu hakanfiri.” <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Yomberi kapatiti kayi yinda yamonga, kamwiwuliti mwana mpalu, kamshema Simoni, su kalonga, “Mtuwa kampanana mwana mpalu yumonga toziya kapikanira ntambu yankalalirwa.” <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Yomberi kapatiti kayi yinda yamonga, kamwiwula mwana mpalu, kamshema Lawi, su kalonga, “Shaka ashi mpalu gwangu hakalimatiri pamuhera na neni toziya nimwiwulira wana wapalu watatu.” <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Leya kapatiti kayi yinda, kamwiwula mwana mpalu, kamshema Yuda, yomberi kalonga, “Shaka ashi Hanimkwisi Mtuwa Mlungu” Shakapanu Leya koyiti kwiyula wana.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Raheli pakawoniti kuwera kamwiwulira ndiri Yakobu mwana yoseri, su kamwoneriti weya Leya, dada gwakuyi na kamgambiriti Yakobu, “Gumpanani wana, paiwera ndiri hangu hahowi.” <verse eid="GEN 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Yakobu kamkalaliriti Raheli na kamgambiriti, “Neni wera badala ya Mlungu, yakakutenda nagupata wana?” <verse eid="GEN 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Shakapanu Raheli kamgambiriti Yakobu, “Biliha yaya gwangu mdala kapanu, gugonji nayu su mpati wana kupitira yomberi.”<verse eid="GEN 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Su Raheli kamlekeziya Yakobu, Biliha yaya gwakuyi. Yakobu kamgonja na Biliha, <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />na shakapanu kapatiti yinda na kumwiyulira Yakobu mwana mpalu. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Raheli kalonga, “Mlungu kantendera weri, kapikana kulira kwaneni na kampanana mwana mpalu.” Mwana ayu kamshema Dani. <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Biliha yaya mdala gwa Reheli kapatiti yinda kayi na kamwiwulira Yakobu mwana mpalu gwa pili. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Shakapanu Raheli kalonga, “Tulilewiti nentu na dada gwangu na neni nimkanga.” Su mwana ayu kamshema Nafutali.<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Leya pakawoniti koya kwiyula wana, yomberi kamtoliti Zilipa, yaya gwakuyi mdala na kampanana Yakobu mpalu gwakuyi su kaweri mdala gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Zilipa kamwiwulira Yakobu mwana mpalu. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Leya katakula, “Bahati iherepa.” Su kampanana mwana litawu Gadi. <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Zilipa yaya gwa Leya, kamwiwuliriti Yakobu mwana gwa pili mpalu. <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Leya kalonga, “Bahati iherepa, vinu wadala awa hawanshemi nemeru.” Su kampanana mwana litawu Asheri.<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Mushaka sha kubena nganu, Rubeni kagenditi kulirambu na aku kapatiti shimeru, mishigira yakuwi yaiweza kumtenda mdala kawezi kupata yinda, su kamjegeriti Leya mawu gwakuyi. Reheli kamgambira Leya, “Shondi shondi, gumpanani mishigira yakawera nayu mwana gwaku, ilii yaiweza kumtenda mdala kapati yinda.”<verse eid="GEN 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Kumbiti Leya kamgambiriti pakakalipa, “Hashi ikutoshiti ndiri kumtola mpalu gwangu, na vinu gufira gutoli mishigira yaimtenda mdala kawezi kupata yinda, mishigira yakawera nayu mwana gwangu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Raheli kamwankula, “Handa pagumpanana mishigira ayi yakawera nayu mwana gwaku, Yakobu hakagonji na gwenga pashiru leru.” <verse eid="GEN 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Su Yakobu pakaweriti kankuwuya kulawa kulirambu, Leya kagenditi kumwanka, su kamgambira, “Leru mpaka gugonji na neni, toziya nikuazima kwa mshigira yaimtenda mdala kawezi kupata yinda, mishigira yakawera nayu mwana gwangu.” Su Yakobu kagonjiti kwa Leya pashiru pamu.<verse eid="GEN 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Mlungu kapikana kuluwa kwa Leya na yomberi kapatiti yinda kamwiwulira Yakobu mwana mpalu gwa muhanu. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Leya kalongiti, “Mlungu kampanana shanfiriti toziya nimpananiti mpalu gwangu, yaya gwangu mdala.” Su kampanana mwana litawu Isakari. <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Leya kapatiti kayi yinda na kamwiwuliriti Yakobu mwana mpalu gwa sita. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Yomberi kalongiti, “Mlungu kampananiti lifupu lya upeleru. Vinu mpalu gwangu hakanjimiri toziya nimwiwulira wana wapalu sita.” Su kampanana mwana litawu Zabuloni. <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Shakapanu kamwiwula mwana mdala kamshema Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Shakapanu Mlungu kamuhola Raheli, kajimiriti kuluwa kwakuyi, kamtenditi kapati mwana. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Raheli kapatiti yinda, kamwiwula mwana mpalu, yomberi kalonga, “Mlungu kambusilira soni yangu.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Su kampanana mwana litawu Yusufu, yomberi pakalonga, “Mtuwa Mlungu kanongeri mwana mpalu gwingi.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu kankuwera mlunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Raheli pakamwiyuliti kala Yusufu, Yakobu kamgambira Labani, “Gundekeziyi mbuyi muisi yangu. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Gumpanani wadala wangu pamuhera na wana wangu yawalawiraniti na kukutendera lihengu. Gwenga guvimana kwantambu shyasi gaa shanukutendiriti lihengu.”<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Kumbiti Labani kamgambiriti, “Gundeki na neni ntakuli. Nivimana kwa kutunga kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu kantekelera toziya ya gwenga.” <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Yomberi kendereyiti kulonga, “Gutakuli shibenamgongu shaku na neni hanikupanani.”<verse eid="GEN 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Yakobu kamgambira, “Gamweni gwenga guvimana ntambu yanikutenderiti lihengu na ntambu yanikuloleriti weri wankanyama waku. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Pamberi pa kwiza kwa gwenga, guweriti na ulunda utangala ndiri, ulunda waku wongerekiti nentu na Mtuwa Mlungu kakutekeleriti nentu kwoseri kwang'enditi. Kumbiti vinu haniyiloleri ndii kaya yangu?”<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Labani kamkosiya, “Nkupi shishi?” Yakobu kamwankula, “Hapeni gumpanani shoseri. Hanendereyi kuwalolera wankanyama waku payiwera haguntenderi shitwatira ashi. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Gundekeziyi mpiti pakati pa vipinga vya wankanyama waku leru, mbaguli kuwatula gweka kila kondolu yakawera na madowa na mabaka na kila kondolu yakawera mtitu na mbuzi yawawera na madowadowa na mabakamabaka. Ashi hashiweri shibena mgongu shaneni. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Su mgohilila gwangu hagung'ambiri shakapanu, pagwiza na kuwona shibenamgongu shangu. Mbuzi yoseri yakahera madoadoa ama mabakabaka, ama kondolu yoseri yakawera mtitu ndiri mulipinga lyangu lya wankanyama, ayu hakaweri wamwiwa.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Labani kalongiti, “Yina! Iweri ntambu yagulongiti.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Kumbiti lishaka lilaa lii, Labani kagenditi kuwabagula gweka wankanyama woseri washipalu yawawera na madowadowa na wambuzi woseri washidala yawawera na madowadowa na mabakabaka, kila nkanyama yakaweriti mfufu mushimba mwakuyi na kila kondolu mtitu, woseri kawatuliti pasi pa uloleruwa wa wana wakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Shakapanu Labani kalikala gweka na Yakobu mwanja gwa shaka sha mashaka matatu, Yakobu kendereyiti kuwalolera wankanyama wa Labani yawasigaliti.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Shakapanu Yakobu katoliti fimbu ya mtera gwa mwalamoni, kayibandula misitali mifufu iwoneki mufimbu azi. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Kazigolosiya fimbu zilii zakabanduliti palongolu pa wankanyama mulinegu lya mashi pahala wankanyama pawaweriti wankwiza kulanda mashi. Su wankanyama pawiziti kulanda mashi, toziya waweriti mushaka sha kupata yinda, <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />su wapatiti yinda kulongolu kwa fimbu azi, wawiwuliiti wankanyama yawawera na malembu na mabakabaka pamuhera na madoadoa.<verse eid="GEN 30:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Yakobu kawatula gweka wakondolu na wambuzi awa, shakapanu mushaka sha wankanyama kupata yinda, yomberi kawaloleziya muwankanyama yawawera na malembu na yawawera watitu mushipinga sha Labani. Su kwa ntambu ayi, Yakobu kapatiti shipinga sha wankanya wakuyi mweni, kalihanganiyiti ndiri na shipinga sha wankanyama wa Labani.<verse eid="GEN 30:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Kila shaka sha wankanyama sha kupata yinda pashisokiti, Yakobu kazituliti fimbu zilii kulongolu kwawu mulinegu lya mashi, su wankanyama waweri na yinda kupitira fimbu azi. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Kumbiti kazitula ndiri fimbu azi kulongolu kwa nkanyama legilegi pawaweriti na yinda. Katepu hera wankanyama legilegi waweriti wa Labani na yawanenepa waweriti wa Yakobu. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Su Yakobu kaweriti mlunda nentu, kaweriti na vipinga vikulu vya wankanyama, wantumintumi wadala na wapalu, wankanyama ngamiya na wankanyama punda.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s">Mlungu kamshema Yakobu kuwuya Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Su Yakobu kawapikaniriti wana wa Labani pawalonga, “Yakobu katola kila shintu sha tati gwetu, yomberi kawera na ulunda awu woseri kulawirana na virii vyaviwera vya tati gwetu.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Yakobu kavimaniti kuwera Labani kamsheriti ndiri mweni gambira kwanja ntambu yaiweriti. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Shakapanu Mtuwa kamgambiriti Yakobu, “Guwuyi mlushi lwa wazewi waku na kwa walongu waku, neni haweri pamuhera na gwenga.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Su Yakobu kawatuma wantu kuwashema Raheli na Leya, na womberi wamgenderiti kuntundu kwakaweriti kankuwalolera wankanyama. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Yakobu kawagambira, “Mona kuwera tati gwenu kanshera ndiri gambira kwanja ntambu yaiweriti, kumbiti Mlungu gwa tati gwangu kapamuhera na neni. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Muvimana kuwera nimtendera tati gwenu kwa makakala gangu goseri, <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />pamuhera na hangu yomberi kampayira na kushigalambula shibenamgongu shangu mala lilongu, kumbiti Mlungu kamlekeziyiti ndiri kuntenda. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Tati gwenu pakatakuliti, wankanyama yawawera na madowadowa hawaweri shibenamgongu shaku, su vipinga vyoseri vya wankanyama viwiyuriti wana yawawera na madowadowa. Na yomberi pakalongiti, wankanyama wana yawawera na misitali hawaweri shibenamgongu shaku, su vipinga vyoseri viyuwiriti wana yawawera na misitali. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Mlungu ndo ntambu yakatoliti wankanyama wa tati gwenu, kampananiti neni.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />Shaka sha wankanyama sha kupata yinda ndotiti, na mukulota aku moniti wankanyama washipalu woseri yawawakweniti wankanyama wa shidala, waweriti na misitali na madowadowa na malembumalembu. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mlungu kayoweriti na neni mukulota, kanshemiti, Yakobu, na neni nimwitikiriti, Napanu! <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Yomberi kang'ambiriti, guloli, wambuzi pongu woseri yawawakwena wambuzi washidala, wawera na misitali na madowadowa na malembumalembu. Shitwatira ashi shiwera ntambu ayi toziya mona ntambu yakakutenderiti Labani. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Neni ndo ulii Mlungu yakakulawiriti kulii Beteli, pahala palii pagutuliti libuwi kwajili ya lihengu lyaku kwa kulimiminira lipaki na guntuliriti shirapu. Vinu guwuki muisi ayi na guwuyi muisi yaku.”<verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Shakapanu Raheli na Leya wamwankuliti Yakobu, “Kwahera shintu shoseri twenga tuweza kupata tati gwetu pakahowa! <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Kayi kankutuwona twenga gambira wahenga, toziya katushuwuza twenga na vinu mpiya zilaa zilii zyazituhemeriti, yomberi kankuzitendera. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Ulunda woseri Mlungu wakautoliti kulawa kwa tati gwetu ndo watwenga pamuhera na wana wetu. Su gutendi ntambu yagugambiritwi na Mlungu.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Su, Yakobu kalitandiriti kugenda mwanja, su kawakweniziya wana na wadala wakuyi panani pa wankanyama ngamiya. <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />Kawatoliti wankanyama wakuyi woseri pamuhera na vintu vyakuwi vyoseri vyakavipatiti aku Padan Aramu, yomberi kanjiti mwanja gwakuyi kuwuya isi ya Kanani kwa Isaka tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Shaka shilii Labani kagenditi kuwamoga mibahira wankanyama wakuyi, Raheli kiwiti vinyagu vya wamlungu wa tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Yakobu kampayira Labani muntu gwa lushi lwa Aramu kwa kuwuka pota kumgambira. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Yomberi katoliti ulunda wakuyi woseri, katugiti na pakalokiti kala lushemba Eufrati, kagenditi Gileadi, lushi lwa vigongo.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Labani na Yakobu Mugileadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Mashaka matatu pa Yakobu kuwuka, wantu wamgambiriti shilii shashilawiriti. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Labani kawatola walongu wakuyi na kumsakula Yakobu kwa mashaka saba, kamwoniti yomberi kulugongu, muisi ya Gileadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Kumbiti pashiru, Mlungu kamlawiriti mundotu Labani muntu gwa lushi lwa Aramu, “Kamgambiriti, guliloli weri! Nagumtenda Yakobu kakalali.”<verse eid="GEN 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Su Labani kasoka kwa Yakobu. Shaka ashi Yakobu kaweriti kagonjera mwanja gwakuyi kulugongu. Labani pamuhera na walongu wakuyi, wagonjeriti mwanja gwawu kulugongu lwa Gileadi.<verse eid="GEN 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Shakapanu Labani kamgambiriti Yakobu, “Gutenda shishi? Iwera hashi gunzyanga na guwatola wahinga wangu gambira watuga isi mungondu? <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Iwera hashi gutugiti kwa kubada na kunzyanga? Kwashishi gung'ambiliti ndiri su nikugambiri kwahere kwa sheleku na nyimbu na malimba na mbalapi? <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Iwera hashi gundekeziyiti ndiri niwanoneri wazukulu wangu na kuwagambira kwahere wahinga wangu? Gutenda shintu shifaa ndiri. <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Nana uwezu wa kukutenda, kumbiti Mlungu gwa tati gwaku kandawiriti lishu pashiru, kang'ambiriti, guliloli weri! Nagumgambira Yakobu shisoweru shoseri sha kumtenda kakalali. <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Vinu guwuka toziya gwana mata ya kuwuya ukaya kwa tati gwaku, kumbiti iwera hashi gwiwa vinyagu vya milungu wangu?”<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Yakobu kamwankula, “Ntiriti toziya nivimaniti megumpoki wahinga waku kwa makakala. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Kumbiti handa pagumwona yoseri kawera na vinyagu vya milungu waku, nakalikala. Kulongolu kwa walongu wetu, gulanguziyi shoseri shashiweriti shaku, gushitoli.” Yakobu kavimaniti ndiri kuwera Raheli kiwiti vinyagu vya milungu wa Labani.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Su Labani kasakula vinyagu avi vya milungu wakuyi muliringu lya Yakobu na lya Leya na lya walii yaya wawili, kumbiti kavipatiti ndiri, kalawa muliringu lya Leya na kwingira muliringu lya Raheli. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Raheli ndo yakavitoliti vinyagu avi na kavififiti pasi pa mkeka gwa kulivagira pa nkanyama ngamiya na kulivaga pampindi pakuwi. Labani kavisakula muliringu lyoseri kumbiti kavipatiti ndiri. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Na Raheli kamgambiriti tati gwakuyi, “Shondi shondi tati, aguleka mtuwa gwangu kakalali, hapeni wezi kwimuka kulongolu kwaku, toziya wera mumashaka gangu.” Su Labani kavisakula vinyagu vya milungu wakuyi, kumbiti kavipatiti ndiri.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Su Yakobu kamkalaliti “Labani pakalonga, hashi, shidoda sha neni shishi? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Hashi, gupata shishi shashiweriti shaku ata pagusakuliti kala muvisanka vyangu vyoseri? Gushituli kulongolu kwa walongu waneni na walongu waku, su womberi waamuwi pakati petu twenga wawili. <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Nilikala na gwenga kwa shaka sha mivinja malongu mawili. Na shaka shoseri ashi kondolu waku, ama wambuzi waku hawenipati kuhalabisiya yinda, ama neni kuliya kondolu washipalu gwa shipinga shaku. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Neni Nikujegiriti ndiri ata mala yimu nkanyama gwaku yakalaguwitwi na nkanyama gwa kuntundu, mbuziliriti asara ayi ulaa namweni. Gwenga gufiriti ndipi pota kulishera handa wamwiwiti paluwala ama pamihi! <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Ayi iweriti ntambu ya neni, paluwala hepeleriti mshenji gukalipa na pashiru hepeleriti mbepu ata nsinditi kugonja mpota. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Mivinja malongu mawili yoseri ayi nilikaliti mnumba mwaku. Nikutenderiti kwa mivinja lilongu na msheshi kwajili ya wahinga waku wawili, na mivinja sita niwaloleriti wankanyama waku. Kumbiti gwenga gugalambula shibenamgongu shangu mala lilongu. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Gambira Mlungu gwa mbuyi gwangu Abrahamu, Mlungu yakamtenditi tati gwangu Isaka kalendemeri, mekaweri ndiri uwega wa neni, nakamu megundeki ng'endi mawoku hera kumbiti Mlungu kakuwona kutabika kwaneni na lihengu lyandenditi kwa mawoku gangu, kakukalipiriti lishu pashiru.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lipatanu lya Yakobu na Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Shakapanu Labani kamwankula Yakobu, “Wahinga awa wahinga waneni, wana awa wana waneni, wankanyama awa wankanyama waneni, vyoseri vyaguviwona panu, vyaneni. Kumbiti neni hawezi kutenda shishi leru kwa wahinga waneni ama kwa wana wawu yawawiyuriti? <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Vinu gwizi tutendi lipatanu gwenga na neni; su liweri ukapitawu pakati pa gwenga na neni.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Su Yakobu katola libuwi kaligolosiya gambira lusiki lwa kuliholera. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Kayi Yakobu kawagambira walongu wakuyi, “Mjojoniri mabuwi, nawomberi wajojoniriti mabuwi na kutula shilundu, shakapanu waliyiti shiboga pakwegera na shilundu ashi sha mabuwi.” <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Labani kashishema shimatiru ashi Yegari Sahadusa, kumbiti Yakobu kashishema Galeedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Labani kalonga, “Shilundu ashi shiwera upitawu pakati pa gwenga na neni leru. Ndo mana shilundu ashi shishemuwa Gileadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Na lusiki lulii lushemuwa Misipa, toziya yomberi kalongiti, Mtuwa Mlungu katuloleri patuwera kutali pota kuliwona. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Paguwatabisiya wahinga waneni ama paguyuga wadala wamonga, su guvimani kuwera kwahera muntu gwingi pakati petu, Mlungu ndo kapitawu pakati petu.<verse eid="GEN 31:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Shakapanu Labani kamgambiriti Yakobu, guloli shilundu ashi pamuhera na lusiki lwanulituriti pakati petu. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Shimatiru ashi ndo kapitawu na lusiki alu ndo kapitawu kuwera neni hapeni noki shimatiru ashi kwiza kwa gwenga kukutenda na gwenga haguloki ndiri shimatiru ashi na lusiki alu kwiza kwaneni kuntenda. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Mlungu gwa Abrahamu na Mlungu gwa Nahori, hakaamuwi pakati pa twenga. Su Yakobu kalilapiriti kwa Mlungu yakamtenditi Isaka tati gwakuyi, katetemi.” <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Na Yakobu kalaviyiti tambiku kulugongu na kawashemiti walongu wakuyi kuliya shiboga na womberi pawaliyiti kala shiboga, wagonjiti kulaa kulugongu pashiru poseri. <verse eid="GEN 31:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Mandawira putiputi Labani kimukiti, kawanonera wazukulu pamuhera na wahinga wakuyi, kawapetiriti mashi. Shakapanu kanjiti mwanja, kawuyiti ukaya.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu kankulitanda kuliwona na Esawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Shakapanu Yakobu kendereyiti na mwanja gwakuyi, wantumintumi wa kumpindi wa Mlungu waliwoniti na yomberi, <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />na Yakobu pakawawoniti kalonga, “Panu ndo pahala pa shipinga sha mashonta wa Mlungu!” Su kapashema pahala palii Mahanaimu.<verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Yakobu kawalagaliriti wajumbi wamlongoleri kugenda kwa Esawu mlongu gwakuyi aku Seili, isi lwa Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Kawalagaliriti pakalonga, “Hamumgambiri mtuwa gwangu Esawu ntambu ayi kuwera ntumintumi gwaku Yakobu kalonga hangu, nilikaliti pamuhera na Labani na wera aku mpaka vinu. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Nana wang'ombi na punda na vipinga vya wakondolu na wantumintumi wapalu na wadala. Nikujegera ujumbi awu mtuwa gwangu, su neni mpati upendeleu kulongolu kwaku.” <verse eid="GEN 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Wajumbi walii pawawuyiti na kumgambira Yakobu, “Tusoka kwa mlongu gwaku Esawu, na yomberi kamunjira kwiza kukwanka, pakawera na wantu miya msheshi.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Shakapanu Yakobu kaweriti na lyoga nentu pamuhera na shashatika, su kawabaguliti muvipinga wantu yawaweriti pamuhera na yomberi na wakondolu na wankanyama wamonga na ngamiya. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Yomberi kaliholiti, “Handa Esawu pakiza na kushyagamiziya shipinga shimu, su shipinga shimonga shashisigaliti hashilishapiri.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Su Yakobu kaluwa, “Gwee Mlungu gwa mbuyi gwangu Abrahamu, Mlungu gwa tati gwangu Isaka! Gwee Mlungu yagung'ambiliti mbuyi muisi yangu kwa walongu wangu, gunagiliti kuntendera maheri. <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />Neni nfiruwa ndiri kupata uheri wako yaguntendiriti neni ntumintumi gwaku, panokiti lushemba lwa Yoridani, weriti ndiri na shintu ira luhonga, kumbiti vinu nanavi vipinga avi viwili. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Nikuluwa, gunopoli kulawa mumaya ga mlongu gwangu Esawu, toziya nana lyoga kuwera hakatukomangi na kutulaga twoseri, wamawu pamuhera na wana. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Kumbiti gwenga gunagiliti, hanikutenderi maheri na hanishiyongeri shiyiwuku shaku shiweri shivuwa gambira muhanga gwa kumpwani mwa bahari, hapeni shiwezi kuwalangwa kwa uvuwa wakuyi.”<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Su Yakobu kagonjiti pahala palii pashiru panu, shakapanu katoliti muwankanyama yakaweriti nawu waweri lifupu kwa Esawu mlongu gwakuyi, <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />wambuzi washidala miya mbili na wambuzi washipalu malongu mawili, wakondolu washidala miya mbili na washipalu malongu mawili, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />nkanyama ngamiya malongu matatu yawakonkuziya pamuhera na wana wawu, wang'ombi washidala malongu msheshi na pongu lilongu na punda washidala malongu mawili na washipalu lilongu. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Kawapananiti wantumintumi wakuyi, kila yumu shipinga shakuwi, kawagambira, “Munongoleri pamleka lupenyu pakati pa shipinga na shipinga mumwanja gwenu.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Kamlagalira uli yakalongoleriti pakalonga, “Mlongu gwangu Esawu pakiza kuliwona na gwenga na pakakukosiya, gwenga gwa ntumintumi gwa gaa? Gwankugenda koshi? Na wankanyama awa wa gaa? <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />Gwenga hagumwankuli, awu ndo ulunda wa ntumintumi gwaku Yakobu, na ali ndo lifupu lyaku gwenga mtuwa gwangu Esawu, na Yakobu mweni kankumberi kankwiza. <verse eid="GEN 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Kalagaliriti ntambu iraa ayi kwa ntumintumi gwa shipinga sha pili na sha tatu na wamonga woseri, pakalonga, hamumgambiri Esawu visoweru viraa avi pamuliwona nayu, <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />na hamumgambiri, ntumintumi gwaku Yakobu kakumberi kankwiza. Yakobu katenditi hangu pakalihola, pamonga hanimtendi kaleki kukalala kwa mafupu aga ganigalongoziya, shakapanu hawezi kuliwona nayu, pamonga hakananki.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Su kalongoziya mafupu gakuyi, kumbiti mweni kagonjiti muliringu pashiru panu.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu vinu kankushemuwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Pashiru panu Yakobu kimukiti, kawatola wadala wakuyi wawili, wantumintumi wadala wawili na wana wakuyi lilongu na limu, waloka lushemba lwa Yaboki. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Pakawalokiziyiti kala kumwambu kulushemba walii yakaweriti nawa pamuhera na ulunda wakuyi woseri, <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Yakobu kasigaliti gweka yakuwi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:24">Shakapanu muntu yumu kiziti, kalikola nayu pawaligusiyana mpaka mandawira putiputi. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Muntu ayu pakawoniti kuwera hapeni kamkanki Yakobu, su kamtilindula Yakobu muliwondu na yomberi katirinduka pakaweriti pakaligusiyana nayu.<verse eid="GEN 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Shakapanu muntu ilii kamgambiriti Yakobu, gundeki ng'endi zangu, toziya kwankushiya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">“Kumbiti Yakobu kamgambiriti, hapeni nikuleki nakamu, mpaka guntekeleri!<verse eid="GEN 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Muntu ulii kamkosiya, litawu lyaku gwa gaa?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">Yomberi kamwankula, Yakobu. <verse eid="GEN 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Muntu ulii kamgambira, hapeni gushemwi kayi Yakobu, kumbiti hagushemwi Israeli, toziya gusingana na Mlungu pamuhera na wantu, gukanka.<verse eid="GEN 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Yakobu kamgambira, shondi shondi, nikuluwa gung'ambili litawu lyaku. Kumbiti yomberi kamgambiriti, kwantambu gaa gunkosiya litawu lyangu?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Shakapanu kamtekelera Yakobu palii.<verse eid="GEN 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Yakobu kapashema pahala palii Penueli, pakalonga, nimwona Mlungu sheni kwa sheni, na neni howa ndiri.” <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Mshenji guweriti gulawa kala Yakobu pakawukiti Panueli, yomberi kaweriti kankujonda toziya ya lihondu lyakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Su mpaka leru Waisraeli waliya ndiri msuli gwagulikolerana na lihondu, toziya muntu ulii kamtilinduliti Yakobu msuli gwagulikolerana na lihondu lyakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu na Esawu wakulikola mawoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Su Yakobu kanyasuliti masu gakuyi, kamwona Esawu pakiza pamuhera na wantu miya msheshi. Palii kawatula gweka wana wakuyi pakati pa Leya na Raheli na walii wayaya wadala wawili. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Kawatula wayaya pamuhera na wana wawu kulongolu, shakapanu Leya na wana wakuyi, na kumbeli nakamu wafata Raheli na Yusufu mwana gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Shakapanu mweni kawalongoleriti, kagenditi kasuntama makukama mala saba, mpaka pakasokiti pakwegera na mlongu gwakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Kumbiti Esawu katugiti kugenda kumwanka Yakobu, kamkisikira na woseri wawili walira. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Esawu pakanyasuliti masu gakuyi na kuwawona ashina mawu na wana walii, kakosiya, “Awa ashina gaa waguwera nawu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Yakobu kamwankula, “Awa ndo wana, Mlungu kwa manemu gakuyi, kampananiti neni ntumintumi gwaku.”<verse eid="GEN 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Shakapanu wayaya walii wasegeleriti pamuhera na wana wawu, wasuntamiti kwa ligoya. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Viraa na Leya kiza pamuhera na wana wakuyi, kasuntamiti kwa ligoya, upeleru Raheli na Yusufu wiziti, wasuntamiti kwa ligoya.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Esawu kakosiyiti, “Mana yakuwi shishi ya shipinga ashi shanuliwoniti nashi munjira?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Yakobu kamwankula, “Ali ndo lifupu lyaku, su mpati upendeleu kulongolu kwaku, mtuwa gwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Kumbiti Esawu kalonga, “Nana ulunda uvuwa mlongu gwangu, ulunda wa gwenga uweri waku gamweni” <verse eid="GEN 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Yakobu kamgambira, “Ndala! Nikuluwa, handa nakaka mpata upendelewu kulongolu kwaku, gujimiri mafupu gangu. Nakaka kushiwona sheni shaku, ndo gambira kushiwona sheni sha Mlungu, kwa ntambu yagunankiti kwa uheri mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Su nduwa gujimiri lifupu lyanikujegeriti, toziya ata neni viraa Mlungu kamotiziya, nana ulunda uvuwa.” Yakobu ntambu yakamzyangazyangiti Esawu, na yomberi kawankiti.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Esawu kalonga “Yina! Twendeleyi na mwanja gwetu, neni hanikulongoleri.”<verse eid="GEN 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Kumbiti Yakobu kamgambira, “Mtuwa gwangu, gwenga guvimana kuwera wana awa wanonu, viraa wankanyama awa wankukonkuziya, su neni nfiruwa kuyilolera weri. Wankanyama awa pawajeguwa mbiru kwa lishaka limu, woseri hawafuwi. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Su nikuluwa gulongoleri, neni hanizi mpolimpoli ntambu yawatyanga wankanyama na wana, mpaka pansoka aku Seiri.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Esawu kalonga, “Mbaka nikulekeri wantu wamu waneni.” Kumbiti Yakobu kalonga, “Kwana nfiru gaa ya kutenda hangu? Guleki neni mpati upendelewu kulongolu kwaku, mtuwa gwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Su lishaka ali Esawu kanjiti mwanja gwa kuwuya Seiri. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Kumbiti Yakobu kagenditi Sukoti, na aku kalinyawira numba na visasa kwajili ya wankanyama wakuyi. Toziya ayi pahala panu pashemuwa Sukoti.<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Kulawa padan Aramu, Yakobu kasokiti nyanyi mulushi lwa Shekemu, muisi ya Kanani, kanyawa maringu pakwegera na isi ayi. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Kahemeriti shiwanja kulawa kwa wana wa Hamori, tati gwa Shekemu, kwa beyi ya magwala miya ga mpiya, su kanyawiti liringu lyakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Su kanyawa shitalawanda sha mabuwi sha kutambikira pahala palii na kupashema Mlungu ndo Mlungu gwa Israeli.<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s">Simoni na Lawi wankuwuzilira toziya ya dada gwawu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Lishaka limu, Dina muhinga gwa Yakobu na Leya, wagenditi kuwatyangira wadala wa isi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Shekemu mwana gwa Hamoli, Muhivi yakaweriti mkulu gwa isi ayi, pakamwoniti Dina, yomberi kamkamula, kagonja nayu kwa likakala. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Kumbiti Shekemu kafiliziwa nentu na muhinga ayu, kamfira mpaka kanja kumzyangazyanga. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Su Shekemu kayoweriti na Hamoli tati gwakuyi, kamgambira, “Shondi, gunduwili muhinga ayu nimyugi.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Yakobu kavimana kuwera Dina muhinga gwakuyi katendiritwi uhumba na Shekemu, kumbiti wana wakuyi waweriti wankuwalolera wankanyama kuntundu, su kanyamaliti mpaka pawawuyiti. <verse eid="GEN 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Hamoli tati gwa Shekemu, kagenditi kwa Yakobu su kayoweri nayu. <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Wana wa Yakobu wawuyiti kulawa kuntundu, pawapikaniriti aga, womberi wakalariti nentu toziya Shekemu kawatenderiti wantu wa Israeli ukondola awu wa kugonja na muhinga gwa Yakobu, mana shitwatira ashi shiweriti mziru.<verse eid="GEN 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Kumbiti Hamoli kawagambira, “Mwana gwangu Shekemu kamfira nentu muhinga gwenu. Su shondi mumjimiri kamuyugi. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Mleki tuliyugi, mwenga hamuyugi wahinga wetu na twenga hatuwayugi wahinga wenu. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Su hamulikali pamuhera na twenga, hamuweri walekeru muisi ayi, hamulikali amu mshuwuzi vintu na kupata ulunda.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Ntambu iraa ayi, Shekemu kawagambiriti tati na walongu wakuyi Dina, “Shondi shondi neni haniwapanani shoseri shamfira. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Mung'ambiri shyasi sha mahetu na lifupu, neni handaviyi, su mumpanani neni kaweri mdala gwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Su wana wa Yakobu wamwankuliti Shekemu na tati gwa Hamoli kwa upayira, toziya Shekemu kamtenditi kala uhumba Dina dada gwawu. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Wawagambiriti, “Hapeni tutendi shitwatira sha ntambu ayi kumlaviya dada gwetu kwa muntu yakingiziwituwi ndiri jandu, kutenda hangu hayiweri soni kwa twenga. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Hatujimirani na mwenga kwa ntambu ayi, hamuweri gambira twenga kwa kumwingiziya jandu kila mpalu pakati pa mwenga. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Shakapanu hatuwaleki wahinga wetu wayuguwi na mwenga na twenga hatuwayugi wahinga wenu, hatulikali pamuhera na mwenga na kuwera wantu umu na mwenga. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Kumbiti pamjimirana ndiri na twengapa na kwingira ndiri jandu, su twenga hatumtoli muhinga gwetu na kugenda zetu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Shisoweri shawu shiwafiriziyi Hamoli na Shekemu mwana gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Muntemba ayu kalema ndiri kutenda ntambu yawafiriti womberi, toziya kamfiriti nentu muhinga gwa Yakobu. Pamuhera na hangu, Shekemu ndo yakagohelitwi kuliku woseri mukaya yakuwi.<verse eid="GEN 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Su Hamoli na Shekemu mwana gwakuyi, wagenditi kuligomi likulu lya lushi na watakuliti na wapalu wa lushi lwawu, pawalongiti, <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />“Wantu awa waganja wetu, tuleki walikali na twenga na kushuwuza toziya twana isi nkulu yakulikala twenga na womberi. Shakapanu hatuwayugi wahinga wawu na womberi hawayugi wahinga wa twenga. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Kumbiti womberi hawajimili kulikala na twenga na hatuweri wantu umu, su kila muntu pakati pa twenga kingiziwi jandu ntambu yawingizitwi jandu womberi. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Hashi, mwona ndiri kuwera wankanyama wawu na ulunda wawu woseri hauweri ulunda wetu? Su tujimilirani na womberi, hawalikali na twenga.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Wapalu na woseri yawajojonikiti paligomi lya lushi alu wajimirana na Hamoli pamuhera na Shekemu mwana gwakuyi. Shakapanu wapalu woseri wingiziwitwi jandu.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Mulisha lya tatu shakapanu, walii yawayingiziwitwi jandu pawaweriti wankali na utama wa vironda, wana wawili wa Yakobu, Simiyoni pamuhera na Lawi, kaka zakuwi Dina, watoliti magumba gawu, wingira vumu mlushi na kuwalaga wapalu woseri. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Wawalagiti kwa magumba Hamoli na Shekemu mwana gwakuyi, na wamlaviyiti Dina mnumba ya Shekemu, na wagenditi zawu. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Wana wa Yakobu watyangiti pamawuti galii na kwingira mlushi na watoliti vintu vyaviweramu toziya dada gwawu katendiritwi uhumba. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Wawatoliti wakondolu na wambuzi na wang'ombi na punda na shoseri shashiweriti mulushi ama mumalambu. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Watoliti ulunda woseri, wana na wadala woseri na shoseri shashiweriti mnumba.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Su Yakobu kawagambiriti Simiyoni na Lawi, “Mwenga munjegera ntabiku kuntenda nkalalirwi na wenikaya wa isi ayi ya Wakanaani na Waperizi. Neni nahera wantu wavuwa, na handa pawajojonika kunkomanga, hawandagi neni pamuhera na walongu wangu.” <verse eid="GEN 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Kumbiti womberi walongiti, “Hashi, yomberi kamtenda dada gwetu gambira mundiyandiya?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankumtekelera Yakobu aku Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Lishaka limu Mlungu kamgambiriti Yakobu, “Gwanji mwanja gugendi gulikali Beteli na gumnyawiri Mlungu shitalawanda sha mabuwi sha kutambikira, Mlungu yakakulawiriti shaka pagutugiti kumtira kaka gwaku Esawu.”<verse eid="GEN 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Su Yakobu kawagambiriti wantu wa kaya yakuwi pamuhera na woseri yawaweriti pamuhera na yomberi, “Mwasili kutali vinyagu vya milungu ya shihenga vyamuweriti navi, myogi mashi na kuzigulula nguwu zenu. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Shakapanu mwizi, tugendi Beteli su hanimnyawiri shitalawanda sha kutambikira Mlungu yakantangiti lishaka lya kutabika kwangu na kaweriti na neni poseri kwang'enditi.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Su womberi wampananiti Yakobu vinyagu vyoseri vya milungu ya shihenga vyawaweriti navi pamuhera na heleni zyawazivariti mumakutu, nayomberi kavikulira pasi pa mtera gwa mwaloni yaguweriti pakwegera na Shekemu.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Yakobu pamuhera na wana wakuyi pawaweriti wankugenda mwanja, Mlungu kawatenditi wenikaya wa lushi zoseri za pakwegera waweri na lyoga, su womberi wasinditi kuwafata wana wa Yakobu. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Su Yakobu pamuhera na wantu woseri yakaweriti nawa, kasokiti Luzu yaishemwa vinu Beteli muisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Kanyawiti palii shitalawanda sha mabuwi sha kutambikira na kupashema Eli Beteli toziya pahala palii Mlungu pakalilanguziyiti mweni kwa yomberi shaka pakaweriti kankutuga kumtira kaka gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Debora, yaya gwa Rebeka, kahowiti na kafintirwa pasi pa mtera gwa mwaloni, su Yakobu kalushema lushi alu Aloni Bakuti.<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Yakobu pakawuyiti kulawa Padan Aramu, Mlungu kamlawiriti kayi na kamtekeleriti. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Mlungu kamgambiriti, “Litawu lyaku Yakobu, kumbiti hapeni gushemwi kayi Yakobu, kumbiti litawu lyaku hagushemwi Israeli.” Su Yakobu kashemitwi Israeli. <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Na Mlungu kamgambiriti yomberi, “Neni ndo Mlungu yakawera na makakala, guweri na shiyiwuku shivuwa na shyongereki. Kwaku hakulawiri wantu wa isi zivuwa na wafalumi hawalawiri mushiyiwuku shaku. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Isi yaniwapananiti Abrahamu na Isaka hanikupanani gwenga pamuhera na shiyiwuku shaku.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Shakapanu Mlungu kawukiti kulawa pahala palii kwakayoweriti na yomberi. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Su Yakobu kagolosiyiti lusiki lya libuwi pahala palii pakayoweriti na Mlungu, kalituliti liweri lya Mlungu kwa kwitira tambiku ya divayi na lipaki. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Su Yakobu kapashema Beteli pahala palii pakayowiliti na Mlungu.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Raheli na Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Yakobu na walongu wakuyi woseri wendereyiti na mwanja gwawu kulawa Beteli. Pawaweriti utali tunga pamberi pa kusoka Efrata, Raheli kaweriti na utama nentu wa kwiyura. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Na yomberi pakaweriti muutama wa kwiyura, mkunga kamgambiriti, “Nagutira, gupata mwana yumonga mpalu.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Raheli pakaweriti pakwegera na kuhowa, kampananiti mwana litawu Benoni kumbiti tati gwakuyi kampananiti mwana ayu litawu Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Su Raheli kahowiti na kufindirwa pambwega munjira yayigenda Efrata vinu ishemuwa Betilehemu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Yakobu kagolosiya lusiki lwa libuwi kuwera liholu pambindi palisembi lya Raheli lyeni liwera mpaka leru.<verse eid="GEN 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Israeli kendereyiti na mwanja gwakuyi, kagenditi kugonjera mwanja pakapititi kala shinara sha Ederi.<verse eid="GEN 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Shaka Israeli pakaweriti kankulikala muisi ayi, Rubeni mwana gwakuyi kagonjiti na Biliha, mdala gwa kumbwega gwa tati gwakuyi, na tati gwakuyi kapikaniriti shisoweru ashi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Yakobu kaweriti na wana lilongu na mbili.<verse eid="GEN 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Wana wa Leya waweriti Rubeni shipanta njira gwa Yakobu, viraa kaweriti Simiyoni na Yuda na Isakari na Zabuloni. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Wana wa Raheli waweriti Yusufu na Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Wana yawawiyukiti kwa Biliha, yaya mdala gwa Raheli, waweriti Dina na Nafutali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Wana wa Zilipa, yaya mdala gwa Leya, waweriti Gadi na Asheri. Awa ndo wana wa Yakobu, yawawiyukiti pakaweriti Padan Aramu kulii.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Yakobu kawuyiti Mamire kwa Isaka tati gwakuyi aku Kiriatiariba, vinu ishemuwa Hebroni, pahala Abrahamu na Isaka walikaliti gambira wahenga. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Isaka kalikaliti mivinja miya na malongu manani. <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />Kahowiti pakawera mzewi gwa mivinja ivuwa, Esawu na Yakobu wana wakuyi wamsiriti.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s">Wiwuka wa Esawu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:34-37">1 Mirandu 1:34-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Awa ndo wana wa Esawu, litawu lyakuyi lyamonga Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Esawu kayugiti wadala wantu wa Kanaani: Ada muhinga gwa Eloni Muhiti, Oholibama muhinga gwa Ana, ulii yakaweriti mwana gwa Zibeoni muntu gwa Hiti, <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />na Basemati muhinga gwa Ishimaeli dada gwakuyi Nebayoti. <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Ada kamwiwuliti Esawu mwana yakashemitwi Elifazi na Basemati kamwiwuliti mwana yakashemitwi Reueli. <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />Oholibama kamwiwuliti mwana Yeushi na Yalamu na Kora. Awa ndo wana wa Esawu, walii wadala wakuyi wamwiwuliriti wana pawaweriti muisi ya Kanaani.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Shakapanu Esawu kawatoliti wadala wakuyi, wana wakuyi wapalu na wadala pamuhera na wantu woseri wa ukaya kwakuyi na wang'ombi wakuyi na wankanyama wakuyi wamonga woseri pamuhera na ulunda wakuyi woseri yakaupatiti muisi ya Kanaani, su kagenditi kulikala pahala pamonga kutali na Yakobu mlongu gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Ketenditi hangu toziya ya ulunda wawu uweriti uvuwa ata hapeni wawezi kulikala pamuhera na Yakobu, isi yawalikaliti gambira wahenga iweziti ndiri kutosha toziya wankanyama wawu waweriti wavuwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Su Esawu litawu lyakuyi lyamonga Edomu kagenditi kulikala muvigongu vya isi ya Seiri.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Aga ndo matawu ga shiyiwuku sha Esawu, tati gwa Waedomu mlushi lwa vigongu vya isi ya Seiri. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Wana wa Esawu waweriti Elifazi yakiwukiti kwa Ada mdala gwakuyi, na Reueli yakiwukiti kwa Basemati mdala gwakuyi yumonga. <verse eid="GEN 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Wana wa Elifazi waweriti Temani na Omali na Sefu na Gatamu na Kenazi. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Elifazi kaweriti na mdala gwakuyi mpusu litawu lyakuyi Timuna, ayu kamwiwuliti mwana litawu lyakuyi Amaleki. <verse eid="GEN 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Basemati mdala gwa Esawu, kamwiwuliti Reueli. Wana wa Reueli waweriti Nahati na Zera na Shama na Miza. <verse eid="GEN 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Ohalibama muhinga gwa Ana mwana gwa Sibeoni mdala gwa Esawu, yomberi kamwiwuliti Esawu mpalu gwakuyi wana watatu: Yeushi na Yalamu na Kora.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Awa ndo wakulu wa makabila yagalawiliti mushiyiwuku sha Esawu. Elifazi yakaweriti shipanta njira gwa Esawu, yomberi kamwiwuliriti Temani na Omali na Sefu na Kenazi.<verse eid="GEN 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />Kora na Gatamu na Amaleki; awa waweriti wakulu mushiyiwuku sha Elifazi muisi ya Edomu, womberi waweriti wazukulu wa Ada.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Reueli mwana gwa Esawu, kawiwuliti Nahati na Zera na Shama na Miza, kila yumu gwawu kaweriti mkulu gwa likabila lyakuyi. Woseri awa waweriti wana wa Reueli muisi ya Edomu, yawalawiraniti na Basemati mdala gwa Esawu.<verse eid="GEN 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Wana wa Oholibama mdala gwa Esawu, waweriti Yeushi na Yalamu na Kora, kila yumu kaweriti mkulu gwa likabila lyakuyi. Woseri awa waweriti wana wa Oholibama muhinga gwa Ana mdala gwa Esawu. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Ashi ndo shileri sha Esawu litawu lyamonga Edomu, kila yumu gwawu kaweriti mkulu gwa likabila lyakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Awa ndo yawaweriti wana wa Seiri Muholi, yawalikaliti muisi ya Edomu; Lotani na Shobali na Sibeoni na Ana. <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />Dishoni na Eseri na Dishani, kila yumu gwawu kaweriti mkulu gwa likabila lyakuyi pakati pa Waholi wana wa Seiri, muisi ya Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Wana wa Lotani waweriti Hori na Homamu na dada gwakuyi Lotani kashemitwi Timina. <verse eid="GEN 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Wana wa Shobali waweriti Alivani na Manahati na Ebali na Shefu na Onamu. <verse eid="GEN 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Wana wa Sibeoni waweriti Aya na Ana. Ana ndo yakawoniti mbwiru zyazibwituka mashi ga motu kushiwala pakaweriti kankuwalolera wankanyama punda wa Sibeoni tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Wana wa Ana waweriti Dishoni na Oholibama muhinga gwa Ana.<verse eid="GEN 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Wana wa Dishoni waweriti Hamidani na Eshibali na Itirani na Kerani.<verse eid="GEN 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Wana wa Eseri waweriti Bilihani Zaawani na Akani. <verse eid="GEN 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Wana wa Dishani waweriti Usi na Arani<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Awa ndo wakulu wa Waholi na Lotani na Shobali na Sibeoni na Ana.<verse eid="GEN 36:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />Dishoni na Eseri na Dishani, kila yumu gwawu kaweriti mkulu gwa likabila lyakuyi muisi ya Seiri.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wafalumi wa isi ya Edomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Wafalumi yawakolitimlima isi ya Edomu, pamberi pa mfalumi yoseri hakeniwakolimlima Waisraeli waweriti, <verse eid="GEN 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Bela mwana gwa Beori, kakolitimlima isi ya Edomu pakaweriti na makawu gakuyi makulu mlushi lwa Dinihaba. <verse eid="GEN 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Bela pakahowiti, Yobabu mwana gwa Zera kulawa Bosira kakolitimlima pa yomberi. <verse eid="GEN 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Yobabu pakahowiti, Hushamu gwa isi ya Watemani kakolitimlima pa yomberi. <verse eid="GEN 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Hushamu pakahowiti, Hadadi mwana gwa Bedadi kakolitimlima, lushi lwakuyi luweriti Aviti. Ayu ndo yakawakomiti na kuwakanka Wamidiani mu isi ya Moabu <verse eid="GEN 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Hadadi pakahowiti, Samla kulawa Masireka kakolitimlima pa yomberi. <verse eid="GEN 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Samla pakahowiti, Shauli kulawa lushi lwa Rehoboti, lwaluweriti pakwegera na lushemba Eufrati, kakolitimlima pa yomberi. <verse eid="GEN 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Shauli pakahowiti, Baali Hanani, mwana gwa Akiboli, kakolitimlima pa yomberi. <verse eid="GEN 36:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Baali Hanani mwana gwa Akiboli pakahowiti, Hadari kakolitimlima pa yomberi na litawu lya lushi lwakuyi luweriti Pawu. Mdala gwa Akiboli kaweriti Mehetabeli muhinga gwa Matiredi na mzukulu gwa Mezahabu.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Wakulu wa makabila yagalawiliti na shiyiwuku sha Esawu, gaweriti shiyasi sha makabila gawu na kaya zawu waweriti, Timuna na Aliva na Yeteti, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />Oholibama na Ela na Pinoni, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />Kenazi na Temani na Mibisari <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />na Magidieli na Iramu. Awa waweriti wakulu wa makabila yagalawirana na Edomu, litawu lyamonga Esawu tati gwa Edomu, wakandituwi kulawirana kulikala kwawu pahala muisi zyawazihaliti.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu na walongu wakuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Yakobu kendereyiti kulikala muisi ya Kanaani, kwakalikaliti tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Avi ndo visoweru vya kaya ya Yakobu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Yusufu pakaweriti muntemba gwa mivinja lilongu na saba, kaweriti kankulolera wakondolu na wambuzi, mweni pamuhera na walongu wakuyi, wana wa Biliha na Zilipa, wadala wa tati gwakuyi. Yusufu kaweriti kankumgambira tati gwakuyi kuusu vitendu vidoda vya walongu wakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Su Israeli kamfiriti nentu Yusufu kuliku wana wakuyi wamonga woseri toziya yomberi kiwukiti muugogolu wakuyi. Kamsoniriti Yusufu lihabiti litali lyana mapambu gaherepa. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Kumbiti walongu wakuyi pawawoni kuwera tati gwawu kamfiriti nentu Yusufu kuliku womberi, wamkalaliriti mpaka walekiti kuyowera nayu kwa ponga.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulota kwa Yusufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Pashiru pamu, Yusufu kalotiti na pakawagambiriti walongu wakuyi, womberi wongeriti kumkalalira. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Yomberi kawagambiriti, “Mpikaniri ntambu yandotiti. <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Twenga twawoseri tuweriti kulirambu twankuyopa ng'anda na vinu ng'anda yaneni igolokiti na ng'anda za mwenga zijojonikiti kuizyengeta na kuing'ong'onalira ng'anda yaneni.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Walongu wakuyi wamkosiyiti, “Hashi, gufira kutugambira kuwera hagutukolimlima? Ama haguweri na utuwa kwa twenga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:8">Su wongeriti kumkalalira toziya ya kulota na visoweru vyakuwi.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Shakapanu yomberi kalotiti kayi, kawagambira walongu wakuyi pakalonga, “Mpikaniri ndotiti kayi, mona mshenji na lyezi na ntondu lilongu na yimu vyankusutamalira neni.”<verse eid="GEN 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Kumbiti pawamgambiriti tati gwakuyi na walongu wakuyi kulota aku, tati gwakuyi kamkalapiriti pakalonga “Kulota gaa kwagulotiti? Hashi, gufiruwa neni na mawu gwaku na walongu twizi kusuntama kwa ligoya pasi pa magulu gaku?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Walongu wakuyi wamwoniliti weya, kumbiti tati gwakuyi kawera kankushihola shitwatira ashi.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu wankumshuwuza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Lishaka limu walongu wakuyi Yusufu wagenditi kulolera wankanyama wa tati gwakuyi pakwegera na Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Israeli kamgambiriti Yusufu, “Guvimana walongu waku wankulolera wankanyama Shekemu kulii, su hanikutumi kwa womberi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Yusufu kamwankula, “Yina nakala.”<verse eid="GEN 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Tati gwakuyi kamgambira, “Gugendi gwakawalori walongu waku na wankanyama handa wakomu, shakapanu gwizi gung'ambili.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Su kamtuma Yusufu kulawa lularanda lwa Hebroni. Yusufu pakaweriti pakwegera na Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />Muntu yumu kamwona pakayerayera kushiwala, su kamkosiyiti, “Hashi, gwankusakula shishi?”<verse eid="GEN 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Yusufu kamwankula, “Nankuwasakula walongu wangu. Shondi gung'ambili pahala pawalolera wankanyama.” <verse eid="GEN 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Muntu ulii kamgambira, “Womberi wawuka kala, toziya niwapikaniriti pawalonga, tugendi zetu Dotani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:17">Su Yusufu kawafatiti walongu wakuyi, kawawona aku Dotani. <verse eid="GEN 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Walongu wakuyi pawamwoniti kakutali pamberi pakusoka pakwegera, womberi watenditi mpangu gwa kumlaga. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Womberi waligambiziyana, “Mloli! Mlota ndotu ulii kankwiza. <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Su tumlagi na kumwasila mulirindi limuwamu shakapanu hatutakuli kuwera kalaguwa na nkanyama gwa kuntundu. Shakapanu hatuwoni ndotu zakuwi haziweri hashi.”<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Kumbiti Rubeni pakapikaniriti visoweru avi, kafiliti kumlopoziya mumawoku mwawu su kawagambira walongu wakuyi, “Shondi natumlaga.” <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Rubeni kawagambiriti, “Natumlaga, mumwasiri mulirindi ali kuntundu, kumbiti namumtenda.” Katakuliti hangu su kawezi kumlopuziya mumawoku gawu na shakapanu kamwuziyi kwa tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Yusufu pakasokiti kwa walongu wakuyi, womberi wamvuliti kwa likakala lihabiti lyakuyi, lihabiti lilii liherepa lyakalivaliti. <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />Shakapanu wamtola na kumwasa mulirindi kumbiti lirindi ali liweriti ndiri na mashi.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Pawaweriti wankuliya shiboga, womberi wawawoniti Waishimieli wankwiza kulawa Gileadi kugenda Misri. Ngamiya wawu wapapisiwitwi ubani na zeli na manimani. <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Shakapanu Yuda kawagambiriti walongu wakuyi, “Hatupati mota gaa patumlaga mlongu gwetu na kufifa mwazi gwakuyi? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Mbaka tumshuwuzi yomberi kwa Waishimieli awa, kumbiti natumlaga, toziya yomberi mlongu gwetu na kamwazi gumu na twenga.” Na walongu wakuyi wamjimiriti. <verse eid="GEN 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Washuwuza wa Midiyani pawasokiti palii, womberi wamlaviyiti Yusufu mulirindi, wamshuwuza Yusufu kwa walera wa Ishimaeli kwa beyi ya vipandi malongu mawili vya mpiya, na womberi wamtola Yusufu wagenda nayu Misri.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Su Rubeni pakawuyiti kulirindi lilii, kamwoniti ndiri kayi Yusufu, kazipapulanga nguwu zakuwi kwa kuhinginika. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Kawagenderiti walongu wakuyi, kawagambira, “Muntemba kwahera palii! Neni hantendi hashi?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Shakapanu womberi wamlikituliti mbuzi na watola lihabiti lya Yusufu na kuliloviya mumwazi gwa mbuzi ayu. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Su wamjegeriti tati gwawu lihabiti lilii na wamgambiriti, “Tulisola lihabiti ali, su guliloli handa lya mwana gwaku, ama ndala.”<verse eid="GEN 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Tati gwawu kalimana lihabiti lilii, kalonga, “Ali ndo lihabiti lya mwana gwangu, nkanyama mkaripa gwa kuntundu kamlaga na kumliya yomberi, nakaka Yusufu wamupapula vipandi vipandi.”<verse eid="GEN 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Shakapanu Yakobu kapapuliti nguwu zakuwi kavala nguwu za lilobota, kamlilira mwana gwakuyi kwa mashaka gavuwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Wana wakuyi woseri wapalu na wadala, wamwiziliti su wamunyamaziyi, kumbiti kalemiti kuwapikanira, kalonga “Mundeki nendeleyi kudaya toziya ya mwana gwangu, mpaka pahowa na kufindirwa.” Hangu ndo tati gwangu ntambu yakamliliriti. <verse eid="GEN 37:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Shaka shilii, Wamidiani wamshuwuziiti Yusufu kwa Potifa, yumu gwa wakulu wa Farao, muntu ayu kaweriti mkulu wa shipinga sha ulolera.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s">Yuda na Tamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Shaka shilii Yuda kawalekiti walongu wakuyi, kagenditi kulikala na muntu yumu lushi lwa Adulami, litawu lyakuyi Hira. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Pakaweriti aku, Yuda kamwoniti muhinga gwa Shuwa muntu gwa Kanaani, kamuyugiti <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />na yomberi kapatiti yinda kamwiwula mwana mpalu. Yuda kamshemiti litawu Eli. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Mdala ulii kapatiti yinda imonga, kamwiwula mwana mpalu, kamshema Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Shakapanu kapatiti mwana yumonga mpalu kamshema Shela. Shela pakiwiyukiti, Yuda kaweriti lushi lwa Kezibu.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Yuda kamuyugira mdala Eli mwana gwakuyi shipanta njira, mdala ayu litawu lyakuyi Tamali. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Kumbiti Eli shipanta njira gwa Yuda, kaweriti mkondola kulongolu kwa Mlungu, su Mlungu kamlagiti. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Shakapanu Yuda kamgambiriti Onani, “Gumtoli mdala gwa mlongu gwakuyi yakahowiti toziya ifiruwa gutendi hangu su gupati kumwiyulira wana mlongu gwaku.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Kumbiti Onani kavimaniti kuwera wana awa mewaweri ndiri wakuyi, su pakagonjiti na mdala gwa mlongu gwakuyi, kitiki ulenji wakuyi kunja nakiza kumpanana wana mlongu gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Shitwatira ashi shakatenditi yomberi shimkalaziyiti Mtuwa, su Mtuwa Mlungu kamlagiti Onani vilaa. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Shakapanu Yuda kamgambiriti Tamali, mdala gwa mwana gwakuyi, “Guwuyi ukaya kwa tati gwaku gusigali mkenja mpaka mwana gwangu Shela pakakula.” Yuda katakuliti hangu toziya katiriti Shela nakahowa gambira walongu wakuyi. Su Tamali kawuyiti ukaya kwa tati gwakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Pashaka shivuwa, mdala gwa Yuda muhinga gwa Shuwa kahowiti. Yuda pakamliliti kudaya shiwembu, kawukiti pamuhera na Hila muntu gwa Adulami ganja gwakuyi, wagenditi Timina kwa wamoga mibahila ya wakondolu wakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Muntu yumu kamgambiriti Tamali, “Mganafu gwakuyi kaweriti munjira kugenda Timina kumoga mibahila ya wakondolu wakuyi,” <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />yomberi kavaliti nguwu zakuyi za ukenja na kuligubika nguwu yaishemwa shela, shakapanu kalikaliti paligomi likulu lya kwingira Enaimu, shijiji shashiweriti munjira kugenda Timina. Yomberi katenditi hangu toziya kawoniti kuwera Shela kaweriti kala mkulu, kumbiti Tamali kamyugisiya ndiri kaweri mdala gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Su Yuda pakamwoniti Tamali pahala palii, kaliholiti kuwera mdala mndiyandiya, toziya yomberi kaligibikiriti sheni shakuwi. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Yuda pota kuvimana kuwera yomberi kaweriti mganafu gwakuyi, su kamgenderiti kumbwega kunjira kulii, kamgambiriti, “Nfira kugonja na gwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Tamali kamkosiya, “Hagumpanani shishi panjimira?”<verse eid="GEN 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Yuda kamwankula, “Hanikupanani mwana gwa mbuzi kulawa mushipinga shangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Tamali kamgambira, “Gutuli poni kulanguziya kuwera hagunjegeri mwana gwa mbuzi.”<verse eid="GEN 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Yuda kamkosiya, “Gufira nikupanani shishi shiweri poni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Na yomberi kamwankula, “Gumpanani peti ayi pamuhera na lugoyi lwakuyi na luhonga lwagukola.” Su Yuda kampananiti vintu vyoseri avi, shakapanu kagonjiti nayu. Tamali kapatiti yinda. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Su Tamali kawuyiti ukaya, kavula shela ilii yakaligibikiriti na kavaliti kayi nguwu yakuwi ya ukenja.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Yuda pakamlagaliriti Mwadulami ganja gwakuyi, kamjegeri mdala ulii mwana gwa mbuzi su kamwuzilili poni vyakamlekeriti, kumbiti Hila kamwoniti ndiri. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Hila kawakosiyiti wenikaya wa Enaimu, “Kakoshi mdala ulii mndiyandiya yakaweriti kumbwega kunjira pakwegera na panu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Womberi wamwankula, “Panu hapeniweri na mdala mndiyandiya.”<verse eid="GEN 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Su yomberi kawuyiti kwa Yuda na kamgambira, “Nimwona ndiri. Viraa wenikaya kulii wang'ambira kuwera hapeniweri mdala mndiyandiya yoseri kulii.”<verse eid="GEN 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Yuda kalonga, “Guleki kavitoli vintu avi, hera hangu hakatutendi watuseki. Gwenga gamweni guwona kuwera nimjegeriti mwana gwa mbuzi kumbiti gumwona ndiri.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Pa myezi mitatu, Yuda kagambiritwi, “Tamali mganafu gwaku kawera mndiyandiya, malawiranu gakuyi vinu kana yinda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Su Yuda kalagalira, wamlaviyi kunja kalunguziwi motu kahowi.<verse eid="GEN 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Pawaweriti wangumlaviya kunja, Tamali katumiti ujumbi kwa mganafu gwakuyi, pakalonga, “Yakawera na vintu avi ndo yakampananiti yinda.” Su nduwa, “Gummani yakawera na peti ayi na lugoyi lwakuyi pamuhera na lukongoshu alu.” <verse eid="GEN 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Yuda kaviyambuliti vintu virii, kalonga, “Tamali muheri kuliku neni. Nakaka neni nimyugisiya ndiri kwa Shela mwana gwangu.” Kwanjira lishaka lilii Yuda kagonjiti kayi ndiri na Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Shaka shakuwi sha kwiyula mwana pashisokiti, imanika kuwera kaweriti na yinda mawira. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Su pakaweriti na utama wa kwiyura, mawira yumu kalaviyiti liwoku, su makolu kamtawiti uzi msheri, pakalonga, “Ayu ndo shipanta njira.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Kumbiti mwana ayu pakawuziyiti liwoku lyakuyi mngati, mlongu gwakuyi kiwuyikiti kwanja. Makolu ulii kalonga, “Ayi ndo ntambu yagulawiti kwa makakala!” Su wamshema Peresi. <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Shakapanu mlongu gwakuyi kiyukiti pakawera na uzi msheri muliwoku lyakuyi na yomberi wamshema Zera. Kwa Shiebrania Zera mana yakuwi kalawiti kwa makakala.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu na mdala gwa Potifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Yusufu wamjegiti mpaka Misri, muntu gwa Misri yumu yakashemitwi Potifa, ulii yakaweriti mkulu gwa Farao na kaweriti mkulu gwa shipinga sha ulolera, yomberi kamuhemeriti kulawa kwa Waishimaeli yawamjegiti Misri.<verse eid="GEN 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti pamuhera na Yusufu na kamtenditi kaherepi nentu mushila shintu shakatenditi. Yomberi kalikaliti mnumba mwa Mmisri mtuwa gwakuyi, <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />na mtuwa gwakuyi kavimaniti kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti pamuhera na Yusufu, ndo yakatenditi vitwatira vyoseri kwa Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Su Yusufu kapatiti upendeleu kulongolu kwa Potifa, yomberi kaweriti ntumintumi gwakuyi gwa gweka, kamtenditi kaweri mgolokera gwa numba yakuwi na mlolera wa ulunda wakuyi woseri. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Kwanjira shaka shilii ashi Potifa pakamtenditi Yufusu kaweri mgolokera gwa numba yakuwi, Mtuwa Mlungu kayitekeleriti numba ya Mmisri ayu toziya ya Yusufu. Matekeleru ga Mtuwa Mlungu gaweriti kwa kila shakaweriti nashu mnumba na mumalambu. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Su Potifa kalekiriti shoseri shakaweriti nashu muulolera wa Yusufu, viraa Potifa kalekiti kutenda shoseri kumbiti shiboga shakuwi mweni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yusufu kaweriti muntemba kaherepa na gwa kufiriziya. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Pashaka tunga mdala gwa Potifa keniti matamata na Yusufu na kumgambiriti, “Gugonji na neni.”<verse eid="GEN 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Kumbiti Yusufu kalema na kumgambira mdala gwa mtuwa gwakuyi, “Gupikanili! Mpalu gwaku kampananiti uwezu wa kila shintu pakaya panu, toziya napanu, katenda ndiri shintu shoseri kayi. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Kwahera muntu yakawera mkulu kuliku neni mnumba amu. Mpalu gwaku kandewelera ndiri shintu shoseri ira gwenga hera, toziya gwenga gwamdala gwakuyi. Hapeni ntendi shitwatira shidoda gambira ashi na kutenda vidoda kulongolu kwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Tembera mdala ulii kendereyiti kumgambira Yusufu kila lishaka, kumbiti Yusufu kalemiti kugonja nayu ama kuwera pakwegera na yomberi.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Lishaka limu Yusufu kingiriti mnumba kutenda mahengu gakuyi na kuweriti kwahera ntumintumi yoseri yakaweriti kankutenda lihengu mnumba. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Su mdala gwa Potifa kamukamuliti yomberi kwa kulikola lihabiti lyakuyi na kumgambira, “Gwizi gugonji na neni!” Kumbiti Yusufu kashapiriti na kumlekera lihabiti lyakuyi mumawoku mwakuyi, su katugiriti kunja. <verse eid="GEN 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Mdala ulii pakawoniti kuwera Yusufu kalileka lihabiti lyakuyi mumawoku mwakuyi na katugiriti kunja, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />su kawashemiti wantumintumi wa mnumba mwakuyi na kuwagambira, “Mloli! Mweburaniya ayu yatujegitwi panu kutuhigilanga, kiziti kwaneni pakafira kugonja na neni, kumbiti neni mbotanga. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Yomberi pakapikaniriti kuwera mbontanga, kalilekiti lihabiti lyakuyi na katugiriti kunja.”<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Su mdala ulii kalituliti lihabiti lilii mpaka mpalu gwakuyi pakawuyiti. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Shakapanu kamgambiriti shashirawiriti pakalonga, “Ntumintumi ayu Mweburaniya yagumjegiti kwa twenga kaniziriti su kanigirangi. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Kumbiti pambotangiti, yomberi kalekiti lihabiti lyakuyi na kutugira kunja.”<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Su Potifa pakapikaniriti visoweru vya mdala gwakuyi vyakamgambiriti, “Ayi ndo ntambu yakantendiriti ntumintumi gwaku.” Potifa kaweriti na maya nentu. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Potifa kamtoliti Yusufu na kumtatira mushibetubetu pahala pawatatiritwi watatirwa wa mfalumi. Kumbiti ata Yusufu pakaweriti kulii mushibetubetu, <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti pamuhera na Yusufu pakamtula weri ata kamtenda kapati upendelewu kulongolu kwa mkulu gwa shibetubetu. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Mkulu gwa shibetubetu ayu kamtula Yusufu kaweri mkulu gwa watatirwa woseri mushibetubetu mulii, kila shintu shashitendikiti amu, shitendikiti kwa uwezu wakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Mkulu gwa shibetubetu, katenditi ndiri kayi na shintu shoseri shakampananiti Yusufu toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti pamuhera na yomberi na kutenda weri mukila shintu shakashitenditi.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu kankutakulira ndotu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Shaka tunga pa vitwatira avi, mkulu gwa yawatenda lihengu muvirandu wamfalumi wa Misri pamuhera na mkulu gwa yawoshiya mabumunda, wamtendiriti vidoda mtuwa gwawu mfalumi gwa Misri. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Farao kawakalaliriti wakulu wakuyi wawili awa, mkulu gwa yawatenda lihengu muvirandu pamuhera na mkulu gwa yawoshiya mabumunda, <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />yomberi kawatatiliti muliboma lya mkulu gwa shipinga sha walolera mushibetubetu, pahala pakatatirituwi Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Mkulu gwa shikosi sha walolera kamsyaguliti Yusufu kawatenderi na womberi wendereyiti kuwera mushibetubetu kwa shaka tunga.<verse eid="GEN 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Su pashiru pamu, mkulu gwa yawatenda lihengu muvirandu pamuhera na mkulu gwa yawoshiya mabumunda wa mfalumi, walotiti ndotu mushibetubetu, na kila yumu kalotiti ndotu na kila ndotu iwera na mana yakuwi. <verse eid="GEN 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Yusufu pakagenditi kwa womberi mandawira, kawawoniti kuwera waweriti na shashatika. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Su Yusufu kawakosiya wakulu walii wa Farao yawaweriti mushibetubetu pamuhera na yomberi mnumba mwa mtuwa gwawu, “Iwera hashi leru muwera na sheni zyazihinginika?”<verse eid="GEN 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Womberi wamwankula, “Twenga tulota na kwahera yakaweza kutakulira ndotu azi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Yusufu kawagambira, “Hashi, kutakulira ndotu lihengu lya Mlungu ndiri? Su mung'ambiri shamlotiti.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Mkulu gwa yawatenda lihengu muvirandu wa mfalumi kamgambiriti Yusufu kulota kwakuyi, pakalonga, “Ndotu yaneni mona mzyabibu kulongolu kwaneni, <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />na guweriti na mintambi mitatu. Katepu yanjiti kutomola mahamba, uluwa wakuyi utomoliti mikunguwi na iwera zyabibu ziwula. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Mumawoku mwaneni muweriti na lwindi lwa mfalumi Farao, su nizitoliti zyabibu nizikamiriti mulwindi alu na nimpananiti Farao.”<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Shakapanu Yusufu kamgambiriti, “Matakuliru ga ndotu yaku ndo aku; mintambi mitatu ilii ndo mashaka matatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Pa mashaka matatu Farao hakakulaviyi kulawa mushibetubetu na kukuwuziya kayi mulihengu lyaku, haguwezi kayi kumpanana Farao lwindi mumawoku ntambu yagutenditi kwanja. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Kumbiti guholi neni, vitwatira paviherepa kwaku, gutakuli maheri kuusu neni kulongolu kwa Farao su ndawi mushibetubetu amu. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Toziya neni ntolosiwitwi kulawa muisi ya Waeburaniya, na panu ntenditi ndiri shoseri shashintenda ntatilwi mushibetubetu.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Mkulu ulii gwa yawoshiya mabumunda pakawoniti kuwera matakulilu galii gaherepa, su kamgambiriti Yusufu, “Vulaa neni ndotiti! Mundotu yaneni moniti nilitwikiti nseru ntatu za mabumunda. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Muluseru lwa pampindi, kuweriti na viboga vya ntambu ivuwa vyavihoshiwitwi kwajili ya Farao. Kumbiti wampongu waweriti wankuliya muluseru amu pamtuwi paneni.” <verse eid="GEN 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Yusufu kamgambira, “Matakuliru ga ndotu ayi ndo ayi, nselu zilii ntatu ndo mashaka matatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Pamashaka matatu Farao hakakulaviyi kulawa mushibetubetu, hakagulikituli mtuwi gwaku na kukukong'ondera mumtera na wampongu hawailiyi nshimba yaku.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Palishaka lya tatu, lishaka lyaliweriti msambu gwa kwiyuka kwakuyi Farao, Farao kawatandiriti shiboga wantumintumi wakuyi woseri, kamlaviyiti mushibetubetu mkulu gwa yawawoshiya mabumunda pamuhera na mkulu yawatenda lihengu muvirandu, su kawatuliti kulongolu pakati pa wantumintumi wakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Shakapanu kamwuzilira ukulu wakuyi mkulu gwa yawatenda lihengu muvirandu kapati kumpanana lwindi Farao. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Kumbiti mkulu gwa yawoshiya mabumunda, kamlikituliti mtuwi na kamkong'onderiti mumtera gambira Yusufu ntambu yakazitakuliriti ndotu zawu. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Pamuhera na hangu, mkulu gwa yawatenda lihengu muvirandu kamuholiti ndiri Yusufu, kumbiti kamlyaluwiti nakamu.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu kankutakulira ndotu ya Farao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Pa mivinja miwili yoseri, Farao kalotiti ndotu. Yomberi kaweriti kagolokiti kumpeku kulushemba Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />kawawoniti wang'ombi saba waherepa pawalawa mulushemba na kuliya mahamba. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Shakapanu, wang'ombi wamonga saba yawayonditi nentu walawiti mulushemba Naili, wiziti na kugoloka pakwegera na wang'ombi walii waherepa, kumpeku kulushemba. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Wang'ombi awa yawayonditi nentu wawaliyiti wang'ombi walii wamonga waherepa. Su Farao kimukiti mumpota. <verse eid="GEN 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Pakagonjiti kayi kalotiti mala ya pili, kawoniti mikunguwi saba mikulu na iherepa yankutomola mushitepu shimu. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Shakapanu pa ayi, mikunguwi imonga saba iyonda na yaiyumiziwitwi na lihega liyuma lya kushiwala lilawira. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Mikunguwi saba iyonda iyimiti mikunguwi saba mikulu yaimemiti mbuji. Su Farao pakimukiti kayambuliti kuwera kaweriti kankulota. <verse eid="GEN 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Shilawu yakuwi mandawira, Farao pakaweriti na shashatika nentu, kawashemiti wahawi woseri wa Misri pamuhera na yawawera na luhala, kawagambiriti ndotu zyakuwi, kumbiti kuweriti kwahera ata yumu yakaweziti kumtakulilira ndotu azi.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Shakapanu mlolera mkulu gwa virandu kamgambiriti Farao, “Leru niguhola ga nkositi! <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Shaka tunga Farao kawakalaliriti wantumintumi wakuyi, neni pamuhera na mkulu gwa wahoshiya mabumunda, katutatiriti muliboma lya mkulu gwa shipinga sha walolera. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Pashiru pamu tulotiti ndotu, kila muntu kalotiti ndotu yakuwi yaiwera na mana yakuwi. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Su muntemba yumu Mweburaniya ntumintumi gwa mkulu gwa shipinga sha ulolera, kaweriti pamuhera na twenga mshibetubetu. Patumgambiriti kulota kwa twenga, yomberi kaweziti kumtakulira mana kwa kila muntu ntambu yakalotiti. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Ntambu yakatutakuliriti irawiriti ntambu iraa ilii. Neni mbuziwituwi mulihengu lyangu, mkulu gwa wahoshiya mabumunda kapingikitwi pamtera.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Su Farao kalagalira wamshemi Yusufu, yomberi wamlaviyiti mushibetubetu kalongola. Yusufu pakamogiti kala na kuvala nguwu zakuwi zingi, kiziti kulongolu kwa Farao.<verse eid="GEN 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Farao kamgambiriti Yusufu, “Neni ndota kumbiti kwahera muntu yakaweziti kuntakulira ndotu yaneni. Mpikanira nzyumi zaku kuwera gwenga pagugambirwa ndotu guweza kuitakulira.”<verse eid="GEN 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Yusufu kamgambira Farao, “Hapeni wezi kuitakulira kumbiti Mlungu hakakupanani lyankulu liherepa.”<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Shakapanu Farao kamgambiriti Yusufu, “Ndotiti kuwera ng'olokiti mumbwega mwa lushemba lwa Naili. <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />Moniti wang'ombi saba waherepa na wanenepa pawalawira mulushemba na kuliya mahamba. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Pa wang'ombi awa, wafatitwi na wang'ombi wamonga saba yawaweriti goyigoyi, wababani na wayonditi nentu. Neni hanenipati kuwawona wang'ombi wa ntambu ayi muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Su wang'ombi walii yawayonditi nentu, wawaliyiti wang'ombi wamonga saba walii yawanenepiti. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Kumbiti wang'ombi walii yawayonditi ata pawawaliyiti kala wang'ombi yawanenepiti, kwahera muntu yoseri mekavimani kuwera wawaliyiti wayawu, toziya waweriti wayonda ntambu yawaweriti kwanja. Shakapanu neni nimukiti mumpota.<verse eid="GEN 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />Vilaa mundotu yamonga moniti mikunguwi saba iherepa yaimemiti viboga payitomoliti mushitepu shimu. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Shakapanu ifatiti mikunguwi saba yamonga yahera shintu, iyonda na iyumisiwitwi na lihega liyuma lya kushiwala. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Mikunguwi saba ilii yaiyonditi, iyimiti mikunguwi saba ilii yaiherepa. Su neni niwagambiriti wahawi kumbiti kwahera muntu yakaweziti kuntakulira.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Shakapanu Yusufu kamgambiriti Farao, “Ndotu zaku zoseri mbili ziwera na mana yimu, Mlungu kamgubutulira Farao shilii shakagenda kushitenda. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Ng'ombi saba waherepa walii ndo mivinja saba, mikunguwi saba iherepa viraa ndo mivinja saba. Ndotu azi ziwera na mana yimu. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Wang'ombi saba yawayonditi nentu, walii yawawafatiti walii yawanenepa na mikunguwi saba yahera shintu, yaiyumisiwitwi na lipuga liyuma lya kushiwala, mana yakuwi mivinja saba vya njala.<verse eid="GEN 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Ntambu yanikugambiriti, gwee Farao, Mlungu kakugubutulira vitwatira vyavigenda kulawira pakwegera. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Hakuweri na mivinja saba vya viboga vivuwa muisi yoseri ya Misri. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Kumbiti shakapanu hakuweri na mivinja saba ya njala na mivinja saba yoseri ya viboga hayilyaluwi, toziya njala haiyagamiziyi isi ayi. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Mivinja ya viboga vivuwa ayi hayilyaluwi nakamu toziya njala yaigenda kulawila hayiweri nkulu nentu. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Kulota kwakuyi kuwuyiriti mala mbili kwa kulifana kulanguziya kuwera nakaka Mlungu hakatendi shintu hashilawiri pakwegera.”<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />“Su vinu gwee Farao, gumsyaguli muntu yakawera na mahala na luhala, gumpanani lihengu lya kuigolokera isi yoseri ya Misri. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Kayi gwee Farao, guwasyaguli wagolokera muisi, guwalagaliri wajojoniri semu ya muhanu ya mabenu goseri ga Misri mushaka ashi sha mivinja saba ya viboga vivuwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Guwalagaliri wagolokera awa wajojoniri shiboga shoseri mumivinja saba yaiyiza ya viboga vivuwa. Viboga avi vituluwi kwa ulolera gwaku gwee Farao, shiweri shigubikiru kwa lushi zoseri na wavituli weri viboga avi. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Shiboga ashi hashiweri shigubikiru sha isi ya Misri naiyiza kwagamila kwa njala, mivinja saba yaiza shakapanu.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu wankumpanana ukulu muisi ya Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Shisoweru shakatakuliti Yusufu shiwoneka shiherepa kulongolu kwa Farao pamuhera na wakulu yawaguwi woseri. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Su Farao kawakosiya wakulu wayaguwi, “Hashi, hatuwezi kumpata muntu yoseri gambira ayu, Rohu gwa Mlungu kamngati mwakuyi?”<verse eid="GEN 41:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Shakapanu kamgambira Yusufu, “Toziya Mlungu kakugubutulira goseri aga, kwahera muntu gwingi yakawera na mahala na luhala gambira gwenga. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Gwenga haguweri mgolokera gwa numba yaneni na wantu waneni woseri hawaweri pasi pa malagaliru gaku. Neni hera ndo mkulu kuliku gwenga toziya Nilivaga mushibanta sha shifalumi.<verse eid="GEN 41:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Su Farao kamgambiriti Yusufu, guloli, nikusyagula gwenga guweri mgolokera muisi yoseri ya Misri.” <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Shakapanu Farao kayivula peti yakuwi ya shimaniziru kulawa mushyala shakuwi na kushivalisiya shyala sha Yusufu. Kamvalasiya vilaa mahabiti ga shifalumi na ukufu wa zahabu msingu. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Farao kamkweniziya mumbutuka yakuwi ya pili yaikwegitwi na farasi, “Walolera walongoleriti kulongolu kwa Yusufu pawabotanga na kulonga, msegeri kutali munjira! Msegeri kutali munjira! Farao kampanana Yusufu ugolokeru muisi yoseri ya Misri.” <verse eid="GEN 41:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Kayi Farao kamgambira Yusufu, “Neni ndo Farao! Muntu yoseri muisi yoseri ya Misri nakanyasula liwoku ama ligulu lyakuyi pota shibali shaku.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Farao kampananiti Yusufu litawu Safenatipanea, kamuyugira Asenati muhinga gwa Potifera, ulii mtambika gwa lushi lwa Oni. Su Yusufu kanjiti kutyangira isi yoseri ya Misri.<verse eid="GEN 41:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Yusufu kaweriti na mivinja malongu matatu pakanjiti kumtendera Farao, mfalumi gwa Misri. Kalawiti muliboma lya Farao na katyangiriti isi yoseri ya Misri.<verse eid="GEN 41:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Mushaka sha mivinja saba ilii ya viboga vivuwa, malambu ga Misri galaviyiti viboga vivuwa nentu. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Yusufu kajojoniriti viboga vyoseri, mushaka ashi sha mivinja saba ya viboga na kuvitula shigubikiru mlushi za Misri. Mukila lushi katuliti shigubikiru sha viboga kulawa mumalambu yagaweriti pakwegera na lushi alu. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Yusufu katuliti shigubikiru sha viboga vivuwa nentu viwera vivuwa gambira muhanga gwa bahari ata viweza ndiri kuwalangwa.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Pamberi pa mivinja vya njala kwiza, Yusufu kaweriti kapatiti kala wana wapalu wawili kupitira mdala gwakuyi Asenati muhinga gwa Potifera, ulii mtambika gwa lushi lwa Oni. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Yusufu kamshema mwana gwakuyi shipanta njira litawu Menasi, yomberi pakalonga, “Mlungu kantenda nilyaluwi kutabika kwangu kwoseri pamuhera na walongu wa tati gwangu. <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Mwana gwakuyi gwa pili kamshema Efraimu, pakalonga, Mlungu kampanana wana muisi ya kutabika kwaneni.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Mivinja ilii saba ya viboga vivuwa muisi ya Misri ipititi. <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />Yanjiti mivinja saba ya njala ntambu yaitakulitwi na Yusufu kwanja. Isi zimonga zoseri ziweriti na njala, kumbiti isi yoseri ya Misri iweriti na shiboga shivuwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />“Isi yoseri ya Misri paiweriti na njala, Wantu wanjiti kumlilira Farao kawapanani shiboga. Na Farao kawagambiriti wantu woseri wa Misri, mgendi kwa Yusufu, shakawagambira mtendi.”<verse eid="GEN 41:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Njala payongeriti kuwera nkulu na kweneya muisi yoseri, Yusufu kavuguliti hanja zoseri na kawashuwuzira Wamisri shiboga. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Vilaa wantu wa isi zimonga pasipanu wiziti Misri kuhemera shiboga kwa Yusufu, toziya njala iweriti nkulu nentu pasipanu poseri.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s">Walongu wa Yusufu wankugenda Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Yakobu pakapatiti visoweru kuwera aku Misri kuweriti na viboga, kawagambiriti wana wakuyi, “Iwera hashi mwapanu mwankulilola hera? <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Neni mpikanira kuwera Misri kwana viboga. Mseleri kugenda aku mwakahemeri shiboga natwiza kuhowa kwa njala.”<verse eid="GEN 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Su walongu walii lilongu wa Yusufu wagenditi Misri kuhemera shiboga. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Kumbiti Yakobu kamlekiti ndiri Benjamini mpusu gwa Yusufu, kagendi pamuhera na kaka wakuyi, toziya katiriti kuwera mekatabiki. <verse eid="GEN 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Su wana wa Israeli wasokiti Misri pawawera muwamu mwa walii yawagenditi kuhemera shiboga, toziya njala iweriti nkulu nentu vilaa muisi ya Kanaani.<verse eid="GEN 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Shaka ashi Yusufu kaweriti ndo mgolokera mkulu aku muisi ya Misri. Yomberi ndo yakaweriti kankuwashuwuzira wantu shiboga. Su kaka wakuyi pawasokiti, wasuntamaliti makukama kulongolu kwa Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Yusufu pakawawoniti kaka wakuyi kawamana, kumbiti kalitenditi kuwera kawamaniti ndiri, kayoweriti nawa kwa kukalipa. Su kawakosiya, mwenga mlawa koshi?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:7">“Womberi wamwankula, twenga tulawa muisi ya Kanaani, twiza kuhemera shiboga.”<verse eid="GEN 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Tembera Yusufu kawamaniti kaka wakuyi kumbiti womberi wamumaniti ndiri. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Yusufu Kaholiti ndotu zakuwi za makashu kuusu kaka wakuyi, kawagambira, “Mwenga mwawalolalola mwiza kulolalola ugoigoi wa isi ya twenga.”<verse eid="GEN 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Womberi wamwankula, ndala mtuwa gwetu. “Twenga wantumintumi waku twiza kuhemera shiboga. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Twenga twawalongu wana wa tati yumu, twenga twawantu ndiri walolalola kumbiti twawantu waminika.”<verse eid="GEN 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Kumbiti Yusufu kahimiziya kuwagambira, ndala! “Mwenga mwiza su kulolalola handa isi ya twenga yahera likakala.”<verse eid="GEN 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Womberi wamgambira, “Twengapa wantumintumi waku, twawalongu lilongu na mbili. Mlongu gwetu yumu kahowiti na mpusu gwetu kasigala na tati gwetu ukaya.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Kumbiti Yusufu kawagambira, “Ntambu yantakuliti kuwera mwenga walolalola. <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Hangu ndo ntambu hamjeruwi, Nakaka nilirapa kwa litawu lya Farao, hapeni muwuki panu mpaka pakiza mpusu gwenu panu. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Mumtumi yumu gwenu kagendi kamjegi mlongu gwenu mpusu, wamonga wenu pawawera mushibetubetu. Panu mwenga hamumaniki kuwera mtakula nakaka. Paiwera ndiri hangu, nilirapa kwa litawu lya Farao kuwera mwenga walolalola!” <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Shakapanu kawatatiliti woseri mushibetubetu kwa mashaka matatu.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Lishaka lya tatu Yusufu kawagambiriti kaka wakuyi, “Toziya neni nimtira Mlungu, mtendi hangu su mpati kulikala. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Handa nakaka mwenga mwa wantu waheri, yumu gwenu kasigali mushibetubetu, wamonga wawajegeri shiboga walongu wenu yawatabika na njala. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Shakapanu mumjegi mlongu gwenu mpusu. Ayi ayilanguziyi nakaka visoweru vyenu na mwenga hapeni mlaguwi. Su womberi wajimira kutenda hangu.”<verse eid="GEN 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Shakapanu womberi walitakuziyana weni kwa weni, nakaka twengapa twankutabika toziya ya mlongu gwetu. “Tembera tuwoniti hinginika yakuwi, kumbiti twenga tumsheriti ndiri ata pakatuluwiti. Ndo maana ntabiku ayi yoseri yankutupata.”<verse eid="GEN 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Rubeni kawagambira, hashi, neni niwagambiriti ndiri natutenda vidoda kwa kumtenduwa yomberi? “Kumbiti mwenga mumpikaniriti ndiri neni! Vinu twankuazibiwa kwajili ya mwazi gwakuyi.”<verse eid="GEN 42:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Womberi wavimaniti ndiri kuwera Yusufu kavimaniti goseri aga gawatakuliti, toziya kuweriti na muntu gwa kumtakulira shawayoweriti.<verse eid="GEN 42:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Su Yusufu kagenditi kumbwega kaliliti, pakanyamaliti kawuyiti kuyowera nawomberi. Shakapanu kalagaliriti kuwera Simiyoni kakamulitwi na kumtawa pingu kulongolu kwa masu gawu.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walongu wa Yusufu wankuwuya Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Yusufu kalagaliriti mumalobota gawu wamemiziyi viboga, kila yumu gwawu wamwuziliri mpiya mulilobota lyakuyi, na wapananwi shiboga sha munjira. Shitwatira ashi shitendikiti kwa womberi, <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />wawapapiziya wankanyama punda wawu, visanka vyawu vya viboga, shakapanu wawukiti. <verse eid="GEN 42:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Womberi pawasokiti pahala pa kugonjera mwanja kwa wahenga, yumu gwawu kayopoliti lilobota lyakuyi su kapati kumliziya nkanyama punda gwakuyi, su kalikangashiti kuwona mpiya mumlomu mwa lilobota lyakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Su kawagambiriti walongu wakuyi, mpiya zangu ziwuzilirwa, zamumlomu mwa lilobota lyangu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:28">“Womberi pawapikaniriti aga, wafuwa moyu. Waliloliti weni kwa weni na kutetema pawalikosiya, shitwatira gaa ashi shakatutenderiti Mlungu?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Pawasokiti muisi ya Kanaani kwa tati gwawu Yakobu, womberi wamgambiriti goseri yagawapatiti, wamgambira.<verse eid="GEN 42:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />“Mkulu gwa isi ilii katakuliti na twenga kwa kukalala, na kutugambira twenga twawalolalola muisi mwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Kumbiti twenga tumgambira kuwera twenga twawantu walolalola ndiri kumbiti twawantu waheri. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Tumgambiriti vulaa kuwera twenga twawalongu lilongu na mbili wana wa tati yumu na yumu gwetu kahowiti kala na mpusu ulii kaukaya muisi ya Kanaani pamuhera na tati gwetu. <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />Mkulu gwa isi ayi katugambiriti hangu, ntambu ayi hanivimani kuwera nakaka mwenga wantu waheri. Mumleki kwaneni mlongu gwenu yumu, wamonga wajegi viboga ukaya kwa walongu wenu yawatabika na njala. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Shakapanu mumjegeri mpusu, su hanivimani kuwera mwenga wantu waheri. Pamtenda hangu hanimlekiziyi mlongu gwenu, na mwenga hamlekeziwi kushuwuza vintu muisi ayi.” <verse eid="GEN 42:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Pawaweriti wankwitira viboga kulawa mumalobota gawu, walikangashiti kuwona kila yumu gwawu wamtulira mpiya mulilobota lyakuyi. Womberi pawawoniti hangu, woseri pamuhera na tati gwawu, waweriti na lyoga nentu. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Tati gwawu Yakobu kawagambira, mumpoka wana waneni. “Yusufu kwahera, Simiyoni kwahera, vinu mfira kumtora Benjamini. Goseri aga gampata neni!”<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Palii Rubeni kamgambiriti tati gwakuyi, panumwuziya ndiri Benjamini, guwalagi wana waneni wawili. “Gumleki Benjamini mumawoku gangu, neni hanimloleri na kumwuziya kwa gwenga.”<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Kumbiti tati gwakuyi kamwankula, mwana gwangu hapeni kagendi pamuhera na mwenga, kaka “Gwakuyi kahowiti na kasigala ayu gweka yakuwi. Paiwera hakapatwi shoseri shidoda mumwanja gwamfira gugenda, su hamundagi kwa hinginiku.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s">Benjamini kankugenda Misri pamuhera na kaka zyakuwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Shakapanu njala iweriti nkulu nentu muisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Su womberi pawamaliliti kala kuliya shiboga shilii shawashihemeliti Misri, “Yakobu tati gwawu kawagambiriti wana wakuyi, mgendi kayi Misri, mwakatuhemeleri shiboga shingi.”<verse eid="GEN 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Kumbiti Yuda kamgambiriti Tati gwakuyi, “Muntu ulii yakatuberiziyiti palonga, hapeni niwawanki pamwiza ndiri na mpusu gwenu. <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Handa pagujimira mlongu gwetu kagendi pamuhera na twenga, hatugendi kukuhemelera shiboga. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Handa pagujimira ndiri kagendi pamuhera na twenga, hapeni tugendi aku, toziya muntu ulii katugambiriti pota kufifa, hapeni mumoni neni pamwiza ndiri na mpusu gwenu.”<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Israeli kakosiya, “Iwera hashi muntabisiya kumgambira muntu ayu kuwera muwera na mpusu gwingi?” <verse eid="GEN 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Womberi wamwankula, “Muntu ulii katukosiyiti weri kuusu vitwatira vyatwenga na walongu wetu pakalonga, hashi, tati gwenu kankali mkomu? Hashi, muwera na mlongu gwingi? Su twenga tumwankuliti kulawirana na makosiwu gakuyi. Twenga metuvimani hashi kuwera mekatakuli, mumjegi mpusu gwenu?”<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Su Yuda kamgambiriti Israeli tati gwakuyi, “Gunjimiri neni ng'endi na yomberi, su hatuwuki kalongola tugendi twakahemeli shiboga natwiza kuhowa njala pamuhera na gwenga na wana wetu. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Neni namweni haweri mgolokera gwakuyi, gwenga hagushongi neni. Panumwuziya ndiri gumoni kwa masu gaku, lawama hayiweri kwaneni mashaka gangu goseri. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Handa metukawi ndiri, metugendi kala kulii na kuwuya panu mala mbili.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Panu Israeli tati gwawu kawagambira, “Yina! Handa mpaka iweri hangu, su mtendi ntambu ayi. Mtuli mumalobota genu viboga vimu viherepa vya isi yetu, mumjegeri mkulu ayu lifupu. Mumtoleri vulaa lipaki lididiki lya ukwashu na lwashi na ubani na manimani na kungu pamuhera na lozi. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Mtoli mpiya mala mbili toziya hamuziwuziyi mpiya zilii zyazitulitwi pamalobota genu. Pamonga wazituliti pota kuvimana. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Mumtoli vilaa mpusu gwenu mgendi kwa muntu ayu. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Mlungu yakawera na makakala kawapanani lusungu kulongolu kwa muntu ayu, kawalekerani mlongu gwenu yumonga ulii pamuhera na Benjamini wawuyi pamuhera. Kwaneni handa, panyagamirwa wana wangu nahera shakutenda.”<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Su womberi watoliti mafupu galii, na mpiya mala mbili, wagenditi Misri pamuhera na Benjamini mpusu gwawu. Pawasokiti Misri, womberi wagenditi kugoloka kulongolu kwa Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Yusufu pakamwoniti Benjamini pamuhera na womberi, su kamgambiriti mgolokera gwa numba yakuwi, “Guwatoli wantu awa kugenda nawu ukaya kwaneni, kamlikituli nkanyama yumu na kumunyawa weri, toziya wantu awa hawaliyi shiboga pamuhera na neni paliwala.”<verse eid="GEN 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Mgolokera ayu katenditi ntambu yawamgambiriti, kawatoliti wahenga walii kuwajega ukaya kwa Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 43:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Pawawoniti kuwera wawajega ukaya kwa Yusufu, womberi waweriti na lyoga, walitakuziyana weni kwa weni, “Watujega agawu toziya ya mpiya zilii zyawatuwuziliriti mumalobota getu patwiziti kwanja su kapati kutushambulia na sha kututakulira madoda su kapati kutukoma vumu na kutupoka wankanyama punda wetu na kututenda wamanda wakuyi.”<verse eid="GEN 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Su womberi wamgendiriti mgolokera gwa numba ya Yusufu na wayoweriti nayu paligomi lya numba. <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />Womberi wamgambira, “Shondi shondi mtuwa, twiziti panu kwanja kuhemera shiboga. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Patusokiti pahala pa kugonja wahenga, tuyopoliti malobota getu, tulikangashiti kuwona mpiya za kila yumu gwetu pamalobota gakuyi. Vinu tuziwuziya mpiya azi. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Tujega mpiya zyamonga kuhemera shiboga. Tuvimana ndiri gaa yakatuliti mpiya zetu mumalobota getu.”<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Mgolokera ulii kawankula, “Namuwera na lyoga. Mlungu gwenu, Mlungu gwa tati gwenu, kawapananiti mwenga mpiya mumalobota genu. Neni nangiti mpiya zyenu.” Shakapanu kawajegera Simiyoni mlongu gwawu.<verse eid="GEN 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Mgolokera ayu kawashemiriti ukaya kwa Yusufu, kawapananiti mashi ga kugulula magulu gawu, vulaa kawaliyiziya wankanyama punda wawu. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Womberi watandiriti mafupu gawu ga kumpanana Yusufu toziya wapikaniliti kuwera hawaliyi shiboga pamuhera na yomberi. <verse eid="GEN 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Yusufu, pakawuyiti ukaya, wamjegera mafupu galii gawaweriti naga, wamsuntamalira.<verse eid="GEN 43:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Yusufu kawakosiya ntambu yawawera na shakapanu na kulonga, “Mung'ambiriti visoweru vya mgogolu tati gwenu. Hashi, kakashina? Kankali mkomu?”<verse eid="GEN 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Womberi wamwankula, “Ntumintumi gwaku tati gwetu, kakashina na kankali mkomu.” Shakapanu wasuntamiti makukama kulongolu kwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 43:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Yusufu pakanyasuliti masu gakuyi na kumwona Benjamini mlongu gwakuyi, mwana gwa mawu gwakuyi, su kalonga, “Ayu ndo mlongu gwenu mpusu yamung'ambiriti visoweru vyakuwi? Muntemba gwangu, Mlungu na kakupanani upendeleu.” <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Shakapanu Yusufu kawukiti pahala palii, toziya masozi gaweriti gankumlawa kwa maholu makulu kuusu mlongu gwakuyi. Kingiriti kalongola mushiwogu shakuwi na kanjiti kulira aku.<verse eid="GEN 43:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Pakafyankuliti kala sheni shakuwi, kalawiti kunja pakalikamamiziya, kalagalira pakalonga, “Mujegi shiboga.”<verse eid="GEN 43:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Yusufu wamtandiriti shiboga shakuwi gweka yakuwi, na walongu wakuyi wawatandira gweka yawu, na ntambu iraa ayi wantu wa Misri yawaliyiti pamuhera na yomberi, watandaritwi gweka yawu, toziya ndo nkalaliru kwa wantu wa Misri kuliya shiboga pamuhera na Waeburaniya. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Walongu wakuyi Yusufu walivagiti kulongolu kwakuyi kulinganira na umuli gwa mivinja vyawu, kwanjira mkulu mpaka gwa upeleru. Womberi pawawoniti ntambu yawavagiti, su waliloliti pawalikangasha. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Pawajegiti semu ya shiboga kulawa pashitalawanda sha Yusufu, shiboga sha Benjamini shiweriti mala muhanu kuliku wamonga. Su walanditi na kunemelera pamuhera na Yusufu.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s">Lwindi lwaluwoneka mulilobota lya Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Shakapanu Yusufu kamlagaliriti mgolokera gwa numba yakuwi pakalonga, “Gumemiziyi malobota ga wantu awa viboga shyasi shawaweza kujega. Shakapanu gutuli mpiya za kila muntu pampindi pa lilobota lyakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Mulilobota lya mpusu ulii gutuli lwindi lwaneni lwa madini ga feza pamuhera na mpiya zakuwi. Mgolokera ulii katenditi ntambu yakamgambiritwi Yusufu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Papawushiyiti, yomberi kawalekiziya kuwuka pamuhera na wankanyama punda wawu. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Womberi pawaweriti wamumwanja mutali ndiri kulawa mlushi, “Yusufu kamgambira mgolokera gwa numba yakuwi, kalongola guwafati wantu walii na paguwawona, guwakosiyi, iwera hashi mlipa maheli gamtenderitwi kwa makondola? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Iwera hashi mwiwa lwindi lwa mtuwa gwangu, mweni kalandiraga na kushitendera kutungira? Mwenga mkosa nentu kwa kutenda hangu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Mgolokera ulii pakawawoniti kawagambiriti visoweru avi. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Kumbiti womberi wamkosiya, iwera hashi gutugambira ntambu ayi mtuwa gwetu? “Tulirapa, twenga wantumintumi waku hapeni tutendi shitwatira sha ntambu ayi! <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Guliholi mtuwa, mpiya yatuziwoniti pamalobota getu tuziwuziyiti kulawa muisi ya Kanaani. Iwezekani hashi kwiwa kayi mpiya ama zahabu mnumba mwa mkulu gwaku? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Su pakapatikana yumu gwetu kana lwindi alu, su kalaguwi na twawoseri twenga hatuweri wamanda waku.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Mgoloke ayu kalonga, yina iweri ntambu yamlonga. “Lwindi paliwoneka kwa yoseri hakaweri mmanda gwangu, kumbiti wamonga woseri hapeni muweri na lawama.”<verse eid="GEN 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Su kila yumu kasulusiya lilobota lyakuyi pasi kalongola na kuliyopola. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Mgolokera ulii kagaloliti malobota goseri, kanjiti kulilola lya mkulu gwawu na kumalilira lya mpusu gwawu. Su lwindi luwoneka mulilobota lya Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Shakapanu wapapula nguwu zawu kwa kwinginika, kila yumu gwawu kampapiziya punda gwakuyi shisanka shakuwi wawuya mlushi.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Yuda na walongu wakuyi pawasokiti ukaya kwa Yusufu, mweni kaweriti kankali muwukaya. Su wamsuntamaliti yomberi kwa ligoya. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Na Yusufu kawakosiya, iwera hashi mtenda ntambu ayi? “Hashi muvimaniti ndiri kuwera muntu gambira neni nanawu uwezu wa kutunga?”<verse eid="GEN 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Yuda kamwankula, tutakuli shishi kwa gwenga mtuwa gwetu? “Hatuwezi hashi kulanguziya kuwera twenga twahera kosa? Mlungu kagubutula ukondola wa wantumintumi waku. Vinu twawoseri twenga pamuhera na ulii yakawonikaniti na lwindi lwaku, hatuweri wamanda waku.”<verse eid="GEN 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Kumbiti Yusufu kalongiti, ndala! Neni hapeni ntendi ntambu ayi! “Ulii hera yakawonekaniti na lwindi lwaneni, hakaweri mmanda gwangu. Kumbiti mwawoseri mwenga muwuyi kwa tati gwenu kwa ponga.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kankumteteya Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />so Yuda kasegelera Yusufu na kumgambira, “Mtuwa, nikuluwa gunjimiri neni ntumintumi gwaku, ntakuli shisoweru kwa mtuwa gwangu. Nagumkalilira ntumintumi gwaku, tembera gwera gwa teratera na Farao mweni. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Mtuwa, gwenga gutukosiyiti, hashi, mwenga muwera na tati ama mlongu? <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Su twenga tukuwankuliti, yina! Twana tati mgogolu, vulaa twana mlongu gwingi mpusu yakiwukiti shaka sha ugogolu wa tati gwetu. Kaka gwakuyi mpusu ayu kahowiti kala na mpusu ayu ndo yakasigaliti gweka kwa mawu gwakuyi, na tati gwetu kamfira nentu mpusu ayu. <verse eid="GEN 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Shakapanu mtuwa gutulagaliriti twenga wantumintumi waku, mgendi mwakanjegeri mpusu gwenu, mpati kumwona. <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Twenga tukugambiriti, mpusu ayu hapeni kalileki na tati gwakuyi, toziya pakatenda ntambu ayi tati gwakuyi hakahowi. <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Kumbiti gwenga guwagambiriti wantumintumi waku, pamwiza ndiri na mlongu gwenu mpusu, hapeni niwawanki kayi.<verse eid="GEN 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />Patuwuyiti ukaya kwa ntumintumi gwaku, twenga tumgambiriti tati gwetu ntambu yagutulagaliriti, mtuwa. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Shakapanu tati gwetu katugambiriti, mgendi kayi mwakaheneri shiboga shamonga. <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Kumbiti twenga tumgambiriti, hapeni tugendi, ira mpusu gwetu pakagenda pamuhera na twenga. Handa pakagenda ndiri pamuhera na twenga, twenga hapeni tuwankuwi na muntu ulii. <verse eid="GEN 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />Su tati gwetu, ntumintumi gwaku katugambiriti, muvimana kuwera mdala gwangu Raheli kaniwuliriti wana wawili.” <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />Yumu kagamiriti, na neni nongiti, nakaka nkanyama gwa kuntundu kampapulanga vipandi vipandi, toziya nimwoniti ndiri kayi. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />“Handa pamumtola ayu vulaa kwa neni, payiwera hakapatwi shoseri shidoda, su hamundagi kwa hinginiku.”<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />Su mtuwa panumwuyira tati gwangu ntumintumi gwaku pota mpusu ayu, ukomu wa tati ulikolerana pamuhera na mpusu ayu, <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />na pakawona mpusu ayu kapamuhera ndiri na twenga hakahowi. Twenga wantumintumi waku, hatumlagi tati gwetu kwa hinginiku. <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />“Vulaa neni mweni ntumintumi gwaku nililaviyiti kuwera mgolokera gwa mpusu ayu kwa tati gwangu. Su panumgambira yomberi kuwera nimuwuziya ndiri Benjamini kwa gwenga, handawumiwi mashaka goseri.” <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Vinu gwenga mtuwa nikuluwa, neni ntumintumi gwaku nsigali weri mmanda gwaku, gumleki mpusu ayu kawuyi pamuhera kaka zakuwi. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Hawezi hashi kumwuyira tati gwangu pota mpusu ayu? Weza ndiri kuhepelera kuwona galii hagampati tati gwangu.<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu kankulimaniziya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Shakapanu Yusufu kasinditi kulilewelera kulongolu kwa wantumintumi woseri yawaweriti pamuhera nayu, kawalagaliriti walawi kunja. Su Yusufu pakasigaliti gweka yakuwi, kalimaniziyiti kwa walongu wakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Yomberi kaliriti kwa liziwu mpaka wantu walii wa Misri wampikanira, vulaa wantu wa Farao wampikaniriti.<verse eid="GEN 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Yusufu kawagambiriti walongu wakuyi, neni ndo Yusufu. Hashi, tati gwangu kankali mkomu? Kumbiti walongu wakuyi wasindiki kumwankula toziya waweriti wankulikangasha kwa lyoga kulongolu kwakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Su Yusufu kawagambiriti walongu wakuyi, shondi shondi, msegeleri pakwegera na neni. Womberi pawasegeleriti, yomberi kawagambira, neni ndo mlongu gwenu Yusufu, ulii yamumshuwuziti Kumisri. <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Kumbiti vinu namwinginika ama namulikalalirana maweni kwa maweni, toziya munshuwuziti aku, su Mlungu kanjegiti uganu niwalongoleri su nigalopoli makaliru ga wantu. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Ashi ndo shinja sha pili hera sha njala muisi, su isigala mivinja muhanu yamonga, wantu hapeni wawezi kulima ama kubena. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Mlungu kanjegiti aku niwalongoleri, su nigalopoli makaliru genu msigali wakomu muisi na kuwalopoziya kwa ulopoziya mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Su mwenga munjegiti ndiri uganu, kumbiti Mlungu ndo yakanjegiti. Mlungu kantenditi kuwera gambira tati kwa Farao, mgolokera gwa numba yakuwi yoseri na mkolamlima gwa isi yoseri ya Misri.<verse eid="GEN 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />“Su mtendi kalongola mgendi kwa tati na kumgambira Yusufu mwana gwaku kalonga, mlungu kantenda kuwera mkulu gwa isi yoseri ya Misri. Nagukawi kwiza kwaneni. <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Hagulikali pakwegera na neni semu ya lushi lwa Gosheni, gwenga na wana waku na wazukulu waku, wakondolu waku na wambuzi na wang'ombi na kila shintu shaguwera nashi. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Paguwera aku, neni hanikuloleri weri gwenga na walongu waku pamuhera na wankanyama waku su namwiza kuhowa njala, toziya isigala mivinja muhanu ya njala.”<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />Shakapanu Yusufu kalonga, mwenga maweni muwona kwa masu genu, ata mlongu gwangu Benjamini kawona kwa masu gakuyi kuwera neni namweni Yusufu yanyowera na mwenga. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />“Mumgambiri tati gwangu kuusu ligoya lyangu Misri uganu na goseri gamgawoniti, su mtendi kalongola mwakamjegi tati gwangu uganu.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Shakapanu Yusufu kamkisikira Benjamini, mlongu gwakuyi na kalira, Benjamini vulaa kaliriti, agawu pawalikisikira. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Vulaa kawakisikira walongu wakuyi na kuwanonera. Shakapanu walongu wakuyi waweziti kuyowera nayu.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Visoweru pavisokiti kunumba ya mfalumi, kuwera walongu wa Yusufu wasokiti, Farao pamuhera na wakulu wayaguwi woseri wanemeleliti. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Su Farao kamgambira Yusufu, “Guwagambiri walongu wakuyi wawapapiziyi wankanyama punda wawu visanka, wawuyi muisi ya Kanaani, <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />wamjegi panu tati gwawu na walongu wawu woseri. Neni hanikupanani pahala paherepa nakamu muisi ya Misri, peni hawawezi kunemelera uherepa woseri wa isi ayi. <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Guwagambiri vulaa watoli kulawa panu mbutuka zyazikwegwa ga kuwajega wana wawu wadidini pamuhera na wadala wawu, nawaleka kumjega tati gwawu. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Nawalishera kuusu ulunda wawu, toziya semu iherepa kuliku zoseri muisi ya Misri, hayiweri yawu.”<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Su wana wa Israeli watenda ntambu yawalagaliritwi. Yufusu kawapanana mbutuka za kukweguwa pamuhera na shiboga sha munjira ntambu yakalagaliritiwi na Farao. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Yomberi kawapananiti kila yumu nguwu zingi za kuvala, vulaa kampananiti Benjamini magwala ga mpiya miya ntatu pamuhera na nguwu zingi muhanu za kuvala. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Avi ndo vintu vyakamjegiriti tati gwakuyi mafupu aga kwajili ya mwanja gwakuyi. Kamjegiriti wankanyama punda lilongu yawapapiti vintu viherepa vya Misri, nkanyama punda washidala lilongu yawapapiti viboga na mabumunda na viboga vimonga. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Shakapanu Yusufu kawagambiriti kwahere walongu wakuyi. “Pawaweriti wankuwuka, kawaberiziya pakalonga, namulilewa munjira.”<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Su womberi walawiti Misri na kuwuya ukaya kwa Yakobu tati gwawu muisi ya Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Womberi wamgambiriti tati gwawu, Yusufu kankali mkomu! “Yomberi ndo mkolamlima gwa isi yoseri ya Misri. Palii tati gwawu kalikangashiti nentu, toziya kaweziti ndiri kuvijimira visoweru vyawu.”<verse eid="GEN 45:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Kumbiti womberi pawamgambiriti vyoseri vyawalagaliritwi na Yusufu na pakawoniti mbutuka zyakukwegwa zyakamjegeritwi na Yusufu kumtola, moyu gwakuyi gunemeleriti nentu. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Israeli kalonga, “Vinu njimira mwana gwangu Yusufu kankali mkomu. Hang'endi nikamloli pamberi pa hanehowi.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu na kaya yakuwi wankugenda Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Su Israeli kanjiti mwanja gwakuyi pamuhera na ulunda wakuyi woseri. Pakasokiti Beeri Sheba, yomberi kamlavilira tambiku Mlungu gwa Isaka tati gwakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Mlungu kayoweriti na Israeli mundotu pashiru, kamshema, “Yakobu! Yakobu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">Yakobu kawankula, “Yina! Neni napanu.”<verse eid="GEN 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Mlungu kamgambira, “Neni ndo Mlungu, Mlungu gwa tati gwaku, nagutira kugenda Misri. Paguwera aku hanikutendi guweri na wantu wavuwa. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Neni namweni hang'endi pamuhera na gwenga aku Misri na kukuwuziya aku Kanaani. Yusufu hakaweri na gwenga shaka paguhowa.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Su Yakobu kawukiti Beeri Sheba. Wana wakuyi wamtoliti yomberi na wananguta wawu wadidini pamuhera na wadala wau mumbutuka zyakukwegwa na farasi, zilii Farao zyakazijegiti kumtola. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Womberi watoliti vulaa mifugu yawu pamuhera na ulunda wawu woseri yawaupatiti muisi ya Kanaani, su wagenditi Misri. <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />Yakobu kashitoliti shileri shakuwi shoseri, wana wakuyi na wazukulu wakuyi wapalu na wadala, woseri kagenditi nawu Misri.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Shiyuwuku sha Israeli shashigenditi pamuhera na yomberi waweriti Rubeni shipanta njira wakuyi, <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />pamuhera na wana wa Rubeni, Hanoki na Palu na Hesironi na Karimi. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Simiyoni pamuhera na wananguta wakuyi, Yemueli na Yamini na Ohadi na Yakini na Sohari na Shauli, ulii yakiwuyikiti kwa mdala muntu gwa Kanaani.<verse eid="GEN 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Wana wa Lawi waweriti Gorisheni na Kohati na Merari. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Wana wa Yuda waweriti Eri na Onani na Shela na Peresi na Zera. Kumbiti Eri pamuhera na Onani wahowiti muisi ya Kanaani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:12">Wana wa Peresi waweriti Hesironi na Hamuli.<verse eid="GEN 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Wana wa Isakari waweriti Tola na Puva na Yashubu na Shimironi. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Wana wa Zabuloni waweriti Seredi na Eloni na Yaleeli. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Womberi ndo wana Leya yakamwiwuliriti Yakobu kulii Padan Aramu, pamuhera na Dina muhinga gwakuyi. Wana wakuyi na wahinga wakuyi pamuhera na wazukulu wakuyi waweriti wantu malongu matatu na ntatu.<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Wana wa Gadi waweriti Sifioni na Hagi na Shuni na Esiboni na Eri na Arodi na Areli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Wana wa Asheri waweriti Imina na Ishiva na Ishivi na Beria na Sera dada gwawu. Wana wa Beria waweriti Heberi na Malikieli.<verse eid="GEN 46:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Womberi ndo wananguta wa Zilipa, ulii yakamwiwuliriti Yakobu, Labani yakampananiti muhinga gwakuyi Leya, su woseri waweriti wantu lilongu na sita.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Raheli kamwiwuliriti Yakobu wana wawili. Yusufu na Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Aku Misri, Asenati muhinga gwa Potifera, ulii yakaweriti mtambika gwa lushi lwa Oni, yomberi kamwiwuliriti Yusufu wana wawili, Manasi na Efraimu.<verse eid="GEN 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Wana wa Benjamini waweriti Bela na Bekeri na Ashibeli na Gera na Naamani na Ehi na Roshi na Mupimuna na Hupimu na Aridi. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Womberi ndo wananguta wa Raheli yakamwiwuliriti Yakobu. Woseri waweriti wantu lilongu na msheshi.<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Dani pamuhera na Hushimu mwana gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Wana wa Nafutali waweriti Yaseeli na Guni na Yeseri na Shilemu. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Womberi waweriti wananguta wa Biliha, ulii yakamwiwuliriti Yakobu, yaya mdala Labani yakampananiti Raheli muhinga gwakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Wantu woseri yawagenditi Misri pamuhera na Yakobu, walii yawaweriti wantu wa shileri shakuwi, pota kuwalanga wamikamwana wakuyi, womberi waweriti wantu malongu sita na sita. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Pamuhera na wananguta wawili, Yusufu yakawapatiti aku Misri, woseri wa shileri sha Yakobu shashigenditi Misri, waweriti wantu malongu saba.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu kankusoka Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Su Yakobu kamlonguziya Yuda kugenda kwa Yusufu kumluwa waliwoni aku lushi lwa Gosheni. Womberi pawasokiti mlushi lwa Gosheni, <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Yusufu kakweniti mbutuka yakuwi ya kukweguwa na farasi, su kagenditi kumwanka Israeli, tati gwakuyi aku lushi lwa Gosheni. Pakasokiti kwa tati gwakuyi, yomberi kamkisikiliti na kaliriti nentu.<verse eid="GEN 46:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Israeli kamgambiriti Yusufu, “Vinu nakala kuhowa, toziya nikuwona na kuvimana kuwera gwankali mkomu.”<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Yusufu kawagambiriti walongu wakuyi na woseri wa kaya ya tati gwakuyi, “Nankugenda kumgambira Farao, walongu wangu na kaya ya tati gwangu, yawaweriti muisi ya Kanaani wiza kwaneni. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Wantu awa ndo walolera wa wankanyama, wiza na vipinga vikulu vya wakondolu na wambuzi na wang'ombi pamuhera na kila shintu shawaweriti nashi.’ <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Su Farao pakawashema na kuwakosiya, hashi, mwenga mtenda lihengu gaa? <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />Mwenga mumwankuli, twenga wantumintumi waku, twawalolera wa wankanyama kwanjira uwana mpaka leru, toziya ndo ntambu yawaweriti watati wetu. Mtakuli ntambu ayi su mpati ulekeziwu wa kulikala mlushi lwa Gosheni.” Yusufu kalongiti hangu, toziya walolera woseri wa wankanyama wawera nkalaliru kwa wantu wa Misri.<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Yusufu kagenditi kwa Farao, kamgambira, “Tati gwangu na walongu wangu pamuhera na wakondolu na wang'ombi na ulunda wawu woseri, wasoka kulawa isi ya Kanaani. Vinu wa aku mkowa gwa Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Yusufu kawasyaguliti walongu wakuyi muhanu kawamaniziya kwa Farao.<verse eid="GEN 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Farao kawakosiya womberi, “Mwenga mtenda lihengu gaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Womberi wamwankula, “Twenga wantumintumi waku twawalolera wa wankanyama ntambu yawaweriti wambuyi wetu.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Shakapanu womberi wamgambira Farao, “Twenga wantumintumi waku twiza kulikala gambira wahenga muisi amu toziya kwana njala nkulu aku Kanaani na kwahera maliziyu ga wankanyama wetu. Su vinu twankulwa guwalekeziyi wantumintumi waku walikali mumkowa gwa Gosheni.”<verse eid="GEN 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Farao kamgambiriti Yusufu, “Tati gwaku na walongu waku wakwizira gwenga. <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />Isi yoseri ya Misri yapasi paku, su guwapanani tati gwaku na walongu waku semu iherepa ya isi ayi. Guwaleki walikali mumkowa gwa Gosheni. Handa paguwamana woseri yawawera waminika, guwatuli waweri wagolokera wa wankanyama waweni.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Shakapanu, Yusufu kamjega Yakobu tati gwakuyi kamlamsiyi Farao na Yakobu kampananiti Farao matekeleru gakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Farao kamkosiya Yakobu, “Hashi, gwana mivinja mininga?”<verse eid="GEN 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Yakobu kamwankula, “Mivinja yaweriti nayi gambira muntu gwa mwanja ndo mivinja miya yimu na malongu matatu. Mivinja ayi ivuwa ndiri na imemiti ntabiku, kayi hayenisoki mivinja yawalikaliti wagogolu wangu gambira wantu wa kuyerayera.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Su Yakobu kampeteriti mashi Farao, shakapanu kawukiti kulongolu kwa Farao.<verse eid="GEN 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Shakapanu Yusufu kawapananiti tati gwakuyi pamuhera na walongu wakuyi semu iherepa nentu mlushi lwa Ramesesi muisi ya Misri, paweri pahala pawu pa kulikala na womberi wapahaliti ntambu yailagaliritwi na Farao. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Yusufu kaweriti kankuwapanana shiboga tati gwakuyi na walongu wakuyi pamuhera na kaya yoseri ya tati gwakuyi kulawirana na mawalangu ga wantu yawawatumbiriti.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Yusufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Shakapanu shiboga shipeliti nakamu muisi yoseri. Njala iweriti nkulu nentu, su iwatenditi wantu woseri muisi ya Misri na isi ya Kanaani wayonda. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Yusufu kajojoniriti mpiya zoseri zyazilawirana na kushuwuza viboga aku Misri na Kanaani, yomberi kazijegiti kunumba nkulu ya shifalumi ya Farao. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Mpiya za wantu wa Misri na Kanaani paziperiti, wantu woseri wa Misri wamwiziliti Yusufu na kumgambira, “Gutupanani shiboga. Hashi, kwa shishi tuhowi palongolu pa masu gaku? Guloli vinu mpiya zetu zipera.”<verse eid="GEN 47:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Yusufu kawagambira, “Mjegi wankanyama wenu, haniwashuwuziyi viboga kwa kugalambuziyana na wankanyama, tembera mpiya za mwenga zipera.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Su womberi wamjegiriti Yusufu wankanyama wawu. Nayomberi kawapananiti shiboga kwa kugalambuziyana na wang'ombi na wakondolu na wambuzi na wankanyama punda wawu. Mushinja ashi shoseri Yusufu kawapananiti shiboga kwa kugambuliziyana na mifugu yawu yoseri.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Shinja shilii shashipeliti, womberi wamwiziliti kayi na kumgambira, “Hapeni tufifi unakaka kulongolu kwa mtuwa gwetu kuwera mpiya zyetu zipera na wankanyama wetu wawera ulunda waku. Vinu kwahera shoseri shashisigaliti kwajili ya mtuwa gwetu kumbiti twenga tuweri wamanda waku pamuhera na isi yetu. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Yashishi twenga tuhowi palongolu pa masu gaku, twenga pamuhera na isi yatwenga? Su gutuhemeri twenga pamuhera na isi yatwenga, hatuweri wamanda wa Farao. Gutupanani mbeyu su tulikali natwiza kuhowa, isi yatwenga naiza kuwera ushiwa.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Su Yusufu kahemera isi yoseri ya Misri iwera ulunda ya Farao. Kila muntu gwa Misri kashuwuziti lirambu lyakuyi, toziya njala iweriti nkulu nentu. Isi iweriti ulunda wa Farao, <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Yusufu kawatenditi wantu waweri wamanda kulawa uwega wumu wa Misri mpaka uwega umonga. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Pamuhera na hangu, yomberi kahemeriti ndiri isi ya watambika, toziya womberi waweriti wankupata semu yawu kulawirana na semu yawapananitwi na Farao. Su womberi washuwuziti ndiri isi yawu.<verse eid="GEN 47:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Shakapanu Yusufu kawagambiriti wantu, “Mloli, niwahemerani kala woseri mwenga pamuhera na malambu genu kuwera ulunda wa Farao. Hampananwi mbeyu, mwenga hamugayali malambu genu. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Kumbiti mushaka sha kubenanga viboga, mwenga mumpanani Farao semu yimu pa semu za muhanu. Semu za msheshi zyazisigariti hamuzituli kuwera mbeyu kwajili ya malambu na kwajili ya shiboga shenu maweni mwenga pamuhera na wantu wa kaya yenu pamuhera na wana wenu.” <verse eid="GEN 47:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Womberi wamwankula, “Mtuwa, gugalopola makaliru getu! Toziya gutulanguziya maheri gaku, twenga hatuweri wamanda wa Farao.”<verse eid="GEN 47:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Su Yusufu katuliti liweri lilagaliru muisi ya misri, lilagaliru ali liwera mpaka leru kuwera semu yimu pa semu za muhanu za viboga haziweri za Farao. Isi ya watambika hera iweriti ndiri ya Farao.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagaliru ga upeleru ga Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Su wantu wa Israeli walikali mumkowa gwa Gosheni muisi ya Misri. Pawawera aku, womberi wapata ulunda uvuwa na wongerekiti nentu.<verse eid="GEN 47:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Yakobu kalikaliti muisi ya Misri mivinja lilongu na saba, mpaka pakasokiti mivinja miya na malongu msheshi na saba.<verse eid="GEN 47:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Shaka sha kuhowa kwakuyi pashiweriti pakwegera, Yakobu kamshemiti Yusufu mwana gwakuyi na kamgambira, “Vinu handa nakaka gunfira, gutuli liwoku lyaku mumawondu gangu, gulagili kuwera haguntenderi kwa ligoya na uheri nagunfindira aku Misri. <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />Kumbiti gumfindiri pamuhera na wambuyi waneni, guntoli kulawa Misri, gwakamfindiri mumapumba gawu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Yusufu kamwankula, hantendi ntambu yagutakuliti.<verse eid="GEN 47:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Yakobu kamgambira Yusufu, gundapili! “Yusufu kamlapira. Shakapanu Israeli kamguwiriti Mlungu mumtuwi mwa mulisaga lyakuyi.”<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu kankuwapetera mashi Manasi na Efraimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />“Pa aga, Yusufu wamgambiriti kuwera tati gwaku kalwala. Su kawatoliti wana wakuyi wawili, manasi pamuhera na Efraimu, kagenditi nawu kwa tati gwakuyi.” <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />“Yakobu pawamgambiriti, mwana gwaku Yusufu kiza kukuwona, yomberi kalikamziya kwimuka na kalivagiti mulisaga.”<verse eid="GEN 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Yakobu kamgambiriti Yusufu, “Mlungu yakana makakala kandawiriti kulii paweriti Luzu muisi ya Kanaani, kantekeleriti. <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />Kang'ambiriti, guloli, hanikutendi guweri na shiyiwuku shivuwa na hanikongeri na hanikutendi guweri na wantu wavuwa. Hanikupanani isi guhihali mashaka goseri gwenga pamuhera na shiyiwuku shaku pagwenga. <verse eid="GEN 48:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />Vinu, wana waku wawili, yawiwukiti aku Misri pamberi pa neni kwiza kwa gwenga, hawawalangwi kuwera waneni, Efraimu na Menasi hawaweri waneni gambira Rubeni na Simiyoni ntambu yawaweriti waneni. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Kumbiti wana yagugenda kuwapata shakapanu hawaweri wagwenga. Kumbiti womberi hawashemwi uhala wawu kupitira litawu lya walongu wawu Efraimu na Manasi. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Ntenditi hangu toziya ya mawu gwawu. Paweriti nankuwuya kulawa Padani, muhinginika yaneni, Reheli kahowiti muisi ya Kanaani patuweriti twankugenda mwanja pakwegera kusoka Efrata. Su nimfindiriti aku, mumbwega na njira yaigenda Efrata. Vinu ishemuwa Betilehemu.<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Israeli pakawoniti wana wa Yusufu, kamkosiya, hashi, awa washina gaa?<verse eid="GEN 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Yusufu kamwankula tati gwakuyi, awa wana wangu Mlungu yakampananiti pawera panu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Israeli kalonga, shondi shondu, guwajegi pakwegera mpati kuwapetera mashi.”<verse eid="GEN 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Masu ga Israeli gaweriti gawona weri ndiri toziya ya ugogolu. Su Yusufu kawajega womberi pakwegera na tati gwakuyi, yomberi kawanonera na kuwakisikira.<verse eid="GEN 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Shakapanu Israeli kamgambiriti Yusufu, “Neni holiti ndiri kushiwona sheni shaku kayi, kumbiti Mlungu kantenda wezi kuwawona wana waku vilaa.”<verse eid="GEN 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Su Yusufu kawawusiya wana wakuyi pamanung'unu ga tati gwakuyi, shakapanu kansuntamira makukama.<verse eid="GEN 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Yusufu kawanyasula wana wakuyi wawili, Efraimu muliwoku lyakuyi lya kumliwu na Manasi muliwoku lyakuyi lya kumshigi, pakamlonguziya muliwoku lya kumliwu lya tati gwakuyi, su kawasegiziya pakwegera na mbuyi gwawu. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Kumbiti Israeli kagapingikiti mawoku gakuyi, liwoku lyakuyi lya kumliwu kalitula pampindi pamtuwi gwa Efraimu tembera kaweriti mpusu, na liwoku lyakuyi lya kumshigi kalituliti pamtuwi gwa Manasi yakaweriti shipanta njira.<verse eid="GEN 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Shakapanu Israeli kampeteriti mashi Yusufu, pakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">“Mlungu ulii watati waneni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Abrahamu na Isaka wamjimiliti mumakaliru gawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Mlungu ndo yakawera mlolera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">gwa makaliru gangu goseri mpaka leru.<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />Na ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kanopoliti mumadoda goseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">mweni kawatekeleri wantemba awa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Na washemuwi kwa litawu lyaneni na kwa matawu ga watati wangu Abrahamu na Isaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Womberi wongereki kuwera wavuwa mupasipanu.”<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Yusufu pakawoniti kuwera tati gwakuyi kalitula liwoku lyakuyi pamtuwi gwa Efraimu, yomberi kafiliziwiti ndiri. Su katoliti liwoku lya tati gwakuyi kulawa mumtuwi gwa Efraimu na kugutula pamtuwi gwa Manasi.<verse eid="GEN 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Yusufu kamgambiriti tati gwakuyi, ndala. “Tati ayu ndo shipanta njira. Shondi shondi, gutuli liwoku lyaku lya kumliwu pamtuwi gwakuyi.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Kumbiti tati gwakuyi kalemiti pakalonga, nivimana mwana gwangu, nivimana. “Yomberi vilaa hakaweri na wantu wavuwa, vilaa hakaweri mkulu. Pamuhera na hangu, mpusu gwakuyi hakaweri mkulu kuliku mweni na shileri shakuwi hawaweri wantu wavuwa.<verse eid="GEN 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Su Israeli kawapetiriti mashi lishaka lilii na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:20">wantu wa Israeli hawagatenderi matawu genu kupetera mashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:20">Mlungu kawatendi gambira Efraimu na Manasi.<verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Shakapanu Israeli kamgambiriti Yusufu, neni napakwegera kuhowa, kumbiti Mlungu hakaweri pamuhera na gwenga na hakawawuziyi muisi ya wambuyi wenu. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Pamuhera na hangu, nikupanana gwenga pota walongu waku, pahala pamu kulugongu lwanuwapokiti Waamori patulikomiti ngondu kwa magumba na misali.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu kankuwapetera mashi wanawa kuwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Yakobu kawashemiti wana wakuyi na kulonga, “Mjojoniki pamuhera niwagambiri vitwatira vyavigenda kuwapata mashaka gagiza.<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />Mjojoniki mupikaniri, mwenga wana wa Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:2">Mumpikaniri neni Israeli tati gwenu.<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />Rubeni gwenga shipanta njira wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">likakala lyangu na libwajubwaju lya untemba wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">Gwenga guwapita walongu waku kwa ukulu na likakala.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Gwenga gambira mashi ga lilawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">kumbiti hapeni guweri kayi gwa kwanja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">toziya gugonjiti na mdala gwangu gwa kunja neni tati gwaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">gwenga guligohilira ndiri lisaga lyangu.<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />Simoni na Lawi ndo walongu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:5">magumba gawu wagatendera ukakatala.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Kumbiti neni hapeni ningiri mushotera motu shawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">neni nalikolerana na lipinga lyawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">toziya wawalagiti wantu, kwa maya gawu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">wadumuliti mishipa ya wang'ombi ntambu yawafiriti.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Mpangilira maya gawu toziya gakalipa nentu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">maya gawu gahera lusungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Haniwapalasiyi muisi ya Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">haniwapalasiyi muisi ya Israeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />Gwenga Yuda, walongu waku hawakuzyumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">liwoku lyaku haliweri musingu mwa wankondu waku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Na walongu waku hawasuntami makukama palongolu paku.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Gwenga Yuda, gwenga gambira mwana gwa simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">gwankuwuya kulawa mukugomiziya, mwana gwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Gambira simba gwankunyatira na kugonja pasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">gambira duma gwa shidala, ndo gaa yakawera na likakala, yakajera kumwimusiya?<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Luhonga lwa shifalumi hapeni luwuki kwa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">ama luhonga lwa ukolamlima pamagulu gakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">mpaka kizi ulii yakawera na ukolamlima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">ndo mweni ujimiruwa wa wantu wavuwa hauweri wakuyi.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Hakamtawi nkanyama punda gwakuyi mulizyabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">na mwana gwa punda wakuyi mulizyabibu liherepa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">Kaputaga nguwu zakuwi mudivayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">na mahabiti gakuyi mudivayi njeri.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Masu gakuyi hagaweri masheri kwa divayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:12">menu gakuyi hagaweri mafufu kwa maweri.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />Zaboluni hakalikali semu za kumpwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">kumpwani kwakuyi hakuweri pahala pa kugolosiya uwatu mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Isi yakuwi hayipakani na Sidoni.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />Isakari ndo gambira nkanyama punda yakawera na likakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:14">yakaligonja pakati pa visanka vyakuwi.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Pakawona pahala pa kwoyera ndo paheri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">na isi yakuwi ntambu yaiherepa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">kang'ong'onaziya mgongu gwakuyi kupapa shisanka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">hakajimiri kutenda lihengu lya umanda kwa wantu wamonga.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />Dani hakatozi wantu wakuyi kwa ntambu yakafira Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:16">gambira makabila gamonga ga Israeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Hakaweri handa njoka mnjira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">njoka kana usungu mmbwega mnjira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">yakaluma visukulumbi vya Farasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">na yakakwena pampindi pa Farasi kaguwa lugali.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />Gwee Mtuwa, nankuhepelera gunopoli.<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />Gadi hakakomangwi na wakwepula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:19">kumbiti yomberi hakafati kumbeli na kuwakomanga.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />Shiboga sha Asheri hashiweri shatawi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:20">na yomberi hakalaviyi shiboga shinoga shashimfaa mfalumi.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />Naftali ndo gambira nkanyama mbawala yakawera mlekeru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:21">yakiwula wana waherepa.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />Yusufu ndo gambira mtera gwagulera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">mtera gwagulera mmpeku mumbwiru.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">Mitambi yakuwi ilitanda mushibambaza.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Waguma misali wamugumiti vibaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:23">wamwasiliti misali na kumgaziya nentu.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Kumbiti upindi wakuyi usigala ugangamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">na mawoku gakuyi gapanananitwi makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">kwa Uwezu wa kana Likakala gwa Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">kwa litawu lya mlolera, litalawu lya Israeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Kwa Mlungu gwa tati gwakuyi yakakutanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">kwa Mlungu yakana Likakala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">hakakutekeleri, gupati tekeleru za nvula kulawa kumpindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">tekeleru za mashi ga matiwa yagawera pasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">ashina mawu hawaleri nentu na mifugu hayongereki.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Matekeleru ga tati gwaku zikanki tekelera za vigongu vya mashaka goseri, ziweri ziherepa kuliku vigongu vigona, tekelera azi na ziweri pampindi pa mtuwa gwa Yusufu, pampindi pa sheni shakuwi yomberi yakaweriti wamtula gweka na walongu wakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 49:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />Benjamini ndo liminyi kakalipa, mandawira kaliya vyakawinditi, na pamihi kankugawa vyakalopoliti.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Aga ndo shyanjiru sha makabila lilongu na mbili ga Israeli na avi ndo visoweru vyakawagambiriti tati gwawu pakawapeteriti mashi, pakampananiti kila yumu gwawu tekeleru lyalimfaa.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Shakapanu Israeli kawalagalira wananguta wakuyi hangu, “Neni sambira howa na kufindirwa pagwegera na wambuyi wangu yawahowiti, mulirambu lyakalihemiriti kwa Efroni muntu gwa Hiti, <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />mumpanga lyaliwera mulirambu lya Makapera, pakwegera na mtera gwa Mamire aku Kanaani, lirambu lyalihemiritwi na Abrahamu kulawa kwa Efroni, paweri pahala pa kufindirwa wantu. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Aku ndo kwawafindilitwi Abrahamu pamuhera na mdala gwakuyi, vilaa aku ndo kwawamfindiriti Isaka pamuhera na Rebeka mdala gwakuyi na aku ndo kwawamfindiriti Leya. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Lirambu ali na mpanga lyaliwera amu, lihemilitwi kwa wantu wa Hiti.”<verse eid="GEN 49:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Yakobu pakamaliliti kawalagalira wana wakuyi, kagawuziya magulu gakuyi mulisaga, su kahowa.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Panu Yusufu kamkisikira tati gwakuyi kalira na kumunonera. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Shakapanu Yusufu kawalagalira waganga wakuyi wamtyelemeki migota nakiza kuwola. Womberi watenditi ntambu yawagambiritwi. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Ntambu yaiwera, mashaka malongu msheshi wafiruwitwi kwa lihengu ali. Wamisri pamuhera na womberi wadayiti kuhowa kwa Yakobu kwa shaka malongu saba.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Mashaka ga kudaya pagaperiti, Yusufu kawagambiriti wantu wa kaya ya Farao, “Shondi shondi, mgendi mwakayoweri na Farao kwajili ya neni. Mumgambiri, <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />tati gwangu kandapiriti pakalonga, neni sambira howa, gumfindiri mulisembi lilii lyambawiti namweni muisi ya Kanaani. Vinu nikuluwa gundekeziyi ng'endi nakamsiri tati gwangu, shakapanu hambuyi.”<verse eid="GEN 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Farao kamwankula, “Gugendi gwakamfindiri tati gwaku ntambu yakakulapiziyiti.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Su Yusufu kakweniti kugenda kumfindira tati gwakuyi, wakulu woseri wayaguwi na Farao wagenditi pamuhera na yomberi, wakulu yawamanika wa numba ya Farao pamuhera na wakulu wa isi yoseri ya Misri. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Ntambu iraa ayi, Yusufu kagenditi pamuhera na wantu wa kaya ya tati gwakuyi. Mumkowa gwa Gosheni wasigaliti wananguta wawu na wakondolu na wambuzi na wang'ombi wawu. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Vilaa mbutuka za kukweguwa na farasi pamuhera na wakwena panani pa farasi wagenditi pamuhera na Yusufu. Liweriti lipinga likulu nentu lya wantu.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Pawasokiti muluwaga lwa kupetera viboga lwa Atadi, pakwegera na lushemba Yoridani, womberi waliriti kwa liziwu na utama, Yusufu koyeriti kwa mashaka saba pakadaya shiwembu sha tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Wantu wa Kanaani yawalikaliti aku pawawoniti kudaya kwakutendikiti kuluwaga lwa kupetera viboga walonga, kudaya aku kwa wantu wa Misri kuwera kukulu nentu, “Su pahala palii pashemuwa Abeli Misri. Abeli Misri mana yakuwi madayu ga wantu wa Misri.”<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Wana wa Yakobu wamtenderiti tati gwawu ntambu yakalagaliriti. <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />Womberi wamtoliti kugenda nayu muisi ya Kanaani, wamsiriti mumpanga mulirambu lya Makipela, pakwegera na Mamire, Abrahamu kwakahemiriti kulawa kwa Efroni muntu gwa Hiti, liweri lirambu lya kufindira. <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Pawamsiriti kala tati gwakuyi, Yusufu kawuyiti Misri pamuhera na walongu wakuyi na wantu woseri yawagenditi pamuhera kumfindira tati gwawu.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu kankuwapanana moyu walongu wakuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Walongu wakuyi Yusufu pawawoniti tati gwawu kahowiti kala, “Womberi watakuliti weni kwa weni, pamonga Yusufu hakatukalalili na kutuwuzilira vidoda vyoseri vyatumtendiriti. <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Su womberi wamjegera ujumbi Yusufu pawalonga, tati gwaku, pamberi hakenihowi, kalagaliriti ntambu ayi, <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />Mumgambiri Yusufu hangu. Shondi shondi guwalekeziyi walongu waku vidoda vyawatenditi, toziya wakutendiriti ukondola. Na vinu, tukuluwa guwalekeziyi wantumintumi wa Mlungu gwa tati gwaku. Yusufu kaliliti nentu pakapatiti ujumbi awu.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Shakapanu walongu wakuyi wiziti na kulyasila kulongolu kwakuyi pawalonga, guloli, twenga twawantumintumi waku.”<verse eid="GEN 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Kumbiti Yusufu kawagambira, namtira. “Hashi, neni wera pahala pa Mlungu? <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Mwenga mfiriti kuntendera vidoda kumbiti Mlungu kagatenditi kuwera maheri su wantu wavuwa, wawezi kuwera wakomu ntambu yamuwona leru. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Su namtira. Neni haniwaloleri weri mwenga pamuhera na wananguta wenu. Su kawapanana moyu na kutakula nawu weri.”<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Yusufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Yusufu kendereyiti kulikala muisi ya Misri pamuhera na kaya yoseri ya tati gwakuyi. Yomberi kalikaliti mivinja miya na lilongu <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />na kaweziti kuwawona wana pamuhera na wazukulu wa Efraimu mwana gwakuyi. Vilaa kuwawanka gambira wana wakuyi, wana wa Makili, ulii mwana gwa Manasi.<verse eid="GEN 50:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Shakapanu Yusufu kawagambiriti walongu wakuyi, neni vinu sambira howa. “Kumbiti Mlungu nakaka hakawalawiri na kuwatanga. Hakawalaviyi muisi ayi na kuwawuziya muisi Mlungu yakawalagiliti kuwapanana Abrahamu na Isaka na Yakobu. <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Shakapanu Yusufu kawalapiziyiti wana wa Israeli, pakalonga, Mlungu pakawalawira kuwatanga, mwenga hamgatoli mafupa gangu kulawa aku kugenda kuisi yailagilitwi.” <verse eid="GEN 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Su Yusufu kahowiti kulii Misri, pakawera na mivinja miya na lilongu. Womberi wagaswagiti mauti gakuyi migota nayiwola, su wagatuliti mumashera kulii Misri.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>